maps and weak for games. Remember that no maker\'s warranty covers water, so treat the ratings as insurance. If you want 5G and speed at a similar price, the Redmi 17 5G and Infinix Note 50s are the alternatives.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme C85 Pro costs Rs 36,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme C85 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme C85 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-23 18:15:00','2026-05-23 18:15:00'),(217,6,2,'Realme C85','realme-c85',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-c85.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme C85 costs <strong>Rs 39,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 24 May 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8 inches IPS LCD, 144Hz, 1200 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm). The Li-Po 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: 50MP, f/1.8, 1/2.88” PureCel sensor. It is rated IP68 / IP69K for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-c85-5g\">Realme C85 5G</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/poco-m8s\">POCO M8s</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=realme-c85&g2=realme-c85-5g\">compare the Realme C85 with the Realme C85 5G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme C85 costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme C85 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme C85 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-23 18:15:00','2026-05-23 18:15:00'),(218,6,2,'Realme C85 5G','realme-c85-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-c85-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-21','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme C85 5G costs <strong>Rs 39,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. The 8GB/256GB version costs Rs 44,999. It launched in Nepal on 21 August 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8 inches IPS LCD, 144 Hz, 1200 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 6300 (6 nm). The Li-Ion 7000 mAh battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF, 1/2.96” sensor. It is rated IP68 / IP69K for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/poco-m8s\">POCO M8s</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/vivo-y32\">Vivo Y32</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=realme-c85-5g&g2=poco-m8s\">compare the Realme C85 5G with the POCO M8s</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme C85 5G starts at Rs 39,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 39,999 for 8GB\\/128GB; Rs 44,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme C85 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 21 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme C85 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 6300 (6 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C85 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 7000 mAh; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-20 18:15:00','2026-08-20 18:15:00'),(219,6,2,'Realme P3','realme-p3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,44999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-14','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The P3 is what happens when a brand spends its budget on the processor and battery and leaves the rest alone. The Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 is quick for the price, the AMOLED is bright, 6,000mAh lasts well past a day, and the body resists water jets.</p>\n<p>Cameras are daylight-only and the software arrives with more apps than anyone asked for. If photographs come first, the Redmi Note 15 5G is better. If you want a phone that stays smooth through a semester of games, buses and group chats for about Rs 45,000, the P3 is one of the two or three to look at.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme P3 costs Rs 44,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme P3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 June 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme P3 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 6000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-06-13 18:15:00','2026-06-13 18:15:00'),(220,6,2,'Realme P4 4G','realme-p4-4g',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,45999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-26','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme P4 4G costs <strong>Rs 45,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 26 October 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 1600 nits (HBM), 4500 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 4G (6nm). The Si/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, 27mm, PDAF. It is rated IP66 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/motorola-edge-50-fusion\">Motorola Edge 50 Fusion</a> (Rs 46,499) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a17-5g\">Samsung Galaxy A17 5G</a> (Rs 44,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=realme-p4-4g&g2=motorola-edge-50-fusion\">compare the Realme P4 4G with the Motorola Edge 50 Fusion</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P4 4G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme P4 4G costs Rs 45,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme P4 4G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 26 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme P4 4G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 4G (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P4 4G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-25 18:15:00','2026-10-25 18:15:00'),(221,6,2,'Realme 16','realme-16-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-16-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,64999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-09','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme 16 costs <strong>Rs 64,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 9 October 2026. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.57 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 1000 nits (typ), 1400 nits (HBM), 4500 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 6400 Turbo (6nm). The Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 60W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF, 1/2.93” sensor + Depth: 2MP. It is rated IP66 / IP68 / IP69 / IP69K for dust and water. Software su