e?category=mobile&g1=realme-p3-ultra&g2=infinixgt-30-pro\">compare the Realme P3 Ultra with the Infinix GT 30 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P3 Ultra price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme P3 Ultra costs Rs 65,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme P3 Ultra launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 June 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme P3 Ultra use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Dimensity 8350 Ultra (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme P3 Ultra battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 6000 mAh, non-removable; 80W SUPERVOOC Charging; 5W reverse wired.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-06-13 18:15:00','2026-06-13 18:15:00'),(223,6,2,'Realme 15 Pro','realme-15-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,66999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-18','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme 15 Pro costs <strong>Rs 66,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. The 12GB/512GB version costs Rs 71,999. It launched in Nepal on 18 November 2025. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8 inches AMOLED, 144Hz, 1800 nits (HBM), 6500 nits (Peak) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4nm). The Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 80W wired. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, 24 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.56” sensor + Ultrawide: 50MP, f/2.0, 16 mm, PDAF, 116˚ FOV, 1/2.88\" sensor. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. Software support: up to 3 major Android upgrades.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/infinixgt-30-pro\">Infinix GT 30 Pro</a> (Rs 65,999) and the <a href=\"/products/tecno-camon-slim\">Tecno Camon Slim</a> (Rs 65,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=realme-15-pro&g2=infinixgt-30-pro\">compare the Realme 15 Pro with the Infinix GT 30 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme 15 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme 15 Pro starts at Rs 66,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 66,999 for 12GB\\/256GB; Rs 71,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme 15 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 18 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme 15 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme 15 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 80W wired.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-17 18:15:00','2025-11-17 18:15:00'),(224,4,2,'OnePlus Nord CE5','oneplus-nord-ce-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,59999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OnePlus Nord CE5 costs <strong>Rs 59,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 8 July 2025. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.77 inches Fluid AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1300 nits (HBM), 1430 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 8350 Apex (4nm). The Si-Ca 7100 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, 24 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.95” LYT-600 sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 16 mm, 112° FOV, 1/4.0\"OV08D10 sensor. It is rated IP65 for dust and water. Software support: 4 years of OS updates; 4 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/poco-x7-pro\">Poco X7 Pro</a> (Rs 59,999) and the <a href=\"/products/tecno-pova-8\">Tecno Pova 8</a> (Rs 59,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=oneplus-nord-ce-5&g2=poco-x7-pro\">compare the OnePlus Nord CE5 with the Poco X7 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord CE5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus Nord CE5 costs Rs 59,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Nord CE5 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 8 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Nord CE5 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 8350 Apex (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord CE5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 7100 mAh, non-removable; 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-07-07 18:15:00','2025-07-07 18:15:00'),(225,4,2,'OnePlus Nord CE6','oneplus-nord-ce-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,74999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-05','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>OnePlus built the Nord CE 6 around endurance: 7,500mAh, 80W charging and a chip that sips power. Add a smooth 144Hz AMOLED and tidy OxygenOS, and you have a phone that can be ignored for a day and a half at a time.</p>\n<p>At about the same price the older Nord 5 has a faster processor and a far better selfie camera, so decide whether battery or speed matters more. The single 8GB/256GB version keeps the choice simple. Confirm that a charger is included, and buy an official unit, because imported OnePlus phones carry no Nepali warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord CE6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus Nord CE6 costs Rs 74,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Nord CE6 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Nord CE6 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord CE6 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"7, 500mAh, non-removable; 80W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-04 18:15:00','2026-10-04 18:15:00'),(226,4,2,'OnePlus Nord 5','oneplus-nord-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,73999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Video callers and vloggers should try the Nord 5 before anything else. Its 50MP front camera has autofocus and records in 4K, something phones at twice the price often lack. A Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 and a 144Hz screen make the rest feel fast.</p>\n<p>Check whether a charger is included, because the 80W brick is sold separately in many boxes. IP65 covers rain only, and there is no telephoto. The 12GB/512GB version is worth its small premium. <a href=\"/reviews/oneplus-nord-5-review-nepal\">Our review</a> compares it with the newer CE 6 and Nord 6.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord 5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus Nord 5 starts at Rs 73,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 73,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 79,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Nord 5 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 8 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Nord 5 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord 5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6800mAh, non-removable; 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-07-07 18:15:00','2025-07-07 18:15:00'),(227,4,2,'OnePlus 13s','oneplus-13s',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,119999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-05','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OnePlus 13s costs <strong>Rs 1,19,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2026. That is flagship money, so the camera system, the chip and the build quality all need to justify it.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.32 inches LTPO AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm). Its Si-Ca 5850 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging, 5W reverse wired. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, 24 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.56” LYT-700 sensor + Telephoto: 50MP, f/2.0, 2x optical zoom, OIS, PADF. It is rated IP65 for dust and water. Software support: 4 years of OS updates; 6 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-fe\">Samsung Galaxy S26 FE</a> (Rs 1,24,999) and the <a href=\"/products/oppo-find-x9-pro\">OPPO Find X9 Pro</a> (Rs 1,25,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=oneplus-13s&g2=samsung-galaxy-s26-fe\">compare the OnePlus 13s with the Samsung Galaxy S26 FE</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus 13s price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus 13s costs Rs 1,19,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus 13s launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus 13s use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus 13s battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 5850 mAh, non-removable; 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging; 5W reverse wired.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-04 18:15:00','2026-10-04 18:15:00'),(228,38,2,'HONOR CHOICE T10','honor-choice-t10',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-choice-t10.webp',NULL,NULL,16499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-09-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HONOR CHOICE T10 costs <strong>Rs 16,499</strong> in Nepal for the 3GB/32GB model. The 4GB/64GB version costs Rs 19,499. It launched in Nepal on 28 September 2026. At this price the job is simple: calls, messaging, social apps and a battery that lasts the day.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.75 inches IPS LCD, 450 nits (typ) screen and runs on the UNISOC T615 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 10W charging. Cameras: Primary: 13MP. It is rated IP52 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/blackview-wave-7c\">Blackview Wave 7C</a> (Rs 16,999) and the <a href=\"/products/zte-a37e\">ZTE A37e</a> (Rs 15,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-choice-t10&g2=blackview-wave-7c\">compare the HONOR CHOICE T10 with the Blackview Wave 7C</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HONOR CHOICE T10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HONOR CHOICE T10 starts at Rs 16,499 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 16,499 for 3GB\\/32GB; Rs 19,499 for 4GB\\/64GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HONOR CHOICE T10 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 September 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HONOR CHOICE T10 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the UNISOC T615 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the HONOR CHOICE T10 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh; 10W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-27 18:15:00','2026-09-27 18:15:00'),(229,38,2,'Honor Play 10','honor-play10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-21','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Play 10 costs <strong>Rs 20,999</strong> in Nepal for the 3GB/64GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 22,999. It launched in Nepal on 21 September 2025. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.74 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 10W Charging. Cameras: 13MP, f/2.2. It is rated IP52 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/blackview-bv4800-se\">Blackview BV4800 SE</a> (Rs 20,999) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-x5c\">Honor X5c</a> (Rs 20,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-play10&g2=blackview-bv4800-se\">compare the Honor Play 10 with the Blackview BV4800 SE</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Play 10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Play 10 starts at Rs 20,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 20,999 for 3GB\\/64GB; Rs 22,999 for 4GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Play 10 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 21 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor Play 10 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Play 10 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 10W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-09-20 18:15:00','2025-09-20 18:15:00'),(230,38,2,'Honor X5c','honor-x5c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x5c.webp',NULL,NULL,20499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-19','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X5c costs <strong>Rs 20,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal on 19 February 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.74 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W charging. Cameras: Primary: 13MP, f/2.2, PDAF + Auxiliary lens. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-a7-4g\">Redmi A7 4G</a> (Rs 20,499) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-bv4800-se\">Blackview BV4800 SE</a> (Rs 20,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x5c&g2=redmi-a7-4g\">compare the Honor X5c with the Redmi A7 4G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5c price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X5c costs Rs 20,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X5c launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 19 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X5c use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5c battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable; 15W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-18 18:15:00','2026-02-18 18:15:00'),(231,38,2,'Honor X5c Plus','honor-x5c-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x5c-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,22499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-19','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X5c Plus costs <strong>Rs 22,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 19 February 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.74 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W charging. Cameras: Primary: 50 MP, f/1.8, PDAF + Auxiliary lens. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-go-3\">Tecno Spark Go 3</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-note-80\">Realme Note 80</a> (Rs 21,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x5c-plus&g2=tecno-spark-go-3\">compare the Honor X5c Plus with the Tecno Spark Go 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5c Plus price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X5c Plus costs Rs 22,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X5c Plus launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 19 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X5c Plus use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5c Plus battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable; 15W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-18 18:15:00','2026-02-18 18:15:00'),(232,38,2,'Honor X5d','honor-x5d',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x5d.webp',NULL,NULL,25499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X5d costs <strong>Rs 25,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal on 7 August 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.74 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W charging. Cameras: Primary: 13MP, f/2.2, AF + Auxiliary lens. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a07\">Samsung Galaxy A07</a> (Rs 25,499) and the <a href=\"/products/zte-nubia-a77\">ZTE Nubia A77</a> (Rs 25,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x5d&g2=samsung-galaxy-a07\">compare the Honor X5d with the Samsung Galaxy A07</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5d price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X5d costs Rs 25,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X5d launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X5d use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X5d battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable; 15W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-06 18:15:00','2026-08-06 18:15:00'),(233,38,2,'Honor X6c','honor-x6c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x6c.webp',NULL,NULL,26999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X6c costs <strong>Rs 26,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. The top 6GB/256GB version costs Rs 28,999. It competes in the crowded under-Rs 35,000 bracket, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.61-inch TFT LCD, 120Hz, 1010 nits screen and runs on the MediaTek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). Power comes from a 5300 mAh battery with 35W wired charging. Expect it to last a full day for most people. On the back you get 50MP + QVGA depth, and the selfie camera is 5MP. It is rated IP64 for dust and water, which helps in monsoon rain. Note that this is a 4G phone. That is fine on NTC and Ncell today, but it will not use 5G where it is available. It ships with MagicOS 9 on Android 15.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x6c-4g\">Honor X6C 4G</a> (Rs 26,999) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-15-4g\">Redmi 15 4G</a> (Rs 27,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x6c&g2=honor-x6c-4g\">compare the Honor X6c with the Honor X6C 4G</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 26 October 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6c price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X6c starts at Rs 26,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 26,999 for 6GB\\/128GB; Rs 28,999 for 6GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X6c use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the Honor X6c battery?\",\"answer\":\"It has a 5300 mAh battery with 35W wired charging.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Honor X6c a 5G phone?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a 4G phone.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-10-26\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-25 18:15:00','2026-10-25 18:15:00'),(234,38,2,'Honor X6d','honor-x6d',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x6d.webp',NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The X6d is Honor\'s inexpensive 5G phone, with a Dimensity 6300 that is a class above the Helio chips in its siblings. It opens apps briskly enough and has the room of 128GB.</p>\n<p>The screen, at 90Hz and modest brightness, and the 15W charging remind you of the price. With 4GB of memory it is for one task at a time. Unless 5G is the point, the X7d offers more memory and storage for Rs 4,000 extra. <a href=\"/reviews/honor-x6d-review-nepal\">Our review</a> has more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6d price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X6d costs Rs 29,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X6d launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X6d use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 6300 (6 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6d battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5260 mAh, non-removable; 15W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-06 18:15:00','2026-08-06 18:15:00'),(235,38,2,'Honor X6e','honor-x6e',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x6e.webp',NULL,NULL,32999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X6e costs <strong>Rs 32,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/128GB model. The 4GB/256GB version costs Rs 34,999. It launched in Nepal on 6 October 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.61 inches TFT LCD, 120Hz, 1010 nits (Peak) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). The Si/C Li-Po 7500 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W HONOR SuperCharge, 7.5W Reverse Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP f/1.8, AF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/vivo-y31d\">Vivo Y31d</a> (Rs 32,999) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-17-4g\">Redmi 17 4G</a> (Rs 32,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x6e&g2=vivo-y31d\">compare the Honor X6e with the Vivo Y31d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6e price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X6e starts at Rs 32,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 32,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 34,999 for 4GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X6e launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X6e use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6e battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Po 7500 mAh, non-removable; 45W HONOR SuperCharge; 7.5W Reverse Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-05 18:15:00','2026-10-05 18:15:00'),(236,38,2,'Honor X7d','honor-x7d',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x7d.webp',NULL,NULL,33999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you never delete anything, the X7d is for you. It comes with 8GB and 256GB in the version most shops sell, and 512GB exists, all at a price where rivals offer half. The 108MP camera lets you crop into a school stage in good light.</p>\n<p>You get a 4G chip and an LCD in return, so films and games are better elsewhere. With a 6,500mAh battery and 35W charging it is an unfussy phone for work, family photos and long group chats. The X8d costs Rs 6,000 more and adds a much nicer screen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X7d price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X7d costs Rs 33,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X7d launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X7d use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X7d battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6500 mAh, non-removable; 35W Honor SuperCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-09-14 18:15:00','2025-09-14 18:15:00'),(237,38,2,'Honor X8d','honor-x8d',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x8d.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Thin, light and long-lasting do not often appear in the same sentence. The Honor X8d manages it with a 7,000mAh silicon-carbon battery in a 7.5mm body, and adds an AMOLED bright enough for midday in the Terai. A memory card slot is a bonus for people who keep films on the phone.</p>\n<p>The catch is a 4G processor meant for everyday work. Reels, office apps and video are fine, demanding games are not. If you have no plans for 5G in the next few years, it is one of the most comfortable phones near Rs 40,000. <a href=\"/reviews/honor-x8d-review-nepal\">Our review</a> has the trade-offs.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X8d price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X8d starts at Rs 39,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 39,999 for 8GB\\/128GB; Rs 43,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X8d launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 8 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X8d use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s 4G Gen 2 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X8d battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable; 45W HONOR SuperCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-07 18:15:00','2026-04-07 18:15:00'),(238,38,2,'Honor X7e','honor-x7e',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x7e.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-09-03','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X7e costs <strong>Rs 39,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 3 September 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.61 inches TFT LCD, 120Hz, 1010 nits (Peak) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). The Si/C Li-Po 7500 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W HONOR SuperCharge, 5W Reverse Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP f/1.8, AF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-c85-5g\">Realme C85 5G</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/poco-m8s\">POCO M8s</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x7e&g2=realme-c85-5g\">compare the Honor X7e with the Realme C85 5G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X7e price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X7e costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor X7e launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 September 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X7e use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X7e battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Po 7500 mAh, non-removable; 45W HONOR SuperCharge; 5W Reverse Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-02 18:15:00','2026-09-02 18:15:00'),(239,38,2,'Honor 600 Lite','honor-600-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-600-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,54999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-26','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor 600 Lite costs <strong>Rs 54,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 26 April 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.6 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 2000 nits (HBM), 6500 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7100 Elite (6nm). Its Li-Po 6520 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W HONOR SuperCharge. Cameras: Primary: 108MP, f/1.8, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.67” sensor + Ultrawide: 5MP, f/2.2. It is rated IP66 for dust and water. Software support: 6 years of OS updates; 6 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x9d\">Honor X9d</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-3a-lite\">Nothing Phone 3a Lite</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-600-lite&g2=honor-x9d\">compare the Honor 600 Lite with the Honor X9d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor 600 Lite costs Rs 54,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor 600 Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 26 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor 600 Lite use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7100 Elite (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6520 mAh, non-removable; 45W HONOR SuperCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-25 18:15:00','2026-04-25 18:15:00'),(240,38,2,'Honor 600','honor-600',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-600.webp',NULL,NULL,84999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>There are very few phones this small with a battery this large. The Honor 600 fits 7,000mAh behind a 6.57-inch AMOLED, adds a 200MP stabilised camera and an unusually good 12MP ultra wide, and still slips into a pocket.</p>\n<p>The Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 keeps everything smooth short of hardcore gaming. At Rs 84,999 it competes with faster OnePlus and POCO phones that are considerably bigger. If you have been putting off an upgrade because every phone has become a tablet, hold this one first. Ask about Honor service in your city.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor 600 starts at Rs 84,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 84,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 89,999 for 12GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor 600 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor 600 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 80W Honor SuperCharge; 27W Reverse Wired Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-05-27 18:15:00','2026-05-27 18:15:00'),(241,38,2,'Honor 600 Pro','honor-600-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-600-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,129999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-22','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor 600 Pro costs <strong>Rs 1,29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. The 12GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,49,999. It was announced on 22 April 2026. That is flagship money, so the camera system, the chip and the build quality all need to justify it.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.57 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 8000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm). The Si/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 80W Honor SuperCharge, 27W Reverse Wired Charging, 50W wireless. Cameras: Primary: 200MP, f/1.9, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.4” sensor + Telephoto: 50MP, f/2.8, 80mm, 3.5x optical zoom, OIS, PDAF + Ultrawide: 12MP, f/2.2, 112° FOV. It is rated IP68/IP69,/IP69K for dust and water. Software support: 6 years of OS updates; 6 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/google-pixel-10\">Google Pixel 10</a> (Rs 1,28,000) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17e\">iPhone 17e</a> (Rs 1,32,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-600-pro&g2=google-pixel-10\">compare the Honor 600 Pro with the Google Pixel 10</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor 600 Pro starts at Rs 1,29,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,29,999 for 12GB\\/256GB; Rs 1,49,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor 600 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor 600 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 80W Honor SuperCharge; 27W Reverse Wired Charging; 50W wireless.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-21 18:15:00','2026-04-21 18:15:00'),(242,38,2,'Honor Magic V5','honor-magic-v5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-magic-v5.webp',NULL,NULL,266999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Magic V5 costs <strong>Rs 2,66,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal on 7 September 2025. It is one of the most expensive phones you can buy in Nepal.</p>\n<p>It has a Inner: 7.95 inches (Foldable), Cover: 6.43 inches Foldable LTPO AMOLED, 120Hz, 5000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm). Its Si-Ca 5820 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 65W Honor SuperCharge, 50W wireless. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.6, 23 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.56” sensor + Ultrawide: 50MP, f/2.0, 13 mm, 122° FOV + Periscope: 64MP, f/2.5, 70 mm, 3x optical zoom, OIS. It is rated IP58 / IP59 for dust and water. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-z-fold-7\">Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 7</a> (Rs 2,59,999) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> (Rs 2,59,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-magic-v5&g2=samsung-galaxy-z-fold-7\">compare the Honor Magic V5 with the Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 7</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Magic V5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Magic V5 costs Rs 2,66,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Magic V5 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor Magic V5 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Magic V5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 5820 mAh, non-removable; 65W Honor SuperCharge; 50W wireless.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-09-06 18:15:00','2025-09-06 18:15:00'),(243,46,2,'Tecno Spark Go 3','tecno-spark-go-3',NULL,'gadgets/2026/tecno-spark-go-3.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-18','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Spark Go 3 costs <strong>Rs 21,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 25,999. It launched in Nepal on 18 January 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.75 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz screen and runs on the Unisoc T7250 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W Charging. Cameras: 13 MP, f/1.8, 27mm, PDAF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of OS udpates; 3 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-note-80\">Realme Note 80</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/infinix-smart-20\">Infinix Smart 20</a> (Rs 21,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-spark-go-3&g2=realme-note-80\">compare the Tecno Spark Go 3 with the Realme Note 80</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark Go 3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Spark Go 3 starts at Rs 21,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 21,999 for 4GB\\/64GB; Rs 25,999 for 4GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Spark Go 3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 18 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Spark Go 3 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7250 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark Go 3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-17 18:15:00','2026-01-17 18:15:00'),(244,46,2,'Tecno Spark 30','tecno-spark-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-10-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Spark 30 costs <strong>Rs 29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 25 October 2024. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 inches IPS LCD, 90Hz, 800 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G91 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 18W Charging. Cameras: Primary: 64MP, PDAF, 1/1.73” CMOS sensor + Auxiliary lens. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of OS udpates; 3 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x6d\">Honor X6d</a> (Rs 29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-50-4g\">Tecno Spark 50 4G</a> (Rs 29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-spark-30&g2=honor-x6d\">compare the Tecno Spark 30 with the Honor X6d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 30 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Spark 30 costs Rs 29,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Spark 30 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 October 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Spark 30 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G91 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 30 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-10-24 18:15:00','2024-10-24 18:15:00'),(245,46,2,'Tecno Spark 50','tecno-spark-50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Spark 50 costs <strong>Rs 29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/128GB model. The top 6GB/128GB version costs Rs 32,999. This is the price range most Nepali buyers shop in, so it has plenty of competition from Redmi, Samsung, realme and Honor.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78-inch IPS LCD, HD+, 120Hz screen and runs on the MediaTek Helio G81 (12nm). The 7000mAh battery with 18W charging is a highlight. That is a very large battery: most people will get a day and a half, and light users two days. On the back you get 50MP main, and the selfie camera is 8MP. Note that this is a 4G phone. That is fine on NTC and Ncell today, but it will not use 5G where it is available. It ships with HiOS 16 on Android 16.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x6d\">Honor X6d</a> (Rs 29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-50-4g\">Tecno Spark 50 4G</a> (Rs 29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-spark-50&g2=honor-x6d\">compare the Tecno Spark 50 with the Honor X6d</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 13 October 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 50 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Spark 50 starts at Rs 29,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 29,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 32,999 for 6GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Spark 50 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the Tecno Spark 50 battery?\",\"answer\":\"It has a 7000mAh battery with 18W charging.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Tecno Spark 50 a 5G phone?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a 4G phone.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-10-13\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-12 18:15:00','2026-10-12 18:15:00'),(246,46,2,'Tecno Spark 40 Pro','tecno-spark-40-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,33999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-11','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Spark 40 Pro spends its money where your eyes are. A 144Hz AMOLED that gets very bright is unusual at Rs 33,999, and with 8GB of memory, 256GB of storage and 45W charging it does not feel like a budget phone in daily use.</p>\n<p>Its Helio G100 is for ordinary apps and lighter games, and the storage is the slower eMMC type, which you notice when installing large apps. HiOS needs its extras removed. For someone whose phone is mostly a screen for reels, films and reading, it is among the best purchases under Rs 40,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 40 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Spark 40 Pro costs Rs 33,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Spark 40 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 11 January 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Spark 40 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 40 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-01-10 18:15:00','2025-01-10 18:15:00'),(247,46,2,'Tecno Pova 6','tecno-pova-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,44990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-12-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Seventy-watt charging in the box and a 6,000mAh battery make the Pova 6 a phone that is never out of action for long. The 120Hz AMOLED is good, storage is generous, and the light-up design has its admirers.</p>\n<p>Inside is a Helio G99, a 4G chip from phones half the price, so players should look at a Realme P3. For video, social apps and quick top-ups between classes it works well. Ask for a discount, as it has been on sale for some time.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova 6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Pova 6 costs Rs 44,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Pova 6 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova 6 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable; 70W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-06 18:15:00','2023-12-06 18:15:00'),(248,46,2,'Tecno Spark 50 Pro','tecno-spark-50-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,47999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-16','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Spark 50 Pro costs <strong>Rs 47,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 inches IPS LCD, 120 Hz, Unspecifeid screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultimate (6nm). Its 6000mAh Li-Po, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 60W. Cameras: 50 MP, PDAF. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-note-17-5g\">Redmi Note 17 5G</a> (Rs 47,999) and the <a href=\"/products/infinix-gt-30\">Infinix GT 30</a> (Rs 46,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-spark-50-pro&g2=redmi-note-17-5g\">compare the Tecno Spark 50 Pro with the Redmi Note 17 5G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 50 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Spark 50 Pro costs Rs 47,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Spark 50 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Spark 50 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Spark 50 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"6000mAh Li-Po, non-removable; 60W.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-15 18:15:00','2026-08-15 18:15:00'),(249,46,2,'Tecno Pova Curve 2','tecno-pova-curve-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,52999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-22','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A curved 144Hz AMOLED and an 8,000mAh battery rarely share a phone. The Pova Curve 2 does it with a slim profile and a look that people either admire or photograph for their friends.</p>\n<p>Performance is mid-range, fine for daily use and moderate gaming, and the secondary camera is decoration. At Rs 52,999 the Honor X9d is tougher and the Realme 14 5G takes better pictures. If the curve and the battery are what you want, nothing else offers both.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova Curve 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Pova Curve 2 costs Rs 52,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Pova Curve 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 22 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Pova Curve 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7100 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova Curve 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-21 18:15:00','2026-04-21 18:15:00'),(250,46,2,'Tecno Pova 8','tecno-pova-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,59999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-16','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Pova 8 costs <strong>Rs 59,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.76 inches IPS LCD, 144 Hz, Unspecifeid screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate (6nm). The 8000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W. Cameras: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/poco-x7-pro\">Poco X7 Pro</a> (Rs 59,999) and the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-nord-ce-5\">OnePlus Nord CE5</a> (Rs 59,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-pova-8&g2=poco-x7-pro\">compare the Tecno Pova 8 with the Poco X7 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova 8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Pova 8 costs Rs 59,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Pova 8 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Pova 8 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Pova 8 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"8000 mAh, non-removable; 45W.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-15 18:15:00','2026-08-15 18:15:00'),(251,46,2,'Tecno Camon Slim','tecno-camon-slim',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,65999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-16','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tecno Camon Slim costs <strong>Rs 65,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 inches AMOLED, 144 Hz screen and runs on the MediaTek Helio G200 Ultimate (6nm). Its Si-Ca 5600mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 60W Ultra Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF. It is rated IP68 / IP69 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/infinixgt-30-pro\">Infinix GT 30 Pro</a> (Rs 65,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-p3-ultra\">Realme P3 Ultra</a> (Rs 65,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=tecno-camon-slim&g2=infinixgt-30-pro\">compare the Tecno Camon Slim with the Infinix GT 30 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Camon Slim price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Tecno Camon Slim costs Rs 65,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Tecno Camon Slim launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Camon Slim use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Helio G200 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Tecno Camon Slim battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 5600mAh, non-removable; 60W Ultra Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-08-15 18:15:00','2026-08-15 18:15:00'),(252,47,2,'Motorola Edge 70 Fusion','motorola-edge-70-fusion',NULL,'gadgets/2026/motorola-edge-70-fusion.webp',NULL,NULL,79999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Edge 70 Fusion costs <strong>Rs 79,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. The 12GB/512GB version costs Rs 89,999. It launched in Nepal on 24 August 2026. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 inches AMOLED, 144Hz, 5, 200 nits (peak) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 4 (4nm). The Si/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 68W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50 MP, f/1.8, PDAF, OIS, 1/1.56\" sensor + Ultrawide: 13MP, f/2.2, 120° FOV, 1/3.0\" sensor. It is rated IP68/IP69 for dust and water. Software support: 3 Major OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-p4-power\">Realme P4 Power</a> (Rs 76,999) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a37-5g\">Samsung Galaxy A37 5G</a> (Rs 74,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=motorola-edge-70-fusion&g2=realme-p4-power\">compare the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion with the Realme P4 Power</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Edge 70 Fusion starts at Rs 79,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 79,999 for 12GB\\/256GB; Rs 89,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 68W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-23 18:15:00','2026-08-23 18:15:00'),(253,47,2,'Motorola Moto G96 5G','moto-g96',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,44999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-23','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Pick up a Moto G96 and you may wonder why it does not cost more. The curved 144Hz pOLED, soft back and 178 gram weight belong to dearer phones, and the stabilised Sony camera takes better indoor photos than most rivals at the price.</p>\n<p>What you give up is stamina and years. The battery suits a normal day and not a travelling one, and Motorola\'s update promise here is short. Service is concentrated in Kathmandu, so ask about screens before buying. For people who enjoy holding their phone, it is still hard to put back on the shelf.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G96 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G96 5G costs Rs 44,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G96 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G96 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 2 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G96 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-ion 5500 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-22 18:15:00','2025-08-22 18:15:00'),(254,47,2,'Motorola Moto G57 Power','moto-g57-power',NULL,'gadgets/2026/moto-g57-power.webp',NULL,NULL,37499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The G57 Power is the Motorola that makes the most practical sense: a modern Snapdragon 6s Gen 4, 7,000mAh, 8GB of memory and near-plain Android 16 for Rs 37,499. It is quick in daily use and goes two days with light owners.</p>\n<p>Its LCD is good rather than beautiful, and the charger must be bought separately. Motorola\'s updates are shorter than Samsung\'s. For people who like clean software and long battery, and live near service, it is one of the strongest choices under Rs 40,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G57 Power price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G57 Power costs Rs 37,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G57 Power launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G57 Power use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G57 Power battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-09 18:15:00','2026-05-09 18:15:00'),(255,47,2,'Motorola Moto G64','moto-g64',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 29,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-04-23','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G64 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 29,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 23 April 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.5 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 560 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7025 (6nm). Its Li-Ion 6000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 30W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, OIS, PDAF + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 118° FOV. It is rated IP52 for dust and water. Software support: 1 years of OS updates; 3 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Motorola alternative is the <a href=\"/products/motorola-moto-g35-5g\">Motorola Moto G35 5G</a> (Rs 30,699).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Motorola Moto G64 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 29,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G64 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 April 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G64 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7025 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G64 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 6000 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2024-04-22 18:15:00','2024-04-22 18:15:00'),(256,47,2,'Motorola Moto G06 Power','moto-g06-power',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,31999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G06 Power costs <strong>Rs 31,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal on 6 May 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.88 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 450 nits (typ), 600 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). The Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 18W charging. Cameras: Primary: 50 MP, f/1.8, PDAF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-p4-lite-4g\">Realme P4 Lite 4G</a> (Rs 31,999) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-17-4g\">Redmi 17 4G</a> (Rs 32,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=moto-g06-power&g2=realme-p4-lite-4g\">compare the Motorola Moto G06 Power with the Realme P4 Lite 4G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G06 Power price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G06 Power costs Rs 31,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G06 Power launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G06 Power use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G06 Power battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 18W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-05 18:15:00','2026-05-05 18:15:00'),(257,36,2,'Nothing Phone 3a Lite','nothing-phone-3a-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-3a-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,54999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-14','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 3a Lite costs <strong>Rs 54,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 14 November 2025. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.77 inches Super AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1300 nits (HBM), 3000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Pro (4nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 33W Fast Charging, 5W Reverse Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, 24 mm, PDAF, 1/1.57” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor + Macro: 2MP. It is rated IP54 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x9d\">Honor X9d</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-600-lite\">Honor 600 Lite</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=nothing-phone-3a-lite&g2=honor-x9d\">compare the Nothing Phone 3a Lite with the Honor X9d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 3a Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 3a Lite costs Rs 54,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 3a Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 3a Lite use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Pro (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 3a Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging; 5W Reverse Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-13 18:15:00','2025-11-13 18:15:00'),(258,36,2,'Nothing Phone 4b','nothing-phone-4b',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-4b.webp',NULL,NULL,64999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 4b brings Nothing\'s calm software and unusual back to a lower price, with a Snapdragon 6 Gen 4, a stabilised main camera and a good AMOLED. For people tired of cluttered phones it is refreshing from the first minute.</p>\n<p>Its problem is its sibling. For Rs 5,000 more the Phone 4a adds a 3.5x periscope zoom and a better chip, and is the model to have. Buy the 4b only if you find it well below list price or have no interest in zoom.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4b price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 4b costs Rs 64,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 4b launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 4b use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4b battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-16 18:15:00','2026-07-16 18:15:00'),(259,36,2,'Nothing Phone 4a Pro','nothing-phone-4a-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-4a-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,109999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-27','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 4a Pro costs <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 27 April 2026. That is flagship money, so the camera system, the chip and the build quality all need to justify it.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.83 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM), 5000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4 nm). Its Li-Ion 5080 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 50W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.57” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor + Telephoto: 50MP, f/2.9, 80 mm, 3.5x optical zoom, OIS, PDAF. It is rated IP65 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-3\">Nothing Phone (3)</a> (Rs 1,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/oppo-reno-16-5g\">OPPO Reno 16</a> (Rs 1,09,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=nothing-phone-4a-pro&g2=nothing-phone-3\">compare the Nothing Phone 4a Pro with the Nothing Phone (3)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4a Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 4a Pro costs Rs 1,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 4a Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 27 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 4a Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4a Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5080 mAh, non-removable; 50W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-26 18:15:00','2026-04-26 18:15:00'),(260,9,3,'Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U)','dell-latitude-14-3450-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-latitude-14-3450-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,62,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,62,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 135U (Intel 4), 12 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.50 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,62,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 135U (Intel 4), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(261,9,3,'Dell Pro 14 PC14250 (Core 5 120U, 16GB/512GB)','dell-pro-14-pc14250-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-pro-14-pc14250-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,127499.00,132499.00,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Pro 14 is the business laptop we\'d hand to someone who needs a reliable machine for the next three years and doesn\'t want to think about it. ONIN Infosys sells the PC14250 for <strong>Rs 1,27,499</strong>, with a <strong>3-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.0GHz) with <strong>16GB of DDR5 in two 8GB modules</strong> (dual channel, and replaceable) and a 512GB NVMe SSD. The 14-inch FHD+ (1920 × 1200) anti-glare display is 300 nits, a good balance for office lighting. It has an FHD webcam and a backlit keyboard.</p>\n<p>The ports suit modern offices: a <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> port with charging, a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort, two USB-A ports (one with PowerShare for charging your phone) and HDMI 2.1. ExpressCharge tops up the 45Wh battery quickly between meetings.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-core-ultra-5-225u\">ThinkPad E14 Gen 7</a>, which also has a 3-year warranty, the Dell Pro 14 is about Rs 77,000 cheaper. The ThinkPad answers with a newer Core Ultra chip and Ethernet.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 14 PC14250 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Pro 14 PC14250 with Core 5 120U, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,27,499 with a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dell Pro 14 have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one Thunderbolt 4 port with Power Delivery, plus a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable on the Dell Pro 14?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It uses two 8GB DDR5 modules.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Pro 14 PC14250 (Core 5 120U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-pro-14-pc14250-core5-120u-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-pro-14-pc14250-core5-120u-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(262,9,3,'Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U)','dell-vostro-15-3530-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-vostro-15-3530-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,14,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,14,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230)</a> (Rs 1,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,14,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(263,9,3,'Dell 15 DC15250 2025','dell-15-dc15250-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-15-dc15250-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,78999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 15 DC15250 2025 costs <strong>Rs 78,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 3 100U, 8GB/512GB model. The Intel i5-1334U, 8GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,08,205. It launched in Nepal in 2026. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 3 100U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.90 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> (Rs 78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)</a> (Rs 78,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-15-dc15250-2025&g2=hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">compare the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 with the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 15 DC15250 2025 starts at Rs 78,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 78,999 for Intel Core 3 100U, 8GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,08,205 for Intel i5-1334U, 8GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 3 100U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(264,9,3,'Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U)','dell-latitude-14-3440-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-latitude-14-3440-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 85,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 85,000</strong>. It was announced in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 60Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.54kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 42Wh Li-ion.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025\">Dell Pro 15 PV15255 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 85,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 85,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(265,9,3,'Dell Pro 15 PV15255 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB/512GB)','dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,86499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Pro 15 is the most affordable Dell on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 86,499</strong>. It has one feature that\'s unusual at this price: a <strong>120Hz</strong> 15.6-inch Full HD screen. Scrolling through long documents and web pages feels noticeably smoother than on the 60Hz panels most budget laptops use.</p>\n<p>Inside is AMD\'s 4-core <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> (8 threads, up to 4.3GHz) with Radeon 610M graphics, 8GB of LPDDR5-5500 (onboard) and a 512GB NVMe SSD. That\'s comfortable for study, office suites and video calls. The anti-glare IPS panel is 250 nits, so it\'s best used indoors.</p>\n<p>Ports are a mixed bag: a USB-A 5Gbps, a USB 2.0, a <strong>data-only</strong> USB-C, HDMI 1.4 and an SD card slot. The 41Wh battery is modest. The Carbon Black finish looks smarter than most budget plastic.</p>\n<p>The 8GB of soldered memory is the long-term limit. If you need more, the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024\">HP 15 with 16GB</a> costs about Rs 13,500 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 15 PV15255 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Pro 15 PV15255 with Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB LPDDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 86,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Dell Pro 15 display?\",\"answer\":\"120Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dell Pro 15 charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. ONIN lists its USB-C port as data-only.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Pro 15 PV15255 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-pro-15-pv15255-ryzen-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-pro-15-pv15255-ryzen-5-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(266,9,3,'Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025)','dell-alienware-16x-aurora-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,494499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) costs <strong>Rs 4,94,499</strong> in Nepal for the Core Ultra 9 275HX · RTX 5070, 16GB/2TB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch WQXGA IPS, 240Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU is comfortable with current games at high settings on the built-in screen.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 4,95,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JMR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 4,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-alienware-16x-aurora-2025&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 15 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) costs Rs 4,94,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-15\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-14 18:15:00','2026-09-14 18:15:00'),(267,8,3,'HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)','hp-notebook-14-ep-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,109999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) costs <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores / 18 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.40 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u\">Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> (Rs 1,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7-carbon-2022-i5-1240p-90hz\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7 Carbon 13IAP7 2022 (Intel Core i5-1240P)</a> (Rs 1,10,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-notebook-14-ep-2024&g2=acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u\">compare the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) with the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) costs Rs 1,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores \\/ 18 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(268,8,3,'HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB)','hp-15-fc0043nq-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,89999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>HP\'s basic 15-inch laptop is a familiar sight in Nepali offices and colleges, and ONIN Infosys stocks it with AMD\'s 4-core <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> in two memory sizes. The <strong>15-fc0196nia with 8GB costs Rs 89,999</strong>, and the <strong>15-fc0043nq with 16GB costs Rs 99,999</strong>. Both have a 512GB NVMe SSD and a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare screen.</p>\n<p>The memory is soldered to the board, so the choice you make at purchase is permanent. Our advice is simple: pay the extra Rs 10,000 for 16GB. It\'s the difference between a laptop that handles a browser full of tabs, Teams and Excel comfortably today and one that feels sluggish in a year or two.</p>\n<p>Both share HP\'s no-nonsense design: about 1.6 kg in silver, a full-size keyboard with number pad, Radeon integrated graphics, two USB-A ports, HDMI and a USB-C that\'s <strong>data-only</strong> (it can\'t charge the laptop or drive a monitor). The 41Wh battery covers a few hours of office work. HP lists the fc0196nia with a backlit keyboard.</p>\n<p>For a more powerful chip at a similar price, see the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-ryzen-7-7730u-8gb\">HP 15 with Ryzen 7 7730U</a>. For more memory and Ethernet, look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u\">Acer Aspire Lite 15</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15 Ryzen 5 7520U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys, the HP 15-fc0196nia (8GB\\/512GB) costs Rs 89,999 and the HP 15-fc0043nq (16GB\\/512GB) costs Rs 99,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the HP 15 Ryzen 5?\",\"answer\":\"No. The LPDDR5 memory is onboard, so choose 8GB or 16GB at purchase.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the HP 15 charge via USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. Its USB-C port is for data only; it charges through HP\'s barrel connector.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-laptop-15-fc0043nq-price-in-nepal-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ddr5-512gb\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB) (edition=15-fc0196nia, ram=8GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-15-ryzen-5-laptop-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-laptop-15-fc0043nq-price-in-nepal-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ddr5-512gb',NULL,2,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(269,8,3,'HP 15-fc0124nia (2024)','hp-15-fc0124nia-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,78999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) costs <strong>Rs 78,999</strong> in Nepal for the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U, 8GB/512GB model. It is a basic machine for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls, not for editing or games.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U. The screen is a 15.6-inch FHD panel. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it will feel tight with many browser tabs open, so look for a model with a free slot or step up to 16GB if you can.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> (Rs 78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-15-dc15250-2025\">Dell 15 DC15250 2025</a> (Rs 78,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-15-fc0124nia-2024&g2=hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">compare the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) with the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 10 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) costs Rs 78,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-10\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-09-09 18:15:00','2026-09-09 18:15:00'),(270,8,3,'HP Pavilion x360 14 (2022)','hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022',NULL,NULL,NULL,N