o keep for several years. At 1.60 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-plus-7440-intel-core-ultra-9-185h\">Dell Inspiron 14 Plus 7440</a> (Rs 1,74,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z13-gen-1-ryzen-7-pro-6850u\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z13 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850U)</a> (Rs 1,75,120). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023&g2=dell-inspiron-14-plus-7440-intel-core-ultra-9-185h\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) with the Dell Inspiron 14 Plus 7440</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs Rs 1,74,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(295,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H)','asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,170905.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) costs <strong>Rs 1,70,905</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.46 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-15-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-4050\">Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-5302 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> (Rs 1,70,000) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-lite-16-2025-13th-gen-i7-13620h-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb\">Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H)</a> (Rs 1,69,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025&g2=acer-nitro-v-15-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-4050\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) with the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-5302 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) costs Rs 1,70,905 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(296,40,3,'Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA','asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa.webp',NULL,NULL,142800.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA costs <strong>Rs 1,42,800</strong> in Nepal for the Snapdragon X Plus, 16GB/1TB model. That is mainstream laptop money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study, with some room for light photo editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon X Plus. The screen is a 15.6-inch 3K OLED panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-oled-x-plus-16gb-1tb-15-6-3k-oled\">Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA-MA004W (Snapdragon X Plus)</a> (Rs 1,42,800) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-gen-4-ryzen-5-7520u\">Lenovo V15 Gen 4 AMN (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 1,41,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa&g2=asus-vivobook-s15-oled-x-plus-16gb-1tb-15-6-3k-oled\">compare the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA with the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA-MA004W (Snapdragon X Plus)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA costs Rs 1,42,800 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon X Plus.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(297,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 / Ryzen 5 40)','asus-vivobook-go-14-e1404fa-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-go-14-e1404fa-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,95499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook Go 14 is ASUS\'s \"go anywhere\" budget laptop. At 1.38 kg with a 14-inch Full HD screen, it\'s light enough for daily commuting, and it has a <strong>backlit keyboard</strong>, which many laptops at this price skip. ONIN Infosys sells two versions with 8GB LPDDR5 and a 512GB SSD: <strong>Ryzen 3 30 at Rs 95,499</strong>, and <strong>Ryzen 5 40 at Rs 1,08,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The two chips are closer than the names suggest. Both have 4 cores and 8 threads. The Ryzen 5 boosts slightly higher (4.3GHz against 4.1GHz). For typing, browsing and video calls you\'ll barely notice the difference. What you are partly paying for is the package: the Ryzen 3 listing carries a <strong>2-year warranty plus a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty</strong> (accidental damage), while the Ryzen 5 listing comes with a free bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>Elsewhere they\'re the same: a 250-nit FHD anti-glare panel, Wi-Fi 6E, a 720p camera with privacy shutter, a 42Wh battery, and USB-C, USB-A, USB 2.0 and HDMI ports. Memory is soldered at 8GB.</p>\n<p>Honestly, if you want the most laptop for the money, the larger <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40\">Vivobook 15 E1504FA</a> has the same Ryzen 5 40 and costs less. The Go 14 wins on portability and that backlit keyboard.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys it costs Rs 95,499 with Ryzen 3 30 and Rs 1,08,499 with Ryzen 5 40, both with 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Ryzen 5 40 much faster than the Ryzen 3 30?\",\"answer\":\"Only slightly. Both are 4-core, 8-thread chips, with a 4.3GHz boost on the Ryzen 5 against 4.1GHz on the Ryzen 3.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Vivobook Go 14 have a backlit keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, both versions have a backlit chiclet keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 \\/ Ryzen 5 40)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-go-e1404-ryzen-3-30-8gb-512gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 \\/ Ryzen 5 40) (edition=Ryzen 5 40, ram=8GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-go-14-ryzen-5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-go-e1404-ryzen-3-30-8gb-512gb-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(298,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)','asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,115900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs <strong>Rs 1,15,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.70 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> (Rs 1,15,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-spin-5-2023-i5-1335u\">Acer Spin 5 A5SP14-51MTN-58HT 2023 (13th Gen i5-1335U)</a> (Rs 1,15,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024&g2=acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">compare the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 1,15,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(299,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP (Core 5 120U, 8GB/256GB)','asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,87000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook 14 X1404VAP is a simple, light laptop with one unusually smart detail for its price: the 8GB of DDR4 sits in an <strong>SO-DIMM slot</strong>, so you can drop in a bigger stick later rather than buy a new laptop. ONIN Infosys sells it in Quiet Blue for <strong>Rs 87,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong>, a 10-core, 12-thread chip that turbos to 5.0GHz. That\'s plenty for Office, Google Workspace, Zoom, Canva and a busy browser. The 14-inch Full HD panel is anti-glare and TÜV Rheinland certified, and at about 1.4 kg it\'s easy to carry to campus or a co-working space. ASUS quotes up to 8 hours of battery from the 42Wh cell. Expect less if you keep brightness high.</p>\n<p>There are two compromises. The 256GB SSD fills up quickly once you install a few apps and keep your photos locally. The screen is a basic 250-nit panel, fine indoors but dim next to a sunny window. Ports cover the essentials: two USB-A 3.2, a USB-C, a USB 2.0 and HDMI. The touchpad doubles as a NumberPad.</p>\n<p>If you\'d rather have 512GB of storage and a bigger screen for similar money, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40\">Vivobook 15 E1504FA</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook 14 X1404VAP with Core 5 120U, 8GB DDR4 and 256GB SSD for Rs 87,000 with a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the Vivobook 14 X1404VAP?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The memory is in an SO-DIMM slot, so it can be replaced with a larger module.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does the battery last?\",\"answer\":\"ASUS rates the 42Wh battery at up to about 8 hours of light use.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP (Core 5 120U, 8GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-core-5-120u-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-core-5-120u-price-in-nepal',NULL,2,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(300,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)','asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,93000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs <strong>Rs 93,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.6 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> (Rs 93,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30\">Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)</a> (Rs 93,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024&g2=msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 93,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(301,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415','asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,89999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 costs <strong>Rs 89,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB/512GB model. That is mainstream laptop money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study, with some room for light photo editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H. The screen is a 14-inch FHD OLED, 60Hz panel. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it will feel tight with many browser tabs open, so look for a model with a free slot or step up to 16GB if you can.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb\">Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB, 512GB, 14\" FHD, 60Hz OLED</a> (Rs 89,999) and the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024\">HP 15-FC0043NQ 2024 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 90,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415&g2=asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb\">compare the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 with the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB, 512GB, 14\" FHD, 60Hz OLED</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 costs Rs 89,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(302,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)','asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,83900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) costs <strong>Rs 83,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2022. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1220P (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, OLED, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.70 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 70 Wh; 90W Adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023\">Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)</a> (Rs 84,000) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U)</a> (Rs 81,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022&g2=lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023\">compare the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) with the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) costs Rs 83,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1220P (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(303,40,3,'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305)','asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ga-2023',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,74999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) costs <strong>Rs 74,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-N305 (Intel 7), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-21pt-2024-ryzen-5-7520u\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-21PT 2024 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 76,000) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> (Rs 72,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ga-2023&g2=acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-21pt-2024-ryzen-5-7520u\">compare the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) with the Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-21PT 2024 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) costs Rs 74,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-N305 (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(304,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U)','asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,70999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs <strong>Rs 70,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.4 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> (Rs 72,990) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ga-2023\">Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305)</a> (Rs 74,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-2023&g2=acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) with the Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs Rs 70,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(305,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,325755.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 3,25,755</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V, 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, 16:10 aspect ratio, 120Hz, 500 nits (HDR peak brightness). 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.20kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: 73 Wh; 65W AC Adapter (Type-C).</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025\">Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 3,24,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025\">compare the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) with the Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs Rs 3,25,755 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V, 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(306,40,3,'ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,275999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If someone asks us for a Windows alternative to the MacBook Air, the Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA is usually the answer. It weighs 1.28 kg, has a 75Wh battery and two <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> ports, and runs Intel\'s 16-core <strong>Core Ultra 7 255H</strong> with <strong>Arc 140T</strong> graphics. That\'s one of the fastest integrated GPUs you can get, with AV1 encode and decode for video work.</p>\n<p>ONIN Infosys lists two versions, and the pricing is a little odd. Read before you choose:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>3K (2880 × 1800) 120Hz OLED touchscreen with a 1TB SSD: Rs 2,75,999.</strong> This is the one to buy. It has the sharper, smoother screen and twice the storage.</li>\n<li><strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200) 60Hz OLED with a 512GB SSD: Rs 2,76,499.</strong> It costs slightly more for a lesser configuration. It only makes sense if the 3K model is out of stock.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both have 16GB of LPDDR5X, <strong>Wi-Fi 7</strong>, Bluetooth 5.4, an IR webcam with a privacy shutter, USB-A, HDMI 2.1, a backlit keyboard with a NumberPad touchpad, and 2 years of international warranty plus a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty. The OLED panels cover 100% DCI-P3 with True Black 500 HDR.</p>\n<p>For the same CPU with a plain IPS screen and a smaller budget, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-core-ultra-7-255h\">Vivobook S14 S3407CA</a>. For an AMD alternative with a touchscreen, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ga\">Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406GA</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys, the Core Ultra 7 255H model costs Rs 2,75,999 with a 3K 120Hz OLED touchscreen and 1TB SSD, or Rs 2,76,499 with a WUXGA 60Hz OLED and 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Which Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA version should I buy?\",\"answer\":\"The 3K 120Hz version with 1TB. It is the better configuration and, at ONIN\'s current prices, slightly cheaper.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA have Wi-Fi 7?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports Wi-Fi 7 (802.11be) and Bluetooth 5.4.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-ultra-7-255h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H) (edition=FHD+ 60Hz OLED, ram=16GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-core-ultra-7-255h-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-ultra-7-255h-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(307,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ka-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ka-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,18,900 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,18,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.2 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-2025-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370\">Asus Vivobook S 15 M5506WA 2025 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370)</a> (Rs 2,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,18,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(308,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445)','asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,275499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) costs <strong>Rs 2,75,499</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 83 Wh; 68W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v\">Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> (Rs 2,78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-premium-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Dell 14 Premium DA14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,80,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v\">compare the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) with the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) costs Rs 2,75,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(309,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) costs <strong>Rs 2,39,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 465 (4nm), 10 cores / 20 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.20 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 68W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-9350-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-512gb-134-fhd\">Dell XPS 13 9350 2024</a> (Rs 2,39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e16-gen-3-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v\">Lenovo ThinkPad E16 Gen 3 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 2,38,450). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026&g2=dell-xps-13-9350-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-512gb-134-fhd\">compare the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) with the Dell XPS 13 9350 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) costs Rs 2,39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 465 (4nm), 10 cores \\/ 20 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(310,40,3,'Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025)','asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,831249.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) costs <strong>Rs 8,31,249</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen AI 9 370 · RTX 5090, 64GB/2TB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 370 with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch 4K OLED panel. 32GB or more of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing, virtual machines and big projects. That is as fast as laptop graphics get, with power to spare for high-refresh 1440p gaming and GPU rendering.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-16-inch-m5-max-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> (Rs 8,33,000) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-max-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> (Rs 7,76,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025&g2=apple-macbook-pro-16-inch-m5-max-2026\">compare the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) with the Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) costs Rs 8,31,249 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 370.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(311,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx608jmr-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx608jmr-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,291649.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) costs <strong>Rs 2,91,649</strong> in Nepal for the Core i7-14650HX · RTX 5050, 16GB/512GB model. The top Core i7-14650HX · RTX 5060, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 3,52,900. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-14650HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 or RTX 5060 (8GB) graphics. The screen is a 16-inch WUXGA, 165Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU handles esports titles and most current games at 1080p with medium settings.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025\">Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H)</a> (Rs 2,89,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,89,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx608jmr-2025&g2=lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) with the Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) starts at Rs 2,91,649 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,91,649 for Core i7-14650HX \\u00b7 RTX 5050, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 3,52,900 for Core i7-14650HX \\u00b7 RTX 5060, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-14650HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 or RTX 5060 (8GB) graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(312,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx607-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx607-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,165600.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) costs <strong>Rs 1,65,600</strong> in Nepal for the Core 5 210H · RTX 3050, 8GB/512GB model. The top Core 5 210H · RTX 4050, 16GB/1TB version costs Rs 1,91,999. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 or RTX 4050 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch WUXGA, 144Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU handles esports titles and most current games at 1080p with medium settings.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb\">Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> (Rs 1,65,600) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP9 2024</a> (Rs 1,65,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx607-2024&g2=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) with the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) starts at Rs 1,65,600 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,65,600 for Core 5 210H \\u00b7 RTX 3050, 8GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,91,999 for Core 5 210H \\u00b7 RTX 4050, 16GB\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (2024) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 or RTX 4050 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(313,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026)','asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,183999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) costs <strong>Rs 1,83,999</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen 7 170 · RTX 4050, 16GB/512GB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 170 with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch FHD+, 144Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU handles esports titles and most current games at 1080p with medium settings.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050\">Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ-RL063WS 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> (Rs 1,83,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-slim-5i-2023-intel-i7-13700h-rtx-4050\">Lenovo Legion Slim 5i 2023 (13th Gen i7-13700H)</a> (Rs 1,84,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-2026&g2=asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) with the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ-RL063WS 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) costs Rs 1,83,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 170.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(314,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS)','asus-tuf-gaming-a15-fa506ncg-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,155999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A sturdy laptop tied to an older graphics chip. The TUF A15 survives hostel life, has a capable Ryzen 7 7445HS and runs Valorant, CS2 and Dota 2 smoothly on its 144Hz screen.</p>\n<p>The RTX 3050 struggles with new releases, and laptops with an RTX 4050 cost only about Rs 11,000 more. Buy this at a real discount or for esports only. <a href=\"/reviews/asus-tuf-gaming-a15-rtx-3050-review-nepal\">Our review</a> works through the numbers.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) costs Rs 1,55,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7445HS (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-02-09 18:15:00','2026-02-09 18:15:00'),(315,40,3,'ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX (Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090)','asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,1338900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Zephyrus Duo is not a normal laptop, and it isn\'t priced like one. It has <strong>two 16-inch 3K OLED touchscreens</strong>. You can use them stacked, side by side, or with a detachable keyboard in front. ONIN Infosys sells the GX651AX for <strong>Rs 13,38,900</strong>, with an ROG backpack and mouse, 2 years of warranty and a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>Who is this for? Video editors who want a timeline on one screen and a preview on the other, traders and analysts watching many charts, streamers running OBS and chat alongside a game, and developers who live in split windows. Both panels are 2880 × 1800 OLED at 120Hz with 100% DCI-P3, Pantone validation and stylus support.</p>\n<p>The hardware is flagship-level. It has Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 9 386H</strong> with a 50 TOPS NPU, an <strong>RTX 5090 Laptop GPU with 24GB</strong>, <strong>64GB of LPDDR5X-8533</strong> and a 1TB SSD. Connectivity includes two Thunderbolt 4 ports, HDMI 2.1, two USB-A, a UHS-II SD card reader, Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6.0. The 90Wh battery won\'t go far with two OLEDs and an RTX 5090. It weighs 2.82 kg.</p>\n<p>If you only need one great screen, the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-scar-g835lx-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">ROG Strix Scar 18</a> has the same RTX 5090 for well under half the price.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo GX651AX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX with Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090 24GB, 64GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 13,38,900.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Zephyrus Duo have two screens?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has two 16-inch 3K (2880 \\u00d7 1800) 120Hz OLED touchscreens with stylus support.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM does the Zephyrus Duo have?\",\"answer\":\"64GB of LPDDR5X-8533, soldered.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX (Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-core-ultra-9-rtx-5090-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-core-ultra-9-rtx-5090-price',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(316,40,3,'Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)','asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,505900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) costs <strong>Rs 5,05,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 2.5K (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.85 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 200W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 4,95,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JMR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 4,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"T