815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) starts at Rs 5,92,900 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 5,92,900 for Core Ultra 9 275HX \\u00b7 RTX 5070 Ti, 16GB\\/1TB; Rs 10,49,900 for Core Ultra 9 290HX Plus \\u00b7 RTX 5090, 32GB\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX or 290HX Plus.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti or RTX 5090 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(318,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025)','asus-rog-strix-g18-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,537900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) costs <strong>Rs 5,37,900</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen 9 8940HX · RTX 5070, 16GB/1TB model. The top Core i9-14900HX · RTX 5070, 32GB/2TB version costs Rs 5,95,900. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX or Intel Core i9-14900HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics. The screen is a 18-inch WQXGA, 240Hz panel. 32GB or more of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing, virtual machines and big projects. That GPU is comfortable with current games at high settings on the built-in screen.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)</a> (Rs 5,37,900) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5 16AFR10 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> (Rs 5,23,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g18-2025&g2=asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) with the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 14 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) starts at Rs 5,37,900 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 5,37,900 for Ryzen 9 8940HX \\u00b7 RTX 5070, 16GB\\/1TB; Rs 5,95,900 for Core i9-14900HX \\u00b7 RTX 5070, 32GB\\/2TB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX or Intel Core i9-14900HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(319,48,3,'MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025)','msi-vector-16-hx-ai-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,625000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) costs <strong>Rs 6,25,000</strong> in Nepal for the Core Ultra 7 275HX · RTX 5090, 16GB/1TB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 275HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 24GB, 175W graphics. The screen is a 16-inch QHD+ IPS, 240Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That is as fast as laptop graphics get, with power to spare for high-refresh 1440p gaming and GPU rendering.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-vector-16-hx-ai-a2xwjg-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 6,10,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 5,95,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=msi-vector-16-hx-ai-2025&g2=msi-vector-16-hx-ai-a2xwjg-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">compare the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) with the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Price last checked on 21 September 2026. Shop prices change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) costs Rs 6,25,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 275HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 24GB, 175W graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-09-21\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-20 18:15:00','2026-09-20 18:15:00'),(321,2,31,'Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4)','apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,139999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The M4 iPad Air brings near-Pro power at an Air price. Apple\'s M4 chip has an 8-core CPU and a 9-core GPU with hardware ray tracing, and 12 GB of unified memory, 50% more than before, keeps several apps, Stage Manager and heavier creative work running smoothly.</p>\n<p>The 11-inch Liquid Retina display covers the P3 wide colour range at 500 nits with True Tone, and the 12MP landscape Center Stage camera keeps you framed on calls. ONIN Infosys sells the Wi-Fi model from Rs 1,39,999, in 128 GB or 256 GB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How much memory does the M4 iPad Air have?\",\"answer\":\"12 GB of unified memory.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is the front camera?\",\"answer\":\"On the long edge, so video calls look right in landscape.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4 Chip) Wi-Fi | 8-core CPU | 9-core GPU | 2360 x 1640 IPS Display\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/apple-ipad-air-m4-11-inch-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/apple-ipad-air-m4-11-inch-price-nepal',NULL,3,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(322,2,31,'iPad Air 13 M4 (2026)','apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,179000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) costs <strong>Rs 1,79,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB - 128GB - WiFi Only model. The 8GB - 256GB - WiFi Only version costs Rs 1,99,000. It launched in Nepal on 10 April 2026. This is a premium tablet that can replace a laptop for many jobs with a keyboard attached.</p>\n<p>It has a 13 inches Liquid Retina IPS LCD, 60Hz, 600 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Apple M4. The Li-Po 28.93 Wh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 20W Charging. Software support: At least 5 years.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026\">iPad Air 11 M4 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,39,000) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s11\">Samsung Galaxy Tab S11</a> (Rs 1,29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026&g2=apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026\">compare the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) with the iPad Air 11 M4 (2026)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) starts at Rs 1,79,000 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,79,000 for 8GB - 128GB - WiFi Only; Rs 1,99,000 for 8GB - 256GB - WiFi Only.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M4.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026) battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 28.93 Wh, non-removable; 20W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-04-09 18:15:00','2026-04-09 18:15:00'),(323,2,31,'iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025)','apple-ipad-pro-11-m5-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-ipad-pro-11-m5-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,229500.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-12-02','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) costs <strong>Rs 2,29,500</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB - 256GB - WiFi Only model. The 16GB - 1TB - WiFi Only version costs Rs 3,45,000. It launched in Nepal on 2 December 2025. This is a premium tablet that can replace a laptop for many jobs with a keyboard attached.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches Ultra Retina Tandem OLED, 120Hz, 1000 nits (HBM), 1600 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Apple M5. The Li-Po 8160 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 60W Fast Charging. Software support: At least 5 years.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026\">iPad Air 13 M4 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,79,000) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026\">iPad Air 11 M4 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,39,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=apple-ipad-pro-11-m5-2025&g2=apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026\">compare the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) with the iPad Air 13 M4 (2026)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) starts at Rs 2,29,500 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,29,500 for 12GB - 256GB - WiFi Only; Rs 2,67,500 for 12GB - 512GB - WiFi Only; Rs 3,45,000 for 16GB - 1TB - WiFi Only.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 2 December 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M5.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025) battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8160 mAh, non-removable; 60W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-01 18:15:00','2025-12-01 18:15:00'),(324,2,31,'iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025)','apple-ipad-pro-13-m5-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-ipad-pro-13-m5-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,327000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-12-02','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) costs <strong>Rs 3,27,000</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB - 512GB - WiFi Only model. It launched in Nepal on 2 December 2025. This is a premium tablet that can replace a laptop for many jobs with a keyboard attached.</p>\n<p>It has a 13 inches Ultra Retina Tandem OLED, 120Hz, 1000 nits (HBM), 1600 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Apple M5. The Li-Po 10290 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 60W Fast Charging. Software support: At least 5 years.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-ipad-pro-11-m5-2025\">iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025)</a> (Rs 2,29,500) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-ipad-air-13-m4-2026\">iPad Air 13 M4 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,79,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=apple-ipad-pro-13-m5-2025&g2=apple-ipad-pro-11-m5-2025\">compare the iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) with the iPad Pro 11 M5 (2025)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) costs Rs 3,27,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 2 December 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M5.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the iPad Pro 13 M5 (2025) battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 10290 mAh, non-removable; 60W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-01 18:15:00','2025-12-01 18:15:00'),(325,49,31,'Blackview Zeno 2','blackview-zeno-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-zeno-2.webp',NULL,NULL,19999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-14','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Zeno 2 costs <strong>Rs 19,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 14 October 2026. A tablet at this price is mainly for videos, reading, online classes and kids.</p>\n<p>It has a 8.68 inches IPS LCD, 60Hz screen and runs on the Unisoc Tiger T310 (12nm). Its Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removale battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 10W Charging. It is rated IP54 for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/blackview-tab-a6-kids\">Blackview Tab A6 Kids</a> (Rs 19,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-tab-60\">Blackview Tab 60</a> (Rs 20,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=blackview-zeno-2&g2=blackview-tab-a6-kids\">compare the Blackview Zeno 2 with the Blackview Tab A6 Kids</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Zeno 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Zeno 2 costs Rs 19,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Blackview Zeno 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Zeno 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc Tiger T310 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Zeno 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removale; 10W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-13 18:15:00','2026-10-13 18:15:00'),(326,3,31,'Redmi Pad 2 9.7','redmi-pad-2-9-7',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-pad-2-9-7.webp',NULL,NULL,25999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-26','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A tablet you can hold in one hand. The smaller Redmi Pad 2 weighs little, scrolls at 120Hz and lasts for days of reading, recipes and cartoons. Children and bedtime readers are its natural owners.</p>\n<p>With 4GB of memory it does one thing at a time, and the low-cost chip is for light use. For online classes with notes beside the teacher, the 11-inch model with 6GB or more is worth the extra Rs 4,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 9.7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Pad 2 9.7 costs Rs 25,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Pad 2 9.7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 26 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Pad 2 9.7 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s 4G Gen 2.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 9.7 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7600 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-05-25 18:15:00','2026-05-25 18:15:00'),(327,3,31,'Redmi Pad 2 11-inch','redmi-pad-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-pad-2.webp',NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-05','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most homes need a tablet that plays lessons and films, shows a recipe and survives a child. The Redmi Pad 2 does that with a sharp 11-inch 2.5K screen, four speakers and a 9,000mAh battery that only needs attention every few days.</p>\n<p>Its Helio chip is adequate and not lively, so take 6GB or 8GB of memory and leave heavy games to something else. Charging at 18W is an overnight affair. There is no pen in the box, and handwriting is better served by a Galaxy Tab S10 FE or a Xiaomi Pad 7 with its own pen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Pad 2 11-inch starts at Rs 29,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 29,999 for 6GB\\/128GB; Rs 34,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultra (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 9000 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-04 18:15:00','2025-06-04 18:15:00'),(328,38,31,'Honor Pad X8b','honor-pad-x8b',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-pad-x8b.webp',NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-09','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Ten thousand milliampere-hours is the argument for the Pad X8b. Fifteen hours of video is within reach, which suits long journeys, field offices and homes where charging is a negotiation.</p>\n<p>The Snapdragon 680 dates from 2021 and the base version has only 4GB, so choose 8GB and keep expectations to films, reading and calls. The X9a in the same range is smoother and cheaper if endurance is not your first need.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Pad X8b price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Pad X8b starts at Rs 29,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 29,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 32,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 39,999 for 8GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Pad X8b launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 9 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor Pad X8b use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 680 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Pad X8b battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 10100 mAh, non-removable.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-04-08 18:15:00','2026-04-08 18:15:00'),(329,4,31,'OnePlus Pad Lite','oneplus-pad-lite',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,34999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-29','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>OnePlus kept the Pad Lite simple: an 11-inch screen, four speakers, a big battery with 33W charging and clean software. The LTE version is the interesting one, because tablets with a SIM slot are scarce at this price.</p>\n<p>The Helio G100 is for lessons, films and browsing. Families on fibre can save with the Redmi Pad 2. Sales staff, teachers in the field and homes that depend on mobile data should look at the LTE model, and register it in MDMS.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Pad Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus Pad Lite costs Rs 34,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Pad Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 29 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Pad Lite use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Pad Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 9340 mAh, non-removable; 33W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-10-28 18:15:00','2025-10-28 18:15:00'),(330,3,31,'Xiaomi Pad 7','xiaomi-pad-7',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-pad-7.webp',NULL,NULL,44999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>No tablet under Rs 50,000 feels as quick. A Snapdragon 7+ Gen 3 drives a 3.2K, 144Hz screen whose squarer shape suits documents, and two apps share it without stuttering. With Xiaomi\'s pen it becomes a serious notebook, and with the keyboard a light office machine.</p>\n<p>Check that both accessories are in stock before paying, because they are sold separately and arrive in small numbers. HyperOS takes some cleaning. Support is good and shorter than Samsung\'s. If your tablet will be used for an hour or more every day, this is the point where spending pays off.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Xiaomi Pad 7 starts at Rs 44,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 44,999 for 8GB\\/128GB; Rs 49,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Xiaomi Pad 7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Xiaomi Pad 7 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7+ Gen 3 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 7 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8850 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-16 18:15:00','2025-06-16 18:15:00'),(331,1,31,'Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite','samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,63499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-13','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite costs <strong>Rs 63,499</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 13 September 2025. At this price it can double as a note-taking and light work device.</p>\n<p>It has a 10.8 - 10.9 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz, 600 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Samsung Exynos 1380 (5nm). The Li-Po 8000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 25W Fast Charging. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-pad-8\">Xiaomi Pad 8</a> (Rs 59,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-mega-12-5g\">Blackview MEGA 12 5G</a> (Rs 59,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-lite&g2=xiaomi-pad-8\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite with the Xiaomi Pad 8</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite costs Rs 63,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 13 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Samsung Exynos 1380 (5nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8000 mAh, non-removable; 25W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-09-12 18:15:00','2025-09-12 18:15:00'),(332,1,31,'Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE','samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-fe',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-fe.webp',NULL,NULL,74999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-04-03','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Students who write by hand should start here. The S Pen is in the box, never needs charging to write, and works with one of the best note apps on any tablet. The body is rated IP68, the screen is bright enough for a library window, and Samsung promises seven years of updates.</p>\n<p>It costs more than a Xiaomi Pad 7, until you add a pen to the Xiaomi. The LCD runs at 90Hz and not 120, which only gamers will mind. A keyboard cover can come later. For a four or five year degree, this is money well placed.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE costs Rs 74,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 April 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Samsung Exynos 1580 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 FE battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-02 18:15:00','2025-04-02 18:15:00'),(333,1,31,'Samsung Galaxy Tab S11','samsung-galaxy-tab-s11',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-tab-s11.webp',NULL,NULL,129999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Tab S11 is Samsung\'s flagship tablet in a size you can hold: an 11-inch AMOLED at 120Hz, a fast Dimensity 9400+, 12GB of memory and an S Pen in the box. DeX turns it into a small desktop for email, documents and browsing.</p>\n<p>Illustrators, film lovers and professionals who read on screen will use what they paid for. Students who mainly take notes can save Rs 55,000 with the S10 FE. Compared with an iPad Air the app choice is smaller, and the pen is included.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab S11 costs Rs 1,29,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab S11 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab S11 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 9400+ (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8400 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-03 18:15:00','2025-11-03 18:15:00'),(334,50,5,'Amazfit Bip U','amazfit-bip-u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 5,999 last listed price in Nepal','2020-10-15','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Amazfit Bip U is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 5,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 15 October 2020. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches, TFT LCD display. Battery: Up to 9 days (normal usage); 230 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Amazfit alternative is the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-gtr-mini\">Amazfit GTR Mini</a> (Rs 17,499).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Amazfit Bip U still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 5,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Amazfit Bip U launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 October 2020.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Amazfit Bip U battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 9 days (normal usage); 230 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2020-10-14 18:15:00','2020-10-14 18:15:00'),(335,50,5,'Amazfit Pop 2','amazfit-pop-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 6,399 last listed price in Nepal','2023-05-15','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Amazfit Pop 2 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 6,399</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 15 May 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.78 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 10 days (normal usage); 270 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2. Wa