al. It launched in Nepal on 23 July 2026. This is where noise cancellation, app support and better codecs start to appear.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 50dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 13.5 hours (buds) / 56 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) / 2 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 10 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.1, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LHDC 5.0. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/anker-soundcore-r60i-nc\">Soundcore R60i NC</a> (Rs 5,499) and the <a href=\"/products/hifuture-flybuds-4\">HiFuture Flybuds 4</a> (Rs 5,624). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t500-pro&g2=anker-soundcore-r60i-nc\">compare the Realme Buds T500 Pro with the Soundcore R60i NC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T500 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T500 Pro costs Rs 5,500 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T500 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T500 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 13.5 hours (buds) \\/ 56 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) \\/ 2 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 10 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-22 18:15:00','2026-07-22 18:15:00'),(700,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U)','lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u.webp',NULL,NULL,101999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) costs <strong>Rs 1,01,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1335U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.62 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-15-fd0154wm-2024-intel-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb-512gb-156-fhd\">HP 15-FD0154WM 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> (Rs 1,01,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10-2025-intel-core-i5-13420h\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 2025</a> (Rs 1,01,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u&g2=hp-15-15-fd0154wm-2024-intel-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb-512gb-156-fhd\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) with the HP 15-FD0154WM 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) costs Rs 1,01,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1335U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(701,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025','lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-intel-core-ultra-7-255h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-intel-core-ultra-7-255h.webp',NULL,NULL,225900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 costs <strong>Rs 2,25,900</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 5 210H, 8GB/1TB model. The Intel Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 2,56,900. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores / 16 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.34 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 48 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-7-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445\">Lenovo Yoga 7 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)</a> (Rs 2,26,999) and the <a href=\"/products/msi-pulse-15-b13v-i7-13700h-rtx-4060-360hz\">MSI Pulse 15 B13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700H)</a> (Rs 2,23,250). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-intel-core-ultra-7-255h&g2=lenovo-yoga-7-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445\">compare the Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 with the Lenovo Yoga 7 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 starts at Rs 2,25,900 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,25,900 for Intel Core 5 210H, 8GB\\/1TB; Rs 2,38,900 for Intel Core Ultra 5 225U, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 2,56,900 for Intel Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores \\/ 16 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(702,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350)','lenovo-thinkpad-p14s-gen-6-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-p14s-gen-6-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350.webp',NULL,NULL,264999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) costs <strong>Rs 2,64,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.39 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 52.5 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-flip-tp3407aa-sg065w-2026-intel-core-ultra-7-355\">Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407AA-SG065W 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 7 355)</a> (Rs 2,66,949) and the <a href=\"/products/macbook-air-m5-15\">Apple MacBook Air 15 (M5)</a> (Rs 2,69,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-thinkpad-p14s-gen-6-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350&g2=asus-vivobook-14-flip-tp3407aa-sg065w-2026-intel-core-ultra-7-355\">compare the Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) with the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407AA-SG065W 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 7 355)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) costs Rs 2,64,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 6 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 7 PRO 350 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(703,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14irh10r-2025-intel-core-7-240h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14irh10r-2025-intel-core-7-240h.webp',NULL,NULL,128999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 costs <strong>Rs 1,28,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB/512GB model. The Intel Core 7 240H, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,39,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 7 240H (Intel 7), 10 cores / 16 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.39 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> (Rs 1,28,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5i-gen-9-2024-core-ultra-5\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5i Gen 9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> (Rs 1,29,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14irh10r-2025-intel-core-7-240h&g2=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 with the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 starts at Rs 1,28,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,28,999 for Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,39,999 for Intel Core 7 240H, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 7 240H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(704,9,3,'Dell XPS 13 DX13260 (2026, Core 5 320)','dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320.webp',NULL,NULL,135999.00,155999.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XPS 13 has long been the Windows laptop people compare MacBooks against, and the 2026 DX13260 brings it to its lowest price yet in Nepal: <strong>Rs 1,35,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys, in a light Sky finish.</p>\n<p>It\'s still unmistakably an XPS. It weighs about <strong>1 kg</strong>, with near-borderless InfinityEdge bezels and a <strong>13.4-inch 2.5K (2560 × 1600) touchscreen</strong> that runs at up to <strong>120Hz</strong> and 500 nits. It looks crisp and bright next to the 250–300-nit panels common at this price. Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6.0 are included, and the 52Wh battery is a good size for the body.</p>\n<p>To reach this price, Dell uses Intel\'s 6-core <strong>Core 5 320</strong> (up to 4.6GHz) and <strong>8GB</strong> of fast LPDDR5x with a 512GB SSD. It\'s fine for writing, browsing, Office and streaming, but 8GB can\'t be upgraded and will limit heavier multitasking. Ports are minimal, just two USB-C, so keep a small hub in your bag.</p>\n<p>The obvious rival is the <a href=\"/products/macbook-neo\">MacBook Neo</a> at almost the same price. Choose the XPS if you need Windows or want the 120Hz touchscreen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell XPS 13 (2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell XPS 13 DX13260 with Core 5 320, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,35,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the 2026 XPS 13 have?\",\"answer\":\"A 13.4-inch 2.5K (2560 \\u00d7 1600) touchscreen at 30\\u2013120Hz and 500 nits.\"},{\"question\":\"How many ports does the XPS 13 have?\",\"answer\":\"Two USB-C ports. You will likely want a hub for USB-A and HDMI.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell XPS 13 DX13260 (2026, Core 5 320)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-xps-13-dx13260-core-5-320-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-xps-13-dx13260-core-5-320-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(705,9,3,'Dell XPS 13 9350 2024','dell-xps-13-9350-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-512gb-134-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is the XPS that earns the name. Intel\'s efficient Core Ultra 7 256V, 16GB of memory and a beautifully made small body give a laptop that lasts through a working day and looks at home in any meeting.</p>\n<p>It has USB-C ports only, so a hub for HDMI is part of the purchase, and at Rs 2,39,999 it costs as much as a MacBook Air. The cheaper 2026 XPS 13 shares the style with half the memory. Enter the service tag on Dell\'s site to see where its warranty applies.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell XPS 13 9350 2024 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell XPS 13 9350 2024 starts at Rs 2,39,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,39,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 256V, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 3,98,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 258V, 32GB\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell XPS 13 9350 2024 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell XPS 13 9350 2024 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(706,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iwc11-2026-intel-core-5-320',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iwc11-2026-intel-core-5-320.webp',NULL,NULL,127999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) costs <strong>Rs 1,27,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 320 (Intel 18A), 6 cores / 6 threads. Screen: 15.3 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.59 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 50 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-8gb-512gb-15-6-fhd\">Asus VivoBook 15 X1502VA 2023 (Intel Core i5 13420H)</a> (Rs 1,27,900) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14irh10r-2025-intel-core-7-240h\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRH10R 2025</a> (Rs 1,28,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iwc11-2026-intel-core-5-320&g2=asus-vivobook-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-8gb-512gb-15-6-fhd\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) with the Asus VivoBook 15 X1502VA 2023 (Intel Core i5 13420H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) costs Rs 1,27,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IWC11 2026 (Intel Core 5 320) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 320 (Intel 18A), 6 cores \\/ 6 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(707,8,3,'HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)','hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u',NULL,NULL,NULL,