0% volume, AAC; 1 hours (buds) \\/ 1.33 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-30 18:15:00','2024-12-30 18:15:00'),(712,41,3,'Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,300000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 3,00,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It was announced in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WQXGA+ (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 0.99 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 65 Wh; 100W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI PHN16S‑71‑91AW 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,01,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025\">Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,96,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v&g2=acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) with the Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI PHN16S‑71‑91AW 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs Rs 3,00,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does t