e 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 7 Processor 150U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.52 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 59 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320\">Dell XPS 13 DX13260 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 320)</a> (Rs 1,29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/hp-elitebook-655-g10-ryzen-5-pro-7530u\">HP EliteBook 655 G10 (Ryzen 5 Pro 7530U)</a> (Rs 1,29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-envy-x360-2024-intel-core-7-150u&g2=dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320\">compare the HP Envy x360 ES1023DX 2024 (Intel Core 7 150U) with the Dell XPS 13 DX13260 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 320)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Envy x360 ES1023DX 2024 (Intel Core 7 150U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Envy x360 ES1023DX 2024 (Intel Core 7 150U) costs Rs 1,30,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP Envy x360 ES1023DX 2024 (Intel Core 7 150U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Envy x360 ES1023DX 2024 (Intel Core 7 150U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 7 Processor 150U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(765,8,3,'HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U)','hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022-i5-1235u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022-i5-1235u.webp',NULL,NULL,95000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) costs <strong>Rs 95,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1235U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.61 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 53.2 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-16-dc16251-2025-intel-core-5-120u\">Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 94,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30\">Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)</a> (Rs 93,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022-i5-1235u&g2=dell-16-dc16251-2025-intel-core-5-120u\">compare the HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) with the Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) costs Rs 95,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1235U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(766,8,3,'HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)','hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,78999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) costs <strong>Rs 78,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U (6nm), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.59 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 45 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-15-dc15250-2025\">Dell 15 DC15250 2025</a> (Rs 78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)</a> (Rs 78,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u&g2=dell-15-dc15250-2025\">compare the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) with the Dell 15 DC15250 2025</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) costs Rs 78,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U (6nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(767,43,5,'Huawei Watch D2','huawei-watch-d2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-d2.webp',NULL,NULL,64990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-12','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Watch D2 does something other watches only claim: it measures blood pressure with a tiny inflating cuff hidden in the strap, and can repeat the reading through the day and night. Huawei has obtained medical approvals for it in several regions.</p>\n<p>For people asked by a doctor to monitor pressure it is a remarkable tool, though a Rs 4,000 arm cuff is enough for a morning check. It is thicker than an ordinary watch and needs correct strap sizing. Discuss the readings with a professional before changing any medicine.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch D2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch D2 costs Rs 64,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch D2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch D2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 524 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-11 18:15:00','2025-08-11 18:15:00'),(768,43,5,'Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro','huawei-watch-gt-5-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,49990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-03','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro costs <strong>Rs 49,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 3 January 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 41 mm: 1.32 inches, 46 mm: 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 9 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode). Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS (L1+L5), Galileo (L1+L5), Glonass, QZSS (L1+L5), NFC. Water resistance: IP69K dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, EN13319 dive compliance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-cheetah-pro\">Amazfit Cheetah Pro</a> (Rs 49,999) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</a> (Rs 52,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-gt-5-pro&g2=amazfit-cheetah-pro\">compare the Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro with the Amazfit Cheetah Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro costs Rs 49,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 January 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 5 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 9 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-01-02 18:15:00','2025-01-02 18:15:00'),(769,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 1 2022 (Ryzen 5 7520U)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-1-2022-ryzen-5-7520u-8gb-512gb-14-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 68,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-09-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 1 2022 (Ryzen 5 7520U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 68,000</strong>. It was announced in September 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14.0 inches, TN LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080), 60Hz, 220 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.4kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: 42 Wh Li-ion; 65W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-2023\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 2023 (AMD Athlon 7120U)</a> (Rs 66,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 1 2022 (Ryzen 5 7520U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 68,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 1 2022 (Ryzen 5 7520U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-08-31 18:15:00','2022-08-31 18:15:00'),(770,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)','lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v.webp',NULL,NULL,278999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs <strong>Rs 2,78,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.21 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 55 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-premium-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Dell 14 Premium DA14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,80,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026\">Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445)</a> (Rs 2,75,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v&g2=dell-14-premium-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">compare the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) with the Dell 14 Premium DA14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs Rs 2,78,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(771,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad L14 Gen 6 (Core Ultra 7 255U, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u.webp',NULL,NULL,206299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The L-series sits between the value-focused ThinkPad E and the premium T. In practice that means sturdier internals, more ports and better serviceability. The L14 Gen 6 costs <strong>Rs 2,06,299</strong> at ONIN Infosys, only about Rs 1,300 more than the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-core-ultra-5-225u\">E14 Gen 7</a>, and for that small difference you get a faster chip and a second Thunderbolt port.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core Ultra 7 255U</strong> boosts to 5.2GHz and includes Intel AI Boost (up to 12 TOPS) for on-device AI features. It\'s paired with 16GB of DDR5-5600, <strong>expandable up to 64GB</strong>, which is a real advantage for staff running VMs or large datasets. The 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD is quick. You get <strong>two Thunderbolt 4</strong> ports, three USB-A ports (one always-on for charging a phone), HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch WUXGA anti-glare panel is pleasant for long sessions, the backlit keyboard is classic ThinkPad, and a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong> is included. The only weak spot is the 720p webcam. For a bigger screen and a more powerful H-series chip, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">ThinkPad L16 Gen 2</a> is the sibling to consider.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad L14 Gen 6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 2,06,299 at ONIN Infosys for the Core Ultra 7 255U, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD model with a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM can the ThinkPad L14 Gen 6 take?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 64GB of DDR5-5600.\"},{\"question\":\"How many Thunderbolt ports does it have?\",\"answer\":\"Two USB-C ports with Thunderbolt 4 \\/ USB4 (40Gbps), both supporting charging and DisplayPort 2.1.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkPad L14 Gen 6 (Core Ultra 7 255U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-core-ultra-7-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-core-ultra-7-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(772,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,191999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs <strong>Rs 1,91,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.2 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 56 Wh; 240W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322)</a> (Rs 1,91,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-alienware-15-da15260-2026-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050\">Dell Alienware 15 DA15260 2026 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 1,89,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-4050&g2=lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) with the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs Rs 1,91,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(773,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 16 X1607CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H)','asus-vivobook-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-225h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-225h.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,79,900 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 16 X1607CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,79,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.88 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050\">Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ-RL063WS 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> (Rs 1,83,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Vivobook 16 X1607CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,79,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 16 X1607CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 16 X1607CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"ac