ra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 60Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.55 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 64 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-73m0-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-5050\">Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-73M0 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 2,14,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s-16-oled-s5606ma-2025-core-ultra-9-285h-16gb-1tb-16-32k-oled\">Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H)</a> (Rs 2,14,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-14-plus-db14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v-32gb-1tb-14-wqxga-oled-90hz&g2=acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-73m0-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-5050\">compare the Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) with the Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-73M0 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs Rs 2,14,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(786,38,5,'Honor Watch X5 Play','honor-watch-x5-play',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-watch-x5-play.webp',NULL,NULL,7999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Watch X5 Play costs <strong>Rs 7,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 2.01 inches, TFT LCD display. Battery: Up to 18 days (typical usage); Li-Po 450 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, LE. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/galaxy-fit-3\">Samsung Galaxy Fit 3</a> (Rs 7,999) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-10\">Huawei Band 10</a> (Rs 7,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=honor-watch-x5-play&g2=galaxy-fit-3\">compare the Honor Watch X5 Play with the Samsung Galaxy Fit 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5 Play price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Watch X5 Play costs Rs 7,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Watch X5 Play launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5 Play battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 18 days (typical usage); Li-Po 450 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-06 18:15:00','2026-10-06 18:15:00'),(787,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)','lenovo-ideapad-1-2023-ryzen-5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-1-2023-ryzen-5.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 98,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 98,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U (6nm), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, TN LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.38 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u\">Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U)</a> (Rs 1,01,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 98,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U (6nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(788,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U)','acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-41-2024-ryzen-5-7430u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,97999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Plain to look at and easy to recommend. The Aspire Lite 15 puts a six-core Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB of memory and a 58Wh battery under one lakh, where many prettier laptops still ship with half the memory. For assignments, accounts, code and video calls it will stay comfortable for years.</p>\n<p>The screen is an ordinary Full HD panel and Wi-Fi is the older standard. Look carefully at the model code: the AL15-42P version sells for nearly the same price with a much smaller battery. <a href=\"/reviews/acer-aspire-lite-15-ryzen-5-review-nepal\">Our review</a> explains who it suits.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U) costs Rs 97,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7430U (7nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(789,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 (Core i5-13420H)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10-2025-intel-core-i5-13420h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10-2025-intel-core-i5-13420h.webp',NULL,NULL,101499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Slim 3 15IRH10 is where Lenovo\'s everyday laptops start to feel properly quick. It uses an H-series <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> (8 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.6GHz) instead of the low-power U-series chips found in cheaper models. Large Excel sheets, Python notebooks, Figma and multi-tab research all respond faster.</p>\n<p>ONIN Infosys stocks two versions. The <strong>8GB model costs Rs 1,01,499</strong>, and the <strong>16GB model costs Rs 1,14,999</strong>. Both have a 512GB PCIe Gen 4 SSD. We\'d pay the extra Rs 13,500 for 16GB, because the memory is on the board and Windows plus a browser now comfortably use more than 8GB. ONIN includes a laptop bag, mouse and mousepad with the 8GB model.</p>\n<p>The 15.3-inch display uses a taller 16:10 shape (1920 × 1200), so you see more of a document without scrolling. The keyboard is backlit, which matters in a dim hostel room. The body weighs about 1.37 kg, light for a 15-inch laptop. Graphics are integrated Intel UHD, so treat it as a work and study machine, not a gaming one. For games, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with RTX 5050</a> is the next stop.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys the Core i5-13420H model costs Rs 1,01,499 with 8GB RAM and Rs 1,14,999 with 16GB RAM, both with a 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Should I buy the 8GB or 16GB IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10?\",\"answer\":\"The 16GB version. The memory cannot easily be upgraded later, and 16GB keeps the laptop smooth for longer with modern browsers and Office.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 have a backlit keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has an LED-backlit keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 (Core i5-13420H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-slim-3-i5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10 (Core i5-13420H) (ram=16GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-slim-3-15irh10-i5-13420h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-slim-3-i5-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(790,39,3,'Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025','lenovo-legion-pro-7i-16iax10h-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-pro-7i-16iax10h-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090.webp',NULL,NULL,773900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 costs <strong>Rs 7,73,900</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5080, 32GB/1TB model. The Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090, 32GB/1TB version costs Rs 9,93,900. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 16 inches, OLED, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 2.57 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 80 Wh; 400W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-7i-2025\">Lenovo Legion Pro 7i (2025)</a> (Rs 7,73,900) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-max-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> (Rs 7,76,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-legion-pro-7i-16iax10h-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-7i-2025\">compare the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 with the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i (2025)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 starts at Rs 7,73,900 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 7,73,900 for Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5080, 32GB\\/1TB; Rs 9,93,900 for Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090, 32GB\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores \\/ 24 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(791,48,3,'MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','msi-vector-16-hx-ai-a2xwjg-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,610000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs <strong>Rs 6,10,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, QHD+ (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.7 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Po 90 Wh; 330W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 5,95,900) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-16-inch-m5-pro-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M5 Pro (2026)</a> (Rs 6,77,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=msi-vector-16-hx-ai-a2xwjg-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090&g2=asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">compare the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) with the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs Rs 6,10,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores \\/ 24 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(792,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9 (Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 6GB)','lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs.webp',NULL,NULL,164499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you want to play Valorant, CS2, GTA V or Fortnite on a budget and still have a laptop that handles college work, the LOQ 15AHP9 is one of the most sensible starting points in Nepal. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 1,64,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong> here runs at a <strong>95W TGP</strong>. That\'s the detail to check, because the same GPU name appears on laptops that cap it at 45–65W and lose a lot of frame rate. With the 6-core <strong>Ryzen 7 7445HS</strong> (12 threads, up to 4.7GHz), expect high frame rates in esports titles at 1080p and playable medium settings in most modern AAA games, with DLSS doing the heavy lifting.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch FHD IPS panel runs at <strong>144Hz with G-SYNC</strong> and covers 100% sRGB, so it\'s good for photo editing as well as games. You get 16GB DDR5-5600 in a single SO-DIMM. Adding a second matching stick for dual channel is the cheapest performance upgrade you can make. The ports are well placed: three USB-A, USB-C with 100W charging and DisplayPort, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet, most of them at the back, which keeps cables away from your mouse hand.</p>\n<p>It weighs 2.38 kg, so it\'s a laptop that mostly lives on a desk. For more GPU headroom in new games, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with RTX 5050</a> is the next step.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the LOQ 15AHP9 with Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,64,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the GPU wattage on the LOQ 15AHP9?\",\"answer\":\"The RTX 3050 6GB runs at up to 95W TGP, high for this GPU, so it performs better than low-power RTX 3050 laptops.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I add more RAM to the LOQ 15AHP9?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It ships with one 16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM and has a free slot for a second stick.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9 (Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15ahp9-ryzen-7-7445hs-rtx-3050-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-loq-15ahp9-ryzen-7-7445hs-rtx-3050-price-in-nepal',NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(793,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5070',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5070.webp',NULL,NULL,459900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs <strong>Rs 4,59,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 18 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 3.2 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5-pro\">Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5 Pro)</a> (Rs 4,74,500) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-pro-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Pro (2026)</a> (Rs 4,74,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5070&g2=macbook-pro-14-m5-pro\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) with the Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5 Pro)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs Rs 4,59,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LP 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores \\/ 24 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(794,2,5,'Apple Watch Series 11','apple-watch-series-11',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-watch-series-11.webp',NULL,NULL,76000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-09','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple Watch Series 11 costs <strong>Rs 76,000</strong> in Nepal for the 42mm model. The 46mm version costs Rs 83,000. It launched in Nepal on 9 September 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 42mm: 1.77 inches, 46mm: 1.96 inches, Retina LTPO3 OLED display. Battery: Up to 24 hours (normal usage), Up to 38 hours (low power mode). Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, BDS, Galileo, Glonass, QZSS, NFC. Water resistance: IP6X dust resistance, 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch8-classic\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 Classic</a> (Rs 82,999) and the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-t-rex-ultra\">Amazfit T-Rex Ultra</a> (Rs 69,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=apple-watch-series-11&g2=samsung-galaxy-watch8-classic\">compare the Apple Watch Series 11 with the Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 Classic</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Apple Watch Series 11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Apple Watch Series 11 starts at Rs 76,000 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 76,000 for 42mm; Rs 83,000 for 46mm.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Apple Watch Series 11 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 9 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple Watch Series 11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 24 hours (normal usage), Up to 38 hours (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2025-09-08 18:15:00','2025-09-08 18:15:00'),(795,2,5,'Apple Watch Series 9','apple-watch-series-9',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-watch-series-9.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 55,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-09-22','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple Watch Series 9 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 55,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 22 September 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 41 mm: 1.69 inches, 45 mm: 1.9 inches, Retina LTPO OLED display. Battery: Up to 18 hours (normal usage), Up to 36 hours (low power mode); Li-Ion 308 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, BDS, Galileo, Glonass, QZSS, NFC. Water resistance: IP6X dust resistance, 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Apple alternative is the <a href=\"/products/apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</a> (Rs 52,500).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Apple Watch Series 9 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 55,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Apple Watch Series 9 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 22 September 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple Watch Series 9 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 18 hours (normal usage), Up to 36 hours (low power mode); Li-Ion 308 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-09-21 18:15:00','2023-09-21 18:15:00'),(796,43,5,'Huawei Watch GT 7','huawei-watch-gt-7',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-gt-7.webp',NULL,NULL,44990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-12','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch GT 7 costs <strong>Rs 44,990</strong> in Nepal for the 46 mm model. It launched in Nepal on 12 October 2026. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 41mm: 1.32 inches, 46mm: 1.47 inches, AMOLED display. Connectivity: GPS: Yes, with GPS (L1+L5), BDS (B1I+B1c+B1a), GALILEO (E1+E5a), QZSS (L1+L5), GLONASS, NavIC, NFC. Water resistance: IP69 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-6\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 6</a> (Rs 44,999) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-fit-5-pro\">Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro</a> (Rs 43,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-gt-7&g2=samsung-galaxy-watch-6\">compare the Huawei Watch GT 7 with the Samsung Galaxy Watch 6</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch GT 7 costs Rs 44,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch GT 7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 October 2026.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-11 18:15:00','2026-10-11 18:15:00'),(797,43,5,'Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro','huawei-watch-gt-6-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-gt-6-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,54490.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro costs <strong>Rs 54,490</strong> in Nepal for the Brown Composite Woven Strap model. The Titanium Strap version costs Rs 74,490. It launched in Nepal on 17 November 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.47 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 21 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 867 mAh. Water resistance: IP69 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</a> (Rs 52,500) and the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-cheetah-pro\">Amazfit Cheetah Pro</a> (Rs 49,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-gt-6-pro&g2=apple-watch-se-3\">compare the Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro with the Apple Watch SE 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro starts at Rs 54,490 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 54,490 for Brown Composite Woven Strap; Rs 54,490 for Black Flurolastomer Strap; Rs 74,490 for Titanium Strap.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 6 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 21 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 867 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-16 18:15:00','2025-11-16 18:15:00'),(798,41,3,'Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, OLED)','acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,299499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most gaming laptops with a 240Hz OLED cost well over four lakh. The Predator Helios Neo 16S AI brings that screen down to <strong>Rs 2,99,499</strong> at ONIN Infosys: a <strong>16-inch WQXGA (2560 × 1600) OLED at 240Hz</strong>, with the near-instant response and perfect blacks that make fast shooters and dark horror games look superb.</p>\n<p>Behind it are Intel\'s 24-core <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong>, an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB at 115W</strong>, 16GB of DDR5 and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD. The CPU is far more than most games need, but it\'s excellent for streaming and content creation. The RTX 5060 is the limit at native 1600p, so use DLSS in demanding titles. You also get <strong>two Thunderbolt 4 ports</strong>, four USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, an RGB keyboard and a 76Wh battery, at about 2.3 kg.</p>\n<p>Here\'s the trade-off: for nearly the same money, the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz\">Nitro 16S AI</a> has a much faster RTX 5070 Ti but an IPS screen. Pick the Helios Neo if image quality and creator work matter most. Pick the Nitro if frame rates do.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Predator Helios Neo 16S AI with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,99,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Helios Neo 16S AI have?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch WQXGA (2560 \\u00d7 1600) OLED at 240Hz.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, two USB-C ports with Thunderbolt 4.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-rtx-5060-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(799,43,4,'Huawei FreeClip 2','huawei-freeclips-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,33990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-14','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei FreeClip 2 costs <strong>Rs 33,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 14 June 2026. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 10.8mm dual diaphram driver. Battery: Music: 9 hours (buds) / 38 hours (case); 40 minutes (buds) / 2.5 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, L2HC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP57 dust and water resistance, Case: IP54 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-liberty-5-pro\">Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro</a> (Rs 34,999) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro\">Samsung Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> (Rs 35,799). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=huawei-freeclips-2&g2=soundcore-liberty-5-pro\">compare the Huawei FreeClip 2 with the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei FreeClip 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei FreeClip 2 costs Rs 33,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei FreeClip 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 June 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei FreeClip 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 9 hours (buds) \\/ 38 hours (case); 40 minutes (buds) \\/ 2.5 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-06-13 18:15:00','2026-06-13 18:15:00'),(800,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025','lenovo-legion-5-15iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-5-15iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,284999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025 costs <strong>Rs 2,84,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX, RTX 5060, 16GB/1TB model. The Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5070, 32GB/512GB version costs Rs 5,39,900. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX (TSMC N3B), 20 cores / 20 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.1 inches, OLED, WQXGA (2560 x 1600) 16 : 10 aspect ratio, 165Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.9 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 245W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,89,900) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-premium-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Dell 14 Premium DA14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,80,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-legion-5-15iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5060&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">compare the Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025 with the Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025 starts at Rs 2,84,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,84,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX, RTX 5060, 16GB\\/1TB; Rs 5,39,900 for Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5070, 32GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"qu