25. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 226V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.50 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 65 Wh Li-ion, Li-Ion 65 W; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-7-a715-59g-76rm-2026-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-3050\">Acer Aspire 7 A715-59G-76RM 2026 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 1,54,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Swift 14 AI SF14-51-50P8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,60,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Swift 14 AI SF14-51-50P8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Swift 14 AI SF14-51-50P8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 226V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(810,48,3,'MSI Raider GE68 HX 13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700HX)','msi-raider-ge68-hx-13v-2023-i7-13700hx-rtx-4070-240hz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 3,50,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Raider GE68 HX 13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700HX) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 3,50,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-13700HX (Intel 7), 16 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, QHD+ (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 2.7 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 99.9 Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current MSI alternative is the <a href=\"/products/msi-vector-gp68-hx-2023-i9-13980hx-rtx-4070\">MSI Vector GP68 HX 13VG 2023 (Intel Core i9-13980HX)</a> (Rs 3,47,700).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the MSI Raider GE68 HX 13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700HX) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 3,50,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the MSI Raider GE68 HX 13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the MSI Raider GE68 HX 13V 2023 (Intel Core i7-13700HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13700HX (Intel 7), 16 cores \\/ 24 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(811,8,3,'HP Victus 15 (Core i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB)','hp-victus-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-victus-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,146499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Victus 15 is HP\'s entry ticket to gaming, and its understated design is a big part of the appeal. It looks like a normal laptop in a classroom or office, then runs Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite at high frame rates in the evening. ONIN Infosys sells this configuration for <strong>Rs 1,46,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It has an 8-core <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> (up to 4.6GHz), an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong>, <strong>16GB of DDR4-3200</strong> and a 512GB PCIe Gen 4 SSD. The 15.6-inch FHD IPS panel runs at <strong>144Hz</strong> at 300 nits, though its 62.5% sRGB coverage means colours are a little muted. Ports include USB-C, two USB-A, HDMI and a full-size SD card reader. The battery is 52.5Wh, and it weighs about 2.3 kg.</p>\n<p>It\'s priced close to the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9</a>, which has a 100% sRGB screen and a 95W RTX 3050. That\'s the stronger gaming machine. Buy the Victus if you prefer its quieter look, or if the extra Rs 21,000 for the <a href=\"/products/hp-victus-15-i5-13420h-rtx-4050\">RTX 4050 Victus</a> is out of reach.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Victus 15 RTX 3050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP Victus 15 (2023) with Core i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,46,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Victus 15 screen?\",\"answer\":\"144Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the HP Victus 15 have an SD card reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a multi-format SD card reader.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP Victus 15 (Core i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-victus-15-i5-13th-gen-rtx-3050-6gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-victus-15-i5-13th-gen-rtx-3050-6gb-price-nepal',NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(812,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)','asus-zenbook-14-2024-oled-ryzen-7-8840hs',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-2024-oled-ryzen-7-8840hs.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,74,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-05-25','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,74,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 25 May 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.2 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H)</a> (Rs 1,74,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,74,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 May 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-24 18:15:00','2025-05-24 18:15:00'),(813,40,3,'Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)','asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30.webp',NULL,NULL,93900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) costs <strong>Rs 93,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 3 30 (6nm), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 93,000) and the <a href=\"/products/msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> (Rs 93,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30&g2=asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024\">compare the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) with the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) costs Rs 93,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 3 30 (6nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(814,40,3,'Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED M5606KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)','asus-vivobook-s-16-oled-m5606ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-3k-oled',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s-16-oled-m5606ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-3k-oled.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,69,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED M5606KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,69,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.50 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H)</a> (Rs 1,70,905).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED M5606KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,69,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED M5606KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED M5606KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(815,38,5,'Honor Watch X5i','honor-watch-x5i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-watch-x5i.webp',NULL,NULL,8999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Watch X5i costs <strong>Rs 8,999</strong> in Nepal for the Defult model. It launched in Nepal on 25 August 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.97 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 21 days (typical usage) / Up to 6 days (AOD); Li-Po 420 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4. Water resistance: 1 ATM water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-11\">Huawei Band 11</a> (Rs 9,990) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-watch-x5-play\">Honor Watch X5 Play</a> (Rs 7,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=honor-watch-x5i&g2=huawei-band-11\">compare the Honor Watch X5i with the Huawei Band 11</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Watch X5i costs Rs 8,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Watch X5i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 21 days (typical usage) \\/ Up to 6 days (AOD); Li-Po 420 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,6,'2026-08-24 18:15:00','2026-08-24 18:15:00'),(816,43,5,'Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro','huawei-watch-fit-5-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-fit-5-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,43990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-16','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro costs <strong>Rs 43,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.92 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 471 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, LE, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS (B1I+B1C+B2a), Galileo (E1+E5a), Glonass, NavIC, QZSS (L1+L5), NFC. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance, IP6X dust resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-gt-7\">Huawei Watch GT 7</a> (Rs 44,990) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-6\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 6</a> (Rs 44,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-fit-5-pro&g2=huawei-watch-gt-7\">compare the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro with the Huawei Watch GT 7</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro costs Rs 43,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 471 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-08-15 18:15:00','2026-08-15 18:15:00'),(817,43,5,'Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro','huawei-watch-fit-4-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-fit-4-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,38990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro costs <strong>Rs 38,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 6 June 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.82 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 400 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS (L1+L5), Galileo (L1+L5), Glonass, QZSS (L1+L5), NFC. Water resistance: IP6X dust resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, EN13319 dive compliance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-watch-s5\">Xiaomi Watch S5</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-cheetah\">Amazfit Cheetah</a> (Rs 36,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-fit-4-pro&g2=xiaomi-watch-s5\">compare the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro with the Xiaomi Watch S5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro costs Rs 38,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 400 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-05 18:15:00','2025-06-05 18:15:00'),(818,43,5,'Huawei Band 11 Pro','huawei-band-11-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-band-11-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,14990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>GPS inside a slim band is rare. The Band 11 Pro lets runners leave the phone at home without wearing a large watch, and keeps Huawei\'s dependable sleep and swim tracking with about a week of battery.</p>\n<p>At Rs 14,990 full-size watches with GPS cost less, the Redmi Watch 6 Active among them. Choose this one for comfort, small wrists and sleep. On Android, Huawei Health is installed from Huawei\'s site.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Band 11 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Band 11 Pro costs Rs 14,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Band 11 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Band 11 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 8 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-14 18:15:00','2026-04-14 18:15:00'),(819,43,5,'Huawei Band 11','huawei-band-11',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-band-11.webp',NULL,NULL,9990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Band 11 costs <strong>Rs 9,990</strong> in Nepal for the Durable Polymer model. The Aluminium Alloy version costs Rs 11,990. It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.62 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 8 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode). Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-watch-x5i\">Honor Watch X5i</a> (Rs 8,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-watch-5\">Realme Watch 5</a> (Rs 10,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-band-11&g2=honor-watch-x5i\">compare the Huawei Band 11 with the Honor Watch X5i</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Band 11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Band 11 starts at Rs 9,990 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 9,990 for Durable Polymer; Rs 11,990 for Aluminium Alloy.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Band 11 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Band 11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 8 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-14 18:15:00','2026-04-14 18:15:00'),(820,41,3,'Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)','acer-nitro-v-15-anv15-52-57dy-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-5050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,182400.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Among the cheapest laptops with a 50-series graphics chip, this Nitro V 15 brings frame generation and newer video encoders to a Rs 1,82,400 machine. The Core 5 210H is sufficient, and the keyboard and cooling are familiar Nitro.</p>\n<p>Its 135W charger suggests a lower graphics power limit, so read the figure in Nvidia Control Panel before buying. A Lenovo LOQ 15 for about Rs 12,500 more runs the same chip at 100W with a better screen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs Rs 1,82,400 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(821,41,3,'Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H)','acer-nitro-lite-16-2025-13th-gen-i7-13620h-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,169999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A 16-inch 165Hz screen, a ten-core i7 and an RTX 4050 for Rs 1,69,999 make the Nitro Lite 16 one of the more affordable ways into modern gaming and engineering software.</p>\n<p>It is called Lite because the graphics chip probably runs at moderate power. It will still outpace any RTX 3050 laptop. Add a second SSD early, since 512GB holds only a few games. <a href=\"/reviews/acer-nitro-lite-16-rtx-4050-review-nepal\">Our review</a> shows what to test in the shop.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs Rs 1,69,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(822,64,5,'MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2','mwc-callisto-watch-pro-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,11999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 costs <strong>Rs 11,999</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 1 February 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Connectivity: GPS: Yes, with GPS. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/cmf-watch-pro-2\">CMF Watch Pro 2</a> (Rs 11,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-watch-5\">Realme Watch 5</a> (Rs 10,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=mwc-callisto-watch-pro-2&g2=cmf-watch-pro-2\">compare the MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 with the CMF Watch Pro 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 costs Rs 11,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-31 18:15:00','2026-01-31 18:15:00'),(823,64,5,'MWC Aether One Watch Pro','mwc-aether-one-watch-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>On paper this is the most watch you can buy for Rs 7,000: a round AMOLED, built-in GPS, an altimeter, 5ATM water resistance and Bluetooth calls. Walkers and new runners will see why it is tempting.</p>\n<p>The brand is young, so the app\'s long-term support and the accuracy of its sensors are less proven than Xiaomi\'s or Huawei\'s. Agree on a return period, take it for a run beside a phone and compare the maps. If they match, you have a bargain.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MWC Aether One Watch Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MWC Aether One Watch Pro costs Rs 6,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-23 18:15:00','2026-02-23 18:15:00'),(824,9,3,'Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100)','dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,58999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) costs <strong>Rs 58,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2023. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Celeron N4100 (14nm), 4 cores / 4 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.79 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ian8-2023-intel-n100\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IAN8 2023</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100&g2=hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">compare the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) with the HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) costs Rs 58,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Celeron N4100 (14nm), 4 cores \\/ 4 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(825,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050)','asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,194499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The TUF A16 is a 16-inch gaming laptop that\'s easy to live with. It has a taller 16:10 screen for work, a USB4 port and lots of upgrade room. ONIN Infosys sells the FA607NUQ for <strong>Rs 1,94,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 7 170</strong> is a proper 8-core, 16-thread chip (up to 4.75GHz), so streaming, recording gameplay and video exports don\'t stall. ONIN lists the <strong>RTX 4050 6GB</strong> at up to 140W, a generous power budget for this GPU, which helps it sustain frame rates in long sessions. Expect 1080p high settings in most games with DLSS.</p>\n<p>The upgrade story is excellent. There are <strong>two SO-DIMM slots</strong> (16GB DDR5 now, up to 64GB) and <strong>two M.2 slots</strong>, so adding a second SSD for your game library is easy. Ports include USB4 with DisplayPort and charging, a 10Gbps USB-C, two USB-A and HDMI 2.1. The keyboard has RGB lighting and a Copilot key. The 56Wh battery is average, and the webcam is only 720p.</p>\n<p>If you want the newer RTX 50-series for similar money, the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050\">TUF F16 with RTX 5050</a> has 8GB of VRAM and a 1080p webcam.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF A16 FA607NUQ price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF A16 FA607NUQ with Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,94,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much can the TUF A16 be upgraded?\",\"answer\":\"It has two SO-DIMM slots (up to 64GB DDR5) and two M.2 PCIe slots for storage.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the TUF A16 have USB4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one USB4 Type-C port with DisplayPort and power delivery support.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-ryzen-7-rtx-4050-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-ryzen-7-rtx-4050-price-nepal',NULL,4,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(826,61,37,'Soundcore Q20i','soundcore-q20i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-q20i.webp',NULL,NULL,9199.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Q20i costs <strong>Rs 9,199</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2023. At this price, expect comfortable everyday listening rather than audiophile detail.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-530c\">JBL Tune 530C</a> (Rs 9,499) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-530bt\">JBL Tune 530BT</a> (Rs 9,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-q20i&g2=jbl-tune-530c\">compare the Soundcore Q20i with the JBL Tune 530C</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q20i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Q20i costs Rs 9,199 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Q20i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q20i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(827,61,37,'Soundcore Q11i','soundcore-q11i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-q11i.webp',NULL,NULL,4999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Q11i costs <strong>Rs 4,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2025. At this price, expect comfortable everyday listening rather than audiophile detail.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-rockerz-650-pro\">boAt Rockerz 650 Pro</a> (Rs 6,299) and the <a href=\"/products/boat-rockerz-412\">boAt Rockerz 412</a> (Rs 3,099). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-q11i&g2=boat-rockerz-650-pro\">compare the Soundcore Q11i with the boAt Rockerz 650 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q11i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Q11i costs Rs 4,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Q11i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q11i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(828,61,37,'Soundcore Space 2','soundcore-space-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-space-2.webp',NULL,NULL,24499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Space 2 costs <strong>Rs 24,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 15 October 2026. This range brings noise cancellation and longer battery life.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm double-layered dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 50 hours, With ANC on, 70 hours, With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.1, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, LDAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-space-one-pro\">Soundcore Space One Pro</a> (Rs 25,499) and the <a href=\"/products/nothing-headphone-a\">Nothing Headphone (a)</a> (Rs 26,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-space-2&g2=soundcore-space-one-pro\">compare the Soundcore Space 2 with the Soundcore Space One Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Space 2 costs Rs 24,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Space 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 50 hours, With ANC on, 70 hours, With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-14 18:15:00','2026-10-14 18:15:00'),(829,61,37,'Soundcore Space One Pro','soundcore-space-one-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-space-one-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,25499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Space One Pro costs <strong>Rs 25,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2024. This range brings noise cancellation and longer battery life.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 8 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, LDAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-space-2\">Soundcore Space 2</a> (Rs 24,499) and the <a href=\"/products/nothing-headphone-a\">Nothing Headphone (a)</a> (Rs 26,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-space-one-pro&g2=soundcore-space-2\">compare the Soundcore Space One Pro with the Soundcore Space 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space One Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Space One Pro costs Rs 25,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Space One Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space One Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 8 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(830,39,3,'Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)','lenovo-yoga-9-14ill10-2025-core-ultra-7-258v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,369999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs <strong>Rs 3,69,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WQXGA+ (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.32 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5\">Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5)</a> (Rs 3,76,500) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5\">Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025)</a> (Rs 3,76,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-yoga-9-14ill10-2025-core-ultra-7-258v&g2=macbook-pro-14-m5\">compare the Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) with the Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs Rs 3,69,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(831,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606KA 2024 (Ryzen AI 7 350)','asus-zenbook-s-16-oled-um5606ka-2024-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-16-3k-120hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-16-oled-um5606ka-2024-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-16-3k-120hz.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 3,39,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606KA 2024 (Ryzen AI 7 350) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 3,39,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 7 350 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 78 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,29,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606KA 2024 (Ryzen AI 7 350) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 3,39,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606KA 2024 (Ryzen AI 7 350) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606KA 2024 (Ryzen AI 7 350) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 7 350 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(832,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 15X OLED M3504YA 2023 (RYZE