f-watch-pro-2\">CMF Watch Pro 2</a> (Rs 11,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=realme-watch-5&g2=redmi-watch-6-active\">compare the Realme Watch 5 with the Redmi Watch 6 Active</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Watch 5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Watch 5 costs Rs 10,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Watch 5 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 26 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Watch 5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 16 days (normal usage), Up to 20 days (light mode); 460 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-25 18:15:00','2026-07-25 18:15:00'),(840,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Watch 7','samsung-galaxy-watch-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,28500.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-07-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 costs <strong>Rs 28,500</strong> in Nepal for the 40mm (Wi-Fi only) model. The 44mm (Wi-Fi only) version costs Rs 31,500. It launched in Nepal on 25 July 2024. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 40 mm: 1.3 inches, 44 mm: 1.5 inches, Super AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 40 hours (normal usage), Up to 30 hours (AOD On); 40 mm: Li-Ion 300 mAh, 44 mm: Li-Ion 425 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, Beidou, Gonass, Galileo, NFC. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, MIL-STD 810H certified. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-fit-5\">Huawei Watch Fit 5</a> (Rs 27,990) and the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-watch-2\">OnePlus Watch 2</a> (Rs 23,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=samsung-galaxy-watch-7&g2=huawei-watch-fit-5\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 with the Huawei Watch Fit 5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 starts at Rs 28,500 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 28,500 for 40mm (Wi-Fi only); Rs 31,500 for 44mm (Wi-Fi only).\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 July 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 40 hours (normal usage), Up to 30 hours (AOD On); 40 mm: Li-Ion 300 mAh, 44 mm: Li-Ion 425 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-07-24 18:15:00','2024-07-24 18:15:00'),(841,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic','samsung-galaxy-watch-6-classic',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,64999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-08-13','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic costs <strong>Rs 64,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 13 August 2023. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.5 inches, Super AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 40 hours (normal usage), Up to 30 hours (AOD On); Li-Ion 425 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, Beidou, Galileo, Glonass, NFC. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, MIL-STD 810H certified. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-d2\">Huawei Watch D2</a> (Rs 64,990) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-gt-7-pro\">Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro</a> (Rs 64,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=samsung-galaxy-watch-6-classic&g2=huawei-watch-d2\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic with the Huawei Watch D2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic costs Rs 64,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 13 August 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 40 hours (normal usage), Up to 30 hours (AOD On); Li-Ion 425 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-08-12 18:15:00','2023-08-12 18:15:00'),(842,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Watch 8','samsung-galaxy-watch-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,61999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-05','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 costs <strong>Rs 61,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 5 August 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 42 mm: 1.34 inches, 46 mm: 1.47 inches, Super AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 40 hours (normal usage); 42 mm: Li-Ion 325 mAh, 46 mm: Li-Ion 435 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, Beidou, Galileo, Glonass, NFC. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, MIL-STD 810H certified. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-d2\">Huawei Watch D2</a> (Rs 64,990) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-gt-7-pro\">Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro</a> (Rs 64,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=samsung-galaxy-watch-8&g2=huawei-watch-d2\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 with the Huawei Watch D2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 costs Rs 61,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 40 hours (normal usage); 42 mm: Li-Ion 325 mAh, 46 mm: Li-Ion 435 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-04 18:15:00','2025-08-04 18:15:00'),(843,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Watch FE','samsung-galaxy-watch-fe',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-watch-fe.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-12-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Watch FE costs <strong>Rs 21,999</strong> in Nepal for the 40mm model. It launched in Nepal on 6 December 2024. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.2 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 40 hours (normal usage); Li-Ion 247 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, Beidou, Gonass, Galileo, NFC. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, MIL-STD 810H certified. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-fit-4\">Huawei Watch Fit 4</a> (Rs 22,990) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-watch-6\">Redmi Watch 6</a> (Rs 20,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=samsung-galaxy-watch-fe&g2=huawei-watch-fit-4\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Watch FE with the Huawei Watch Fit 4</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch FE price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Watch FE costs Rs 21,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Watch FE launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 December 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch FE battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 40 hours (normal usage); Li-Ion 247 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-05 18:15:00','2024-12-05 18:15:00'),(844,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Fit 3','galaxy-fit-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,7999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-03-11','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Galaxy Fit 3 is a band with a watch-like screen. Its wide AMOLED is comfortable to read, the battery runs for close to two weeks, and features such as fall detection and an emergency alert make it a thoughtful gift for an older parent with a Samsung phone.</p>\n<p>It works only with Android, has no GPS of its own and does not run apps. Within those limits it is polished and reliable. At about Rs 8,000 it is our first suggestion for Galaxy owners who want steps, sleep and notifications and nothing to charge at night.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 costs Rs 7,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 11 March 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 13 days (normal usage); 208 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-03-10 18:15:00','2024-03-10 18:15:00'),(845,41,3,'Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H)','acer-nitro-lite-16-anl16-71g-2025-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,151999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) costs <strong>Rs 1,51,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-13420H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 165Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.95 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 53 Wh; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-m3407ha-2025\">Asus Vivobook S14 M3407HA 2025</a> (Rs 1,52,999) and the <a href=\"/products/hp-victus-15\">HP Victus 15</a> (Rs 1,49,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-nitro-lite-16-anl16-71g-2025-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050&g2=asus-vivobook-s14-m3407ha-2025\">compare the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) with the Asus Vivobook S14 M3407HA 2025</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) costs Rs 1,51,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-71G 2025 (Intel Core i5-13420H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-13420H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(846,8,3,'HP Victus 15 15‑FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS)','hp-victus-15-2025-ryzen-5-8645hs-rtx-3050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,148999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Victus 15 15‑FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) costs <strong>Rs 1,48,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 8645HS (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.29 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 70 Wh; 200W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-victus-15\">HP Victus 15</a> (Rs 1,49,000) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-gaming-3-2023-i7-12700h\">Lenovo Ideapad Gaming 3 (12th Gen i7-12700H)</a> (Rs 1,49,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-victus-15-2025-ryzen-5-8645hs-rtx-3050&g2=hp-victus-15\">compare the HP Victus 15 15‑FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) with the HP Victus 15</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Victus 15 15\\u2011FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Victus 15 15\\u2011FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) costs Rs 1,48,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP Victus 15 15\\u2011FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Victus 15 15\\u2011FB3009AX 2025 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 8645HS (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(847,8,3,'HP Victus 15 2023 (13th Gen i5-13420H)','hp-victus-15-2023-13th-gen-i5-13420h-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-victus-15-2023-13th-gen-i5-13420h-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,165999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Of the many Victus 15 versions, this is the one to look for. The RTX 4050 is a clear step above the 3050 models that share the name, and the Core i5-13420H keeps up with it in games and in student software.</p>\n<p>The design passes in a classroom and the 150W adapter leaves the graphics some room. Battery life is short, as with all gaming laptops at this level. At about Rs 1,66,000 compare it with the Nitro Lite 16, and choose by graphics power and warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Victus 15 2023 (13th Gen i5-13420H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Victus 15 2023 (13th Gen i5-13420H) costs Rs 1,65,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Victus 15 2023 (13th Gen i5-13420H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-13420H, 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(848,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga.webp',NULL,NULL,131999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Behind a modest lid sits a Ryzen 7 8840HS with eight strong cores and some of the best integrated graphics available. For computing, data and engineering students it offers more working speed per rupee than anything else we list without a graphics card.</p>\n<p>The touch screen is plain and the 50Wh battery drains quickly under load, so it suits people who sit near a socket. Ask whether a memory slot is free. <a href=\"/reviews/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-ryzen-7-8840hs-review-nepal\">Our review</a> matches it to courses.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) costs Rs 1,31,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(849,9,3,'Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250)','dell-16-dc16255-2025-ryzen-7-250-16gb-1tb-16-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,134999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) costs <strong>Rs 1,34,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 250 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.98 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-neo\">Apple MacBook Neo</a> (Rs 1,34,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026\">Dell XPS 13 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,34,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-16-dc16255-2025-ryzen-7-250-16gb-1tb-16-fhd&g2=macbook-neo\">compare the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) with the Apple MacBook Neo</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) costs Rs 1,34,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 250 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(850,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB/1TB, Touch)','acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,126499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 14 AI is one of the most affordable <strong>Lunar Lake</strong> laptops in Nepal, and Lunar Lake is all about <strong>battery life</strong>. Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 5 226V</strong> has 8 cores, a 40 TOPS NPU (so it\'s a Copilot+ PC), and Arc 130V graphics, with 16GB of very fast LPDDR5X-8533 built into the chip package. ONIN Infosys sells the A14-52MT-59DP in Steel Grey for <strong>Rs 1,26,499</strong>, with a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD.</p>\n<p>Combined with a <strong>65Wh battery</strong>, that efficiency translates into long unplugged days of office work, browsing and video. The 14-inch WUXGA IPS screen is a <strong>touchscreen</strong> with a matte ComfyView finish, a rare combination that reduces reflections while still letting you tap and scroll. There are two <strong>USB4</strong> ports for fast storage and docking, plus two USB-A and HDMI. It weighs about 1.4 kg.</p>\n<p>The memory can\'t be upgraded, but 16GB at this speed is comfortable for its intended use. For much more power in the same chassis, the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Aspire 14 AI with Core Ultra 9 288V and 32GB</a> costs about Rs 60,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AI Core Ultra 5 226V price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-59DP with Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,26,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 14 AI a Copilot+ PC?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The Core Ultra 5 226V\'s NPU delivers up to 40 TOPS, which meets the Copilot+ requirement.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Aspire 14 AI a touchscreen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a 14-inch WUXGA IPS touchscreen with a matte finish.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB\\/1TB, Touch)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-59dp-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-59dp-price-nepal',NULL,5,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(851,2,4,'AirPods 4','airpods-4',NULL,'gadgets/2026/airpods-4.webp',NULL,NULL,24999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-11-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The AirPods 4 costs <strong>Rs 24,999</strong> in Nepal. The with ANC version costs Rs 34,999. It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2024. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: Custom high-excursion Apple driver. Battery: Music: 5 hours (buds) / 30 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1 hour playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance, Case: IP54 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4\">Samsung Galaxy Buds 4</a> (Rs 26,099) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-clips\">JBL Soundgear Clips</a> (Rs 23,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=airpods-4&g2=samsung-galaxy-buds4\">compare the AirPods 4 with the Samsung Galaxy Buds 4</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the AirPods 4 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The AirPods 4 starts at Rs 24,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 24,999 for ; Rs 34,999 for with ANC.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the AirPods 4 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the AirPods 4 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 5 hours (buds) \\/ 30 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1 hour playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2024-11-05 18:15:00','2024-11-05 18:15:00'),(852,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb.webp',NULL,NULL,165600.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs <strong>Rs 1,65,600</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 144Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 2.2 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 56 Wh; 150W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP9 2024</a> (Rs 1,65,499) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 2024</a> (Rs 1,65,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb&g2=lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) with the Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP9 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs Rs 1,65,600 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(853,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h.webp',NULL,NULL,123999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 costs <strong>Rs 1,23,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB/512GB model. The Intel Core Ultra 7 240H, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,37,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.3 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-16-a16-52p-intel-core-i5-1334u\">Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-52P 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> (Rs 1,23,500) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52M-51S1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)</a> (Rs 1,24,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h&g2=acer-aspire-lite-16-a16-52p-intel-core-i5-1334u\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 with the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-52P 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 starts at Rs 1,23,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,23,999 for Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,37,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 240H, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(854,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P (Core i3 N355, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355.webp',NULL,NULL,79499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P is a light, quiet laptop for study and office work, and ONIN Infosys\'s listing has a useful extra: a <strong>2-year official warranty</strong> at <strong>Rs 79,499</strong>. For a first laptop that a student will rely on through most of a degree, two years of cover is worth a lot.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Intel Core i3 N355</strong> has 8 cores (up to 3.9GHz). That\'s plenty for Office, web apps, Zoom and streaming, though not for heavy creative software. You get 8GB of LPDDR5, soldered, and a <strong>512GB</strong> SSD. The 14-inch screen is a 16:10 <strong>WUXGA</strong> IPS panel with a matte ComfyView finish, which handles bright rooms better than glossy budget screens.</p>\n<p>It weighs about 1.35 kg and has a USB-C port, three USB-A ports, HDMI and a microSD slot. The cheaper <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-45p-ryzen-3-5400u\">AL14-45P with Ryzen 3</a> has a bigger 58Wh battery. This N355 model trades that for a newer, more efficient chip and the longer warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 14 Core i3 N355 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P with Core i3 N355, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 79,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Core i3 N355 have?\",\"answer\":\"8 cores and 8 threads, boosting to 3.9GHz.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 8GB LPDDR5 is on board.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P (Core i3 N355, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-30j8-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-30j8-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(855,41,3,'Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)','acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,115999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) costs <strong>Rs 1,15,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 115U (Intel 4), 8 cores / 10 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 55 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024\">Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 1,15,900) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-spin-5-2023-i5-1335u\">Acer Spin 5 A5SP14-51MTN-58HT 2023 (13th Gen i5-1335U)</a> (Rs 1,15,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u&g2=asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024\">compare the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) with the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) costs Rs 1,15,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 115U (Intel 4), 8 cores \\/ 10 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(856,8,3,'HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 (Core 7 150U, 16GB/512GB)','hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,153999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OmniBook 5 Flip is a convertible that gets the practical things right. It has a big <strong>68Wh battery</strong>, a <strong>5MP IR camera</strong> that makes you look sharp on calls and logs you in with your face, and a 360-degree hinge for tablet and tent modes. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 1,53,999</strong>, with lifetime software support and free servicing from the store.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 7 150U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.4GHz), which is quick for office, study and creative-lite work, with 16GB of LPDDR5 and an upgradeable 512GB Gen 4 SSD. The 14-inch 1920 × 1200 IPS touchscreen is 300 nits, fine indoors and good for pen notes.</p>\n<p>Ports cover everything most people need: two 10Gbps USB-C ports with charging and DisplayPort, two USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1.</p>\n<p>Against the <a href=\"/products/hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-core-ultra-5-226v\">OmniBook X Flip</a>, which costs about the same, the 5 Flip has the bigger battery and the better camera. The X Flip has the more modern Lunar Lake chip with an NPU, Thunderbolt 4 and a brighter glass-covered screen. For video calls and battery life, we\'d lean towards the 5 Flip.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 with Core 7 150U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,53,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What camera does the OmniBook 5 Flip have?\",\"answer\":\"An HP 5MP IR camera with Windows Hello face login.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"68Wh, 4-cell.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 (Core 7 150U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14fp0023dx-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14fp0023dx-price-nepal',NULL,3,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(857,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)','lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430.webp',NULL,NULL,145999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) costs <strong>Rs 1,45,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 430 (4