, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.1, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LDAC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro\">Samsung Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> (Rs 35,799) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-liberty-5-pro\">Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro</a> (Rs 34,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=soundcore-liberty-5-pro-max&g2=samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro\">compare the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max with the Samsung Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6.5 hours (buds) \\/ 28 hours (case), With ANC on; 3 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-31 18:15:00','2026-10-31 18:15:00'),(859,65,5,'Ultima Watch Navigator','ultima-watch-navigator',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-05-23','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Ultima Watch Navigator costs <strong>Rs 6,999</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 23 May 2025. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 47 mm: 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Connectivity: GPS: Yes, with GPS. Water resistance: 3 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\">MWC Aether One Watch Pro</a> (Rs 6,999) and the <a href=\"/products/boat-enigma-radiant\">boAt Enigma Radiant</a> (Rs 6,799). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=ultima-watch-navigator&g2=mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\">compare the Ultima Watch Navigator with the MWC Aether One Watch Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Ultima Watch Navigator price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Ultima Watch Navigator costs Rs 6,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-22 18:15:00','2025-05-22 18:15:00'),(860,65,5,'Ultima Watch Active','ultima-watch-active',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Ultima Watch Active costs <strong>Rs 4,299</strong> in Nepal. It was announced in 2024. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches display. Connectivity: Bluetooth v5.3. Water resistance: IP68. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-watch-5-active\">Redmi Watch 5 Active</a> (Rs 4,499) and the <a href=\"/products/ultima-watch-circle-2-0\">Ultima Watch Circle 2.0</a> (Rs 3,699). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=ultima-watch-active&g2=redmi-watch-5-active\">compare the Ultima Watch Active with the Redmi Watch 5 Active</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Ultima Watch Active price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Ultima Watch Active costs Rs 4,299 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(861,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u.webp',NULL,NULL,81999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs <strong>Rs 81,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.62 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 47 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 80,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022\">Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)</a> (Rs 83,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u&g2=lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) with the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs Rs 81,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(862,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB/1TB)','acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,186499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>It looks like an ordinary 14-inch Aspire, but inside is the top Lunar Lake chip. The <strong>Core Ultra 9 288V</strong> boosts higher than any other chip in the range, has a <strong>48 TOPS NPU</strong> and the strongest <strong>Arc 140V</strong> graphics, and comes with a generous <strong>32GB</strong> of LPDDR5X. ONIN Infosys sells the A14-52MT-94H5 for <strong>Rs 1,86,499</strong> with a 1TB SSD.</p>\n<p>That makes it a sleeper. Arc 140V handles light video editing, Lightroom and even modern games at modest settings far better than you\'d expect from an \"Aspire\". The 32GB of memory keeps virtual machines, large datasets and heavy browser work comfortable for years. Battery life stays excellent thanks to the efficient Lunar Lake design and a 65Wh battery.</p>\n<p>The design is shared with the cheaper <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Core Ultra 5 Aspire 14 AI</a>: a 14-inch WUXGA matte touchscreen, two USB4 ports, two USB-A, HDMI and about 1.4 kg. The screen is the one part that doesn\'t feel premium at this price. If you want this much power with an OLED, look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AI Ultra 9 288V price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 with Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,86,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM does the Aspire 14 AI Ultra 9 have?\",\"answer\":\"32GB of LPDDR5X, integrated into the processor package and not upgradeable.\"},{\"question\":\"What graphics does the Core Ultra 9 288V have?\",\"answer\":\"Intel Arc 140V integrated graphics.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-price-nepal',NULL,3,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(863,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)','lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,209999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) costs <strong>Rs 2,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 170 (6nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-13-pb13255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350\">Dell Pro 13 PB13255 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 Pro 350)</a> (Rs 2,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z16-2022-ryzen-7-pro-6850h-rx6500m\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z16 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850H)</a> (Rs 2,10,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050&g2=dell-pro-13-pb13255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350\">compare the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) with the Dell Pro 13 PB13255 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 Pro 350)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) costs Rs 2,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 170 (6nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(864,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g814fp-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,399999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>An 18-inch desktop replacement with a sixteen-core Ryzen 9 9955HX, 32GB of memory and an RTX 5070. At about Rs 4 lakh it costs less than some Strix models with the same graphics chip and half the memory, so the listing deserves a second look.</p>\n<p>It is heavy, its charger is heavier, and it belongs on a desk. The RTX 5070 laptop chip has 8GB of video memory, a limit for high-resolution work. For coders, editors and players who move house more often than rooms, it is a lot of machine.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX) costs Rs 3,99,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 9 9955HX (4nm), 16 cores \\/ 32 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(865,10,37,'JBL TOUR ONE M2','jbl-tour-one-m2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The JBL TOUR ONE M2 costs <strong>Rs 39,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you are buying top-tier noise cancellation, comfort and sound quality.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 30 hours, With ANC on, 50 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, LC3.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sony-wh-ult900n-ult-wear\">Sony WH-ULT900N ULT WEAR</a> (Rs 35,000) and the <a href=\"/products/sony-wh-g500-inzone-h5\">Sony WH-G500 INZONE H5</a> (Rs 28,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=jbl-tour-one-m2&g2=sony-wh-ult900n-ult-wear\">compare the JBL TOUR ONE M2 with the Sony WH-ULT900N ULT WEAR</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL TOUR ONE M2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL TOUR ONE M2 costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL TOUR ONE M2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL TOUR ONE M2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 30 hours, With ANC on, 50 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(866,6,4,'Realme Buds Air 8','realme-buds-air-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,8499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-11-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Comfort and battery are what people notice first with the Buds Air 8: light stems, and fourteen hours between charges. Noise cancelling is good for the price and calls hold up better than on cheaper Realme pairs.</p>\n<p>They sit next to the CMF Buds 2 Plus, which cancel slightly more noise for Rs 500 extra. With a Realme phone, or as part of a launch bundle, the Air 8 are the natural choice.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds Air 8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds Air 8 costs Rs 8,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds Air 8 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds Air 8 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 14 hours (buds) \\/ 58 hours (case), With ANC off, 50% volume, AAC, 8 hours (buds) \\/ 30 hours (case), With ANC on, 50% volume, AAC, 5.5 hours (buds) \\/ 21 hours (case), With ANC on, 50% volume, LHDC; 60 minutes (buds) \\/ 120 minutes (case).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-11-05 18:15:00','2026-11-05 18:15:00'),(867,40,3,'Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500)','asus-vivobook-go-14-e410ka-2023-intel-celeron-n4500-8gb-256gb-14-fhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-go-14-e410ka-2023-intel-celeron-n4500-8gb-256gb-14-fhd.webp',NULL,NULL,45999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) costs <strong>Rs 45,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2023. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Celeron N4500 (10nm), 2 cores / 2 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.30 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 33W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ian8-2023-intel-n100\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IAN8 2023</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-go-14-e410ka-2023-intel-celeron-n4500-8gb-256gb-14-fhd&g2=hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">compare the Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) with the HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) costs Rs 45,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook Go 14 E410KA 2023 (Intel Celeron N4500) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Celeron N4500 (10nm), 2 cores \\/ 2 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(868,10,37,'JBL Tune 530C','jbl-tune-530c',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-19','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A wired pair in a wireless world, the Tune 530C plugs into USB-C and simply works: no charging, no pairing, no delay. For editing, online teaching, exams that forbid Bluetooth and late-night games, that is an advantage.</p>\n<p>The on-ear pads are light and begin to press after an hour. Make sure that your phone or laptop sends audio through its USB-C port, as a few do not. The sound is JBL\'s energetic style and can be softened with an equaliser.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Tune 530C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Tune 530C costs Rs 9,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Tune 530C launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 19 October 2026.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-18 18:15:00','2026-10-18 18:15:00'),(869,10,4,'JBL Soundgear Clips','jbl-soundgear-clips',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,23000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-02','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The JBL Soundgear Clips costs <strong>Rs 23,000</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 2 August 2025. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 11 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 8 hours (buds) / 32 hours (case), With ANC off. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sasmung-galaxy-buds3\">Samsung Galaxy Buds3</a> (Rs 22,999) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-sense\">JBL Soundgear Sense</a> (Rs 22,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=jbl-soundgear-clips&g2=sasmung-galaxy-buds3\">compare the JBL Soundgear Clips with the Samsung Galaxy Buds3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Soundgear Clips price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Soundgear Clips costs Rs 23,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Soundgear Clips launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 2 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Soundgear Clips battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 32 hours (case), With ANC off.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-01 18:15:00','2025-08-01 18:15:00'),(870,10,4,'JBL Live Flex 3','jbl-live-flex-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,28999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-11-13','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The JBL Live Flex 3 costs <strong>Rs 28,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 13 November 2026. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes. Drivers: 12 mm. Battery: Music: 10 hours (buds) / 40 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: IP54.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-live-beam-3\">JBL Live Beam 3</a> (Rs 28,999) and the <a href=\"/products/sony-wfc700n\">Sony WF‑C700N</a> (Rs 28,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=jbl-live-flex-3&g2=jbl-live-beam-3\">compare the JBL Live Flex 3 with the JBL Live Beam 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Live Flex 3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Live Flex 3 costs Rs 28,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Live Flex 3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 13 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Live Flex 3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 10 hours (buds) \\/ 40 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-11-12 18:15:00','2026-11-12 18:15:00'),(871,10,4,'JBL Wave Flex 2','jbl-wave-flex-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,13499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,