 href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=jbl-live-beam-3&g2=jbl-live-flex-3\">compare the JBL Live Beam 3 with the JBL Live Flex 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Live Beam 3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Live Beam 3 costs Rs 28,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Live Beam 3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 13 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Live Beam 3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 12 hours (buds) \\/ 36 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-11-12 18:15:00','2026-11-12 18:15:00'),(873,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB/256GB)','lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u.webp',NULL,NULL,84499.00,88499.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The IdeaPad 1 is a straightforward 15.6-inch laptop for people who want a big screen and a full number pad without paying for things they won\'t use. ONIN Infosys sells the 15AMN7 for <strong>Rs 84,499</strong> and includes a laptop bag, mouse and mousepad, so it\'s ready to use on day one.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> is a 4-core, 8-thread chip that boosts to 4.3GHz. Paired with 8GB of LPDDR5-5500 memory, it handles spreadsheets, accounting software, Zoom and lots of browser tabs comfortably. The 15.6-inch IPS display has wider viewing angles than the TN panels on the cheapest laptops, which helps when two people are looking at the same spreadsheet. The six-row keyboard with a numeric keypad is the reason many offices choose this size.</p>\n<p>The trade-offs are typical of a budget laptop. The SSD is 256GB, so you\'ll want cloud storage or a pen drive for big files. The 42Wh battery is modest. At 1.58 kg it\'s portable, but not something you\'ll forget is in your bag. If you mostly work at a desk, those don\'t matter much. For more storage and a slimmer design at a similar price, see the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023\">IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 with Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB RAM and 256GB SSD for Rs 84,499, with a free bag, mouse and mousepad.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 have a number pad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 15.6-inch body has a full numeric keypad, which is useful for accounts and data entry.\"},{\"question\":\"Which ports does it have?\",\"answer\":\"One USB 2.0, one USB 3.2 Gen 1, one USB-C (data only), HDMI 1.4b, a headphone\\/mic combo jack and a card reader.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-1-ryzen-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-1-ryzen-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(874,6,5,'Realme Watch S5','realme-watch-s5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-watch-s5.webp',NULL,NULL,15999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-11-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme Watch S5 costs <strong>Rs 15,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 16 days (normal usage), Up to 20 days (light mode); 460 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BDS, QZSS. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-watch-6-lite\">Redmi Watch 6 Lite</a> (Rs 14,999) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-11-pro\">Huawei Band 11 Pro</a> (Rs 14,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=realme-watch-s5&g2=redmi-watch-6-lite\">compare the Realme Watch S5 with the Redmi Watch 6 Lite</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Watch S5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Watch S5 costs Rs 15,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Watch S5 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Watch S5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 16 days (normal usage), Up to 20 days (light mode); 460 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-11-05 18:15:00','2026-11-05 18:15:00'),(875,3,5,'Redmi Watch 6','redmi-watch-6',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-watch-6.webp',NULL,NULL,20499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Watch 6 costs <strong>Rs 20,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 6 July 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 2.07 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 24 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 7 days (heavy usage); 550 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, BDS, Galileo, Glonass, QZSS. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-fe\">Samsung Galaxy Watch FE</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-fit-4\">Huawei Watch Fit 4</a> (Rs 22,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=redmi-watch-6&g2=samsung-galaxy-watch-fe\">compare the Redmi Watch 6 with the Samsung Galaxy Watch FE</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Watch 6 costs Rs 20,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Watch 6 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 24 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 7 days (heavy usage); 550 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accesse