ll over a week with normal use.</p>\n<p>It does not run third-party apps, and iPhone owners cannot reply from it. Nothing and CMF phone owners get tidy integration. Between this and the cheaper Redmi Watch 6 Active the decision is mostly style, and style is a fair reason with something you wear every day.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Watch 3 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The CMF Watch 3 Pro costs Rs 12,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Watch 3 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 21 December 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Watch 3 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 13 days (normal usage), Up to 60 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 350 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-20 18:15:00','2025-12-20 18:15:00'),(878,43,5,'Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro','huawei-watch-gt-7-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-gt-7-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,64990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-12','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro costs <strong>Rs 64,990</strong> in Nepal for the Fluoroelastomer Strap model. It launched in Nepal on 12 October 2026. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.47 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 21 days (low power mode). Water resistance: IP69 dust and water resistance, 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-d2\">Huawei Watch D2</a> (Rs 64,990) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-6-classic\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic</a> (Rs 64,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-gt-7-pro&g2=huawei-watch-d2\">compare the Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro with the Huawei Watch D2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro costs Rs 64,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch GT 7 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 12 days (normal usage), Up to 21 days (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-10-11 18:15:00','2026-10-11 18:15:00'),(879,61,37,'Soundcore Space Q45','soundcore-space-q45',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-space-q45.webp',NULL,NULL,19999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Space Q45 costs <strong>Rs 19,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2022. This range brings noise cancellation and longer battery life.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 50 hours, With ANC on, 65 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, LDAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-780nc\">JBL Tune 780NC</a> (Rs 19,500) and the <a href=\"/products/sony-wh-g300-inzone-h3\">Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3</a> (Rs 16,200). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-space-q45&g2=jbl-tune-780nc\">compare the Soundcore Space Q45 with the JBL Tune 780NC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space Q45 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Space Q45 costs Rs 19,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Space Q45 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space Q45 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 50 hours, With ANC on, 65 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(880,61,37,'Soundcore Space One','soundcore-space-one',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-space-one.webp',NULL,NULL,12999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Space One costs <strong>Rs 12,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2023. This range brings noise cancellation and longer battery life.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 55 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, LDAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/cmf-headphone-pro\">CMF Headphone Pro</a> (Rs 13,999) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-730bt\">JBL Tune 730BT</a> (Rs 11,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-space-one&g2=cmf-headphone-pro\">compare the Soundcore Space One with the CMF Headphone Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space One price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Space One costs Rs 12,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Space One launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Space One battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 55 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(881,2,3,'Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M6 (2026)','apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m6',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m6.webp',NULL,NULL,385999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-10-27','upcoming',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M6 (2026) has not launched in Nepal yet. Our expected price is <strong>Rs 3,85,999</strong>, an estimate until the official launch.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Apple M6 (2nm). Screen: 14.2 inches, mini-LED, 3K (3024 x 1964 pixels), 120Hz. At 1.55 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 72.4 Wh; 60W adapter.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When will the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M6 (2026) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It has not launched in Nepal yet. The expected price is around Rs 3,85,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M6 (2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M6 (2nm).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-10-26 18:15:00','2026-10-26 18:15:00'),(882,41,3,'Acer Nitro V 16 ANV16-71 (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 4050)','acer-nitro-v-16-anv16-71-2025-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga-165hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-v-16-anv16-71-2025-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga-165hz.webp',NULL,NULL,196499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nitro V 16 is the step up from the Nitro V 15. It has a bigger 16:10 screen and a much stronger processor. ONIN Infosys sells the ANV16-71-760Q in Obsidian Black for <strong>Rs 1,96,499</strong>, with lifetime free servicing from the store.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core i7-14650HX</strong> has 16 cores and 24 threads with a 5.2GHz boost, which makes this a capable \"gaming and creator\" laptop. Video exports, Blender renders and code builds finish far faster than on the 10-core H-series chips in cheaper Nitros. The <strong>RTX 4050 6GB</strong> runs at 85W with DLSS 3 support.</p>\n<p>The <strong>16-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) display</strong> runs at 165Hz. It\'s smooth for games and gives extra vertical space for timelines and code, though at 45% NTSC it\'s not a colour-accurate panel. Memory is 16GB DDR5-5600 with a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. It weighs about 2.5 kg, with a 59Wh battery.</p>\n<p>If your budget can stretch to RTX 50-series graphics, the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050\">ASUS TUF F16 with RTX 5050</a> has 8GB of VRAM and a 100% sRGB screen for a little more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro V16 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro V16 ANV16-71-760Q with Core i7-14650HX, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,96,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the i7-14650HX have?\",\"answer\":\"16 cores and 24 threads, boosting to 5.2GHz.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the TGP of the RTX 4050 in the Nitro V16?\",\"answer\":\"85W.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro V 16 ANV16-71 (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 4050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-v16-intel-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16-inch-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-v16-intel-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16-inch-nepal',NULL,4,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(883,2,37,'Apple AirPods Max 2','apple-airpods-max-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-airpods-max-2.webp',NULL,NULL,123500.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-02','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple AirPods Max 2 costs <strong>Rs 1,23,500</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 2 April 2026. At this price you are buying top-tier noise cancellation, comfort and sound quality.</p>\n<p>Drivers: Apple-designed dynamic driver. Battery: Music: 20 hours, With ANC on; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1.5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sony-1000x-the-collexion\">Sony 1000X THE COLLEXION</a> (Rs 1,06,900) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-airpods-max-2024\">Apple AirPods Max (2024)</a> (Rs 1,05,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=apple-airpods-max-2&g2=sony-1000x-the-collexion\">compare the Apple AirPods Max 2 with the Sony 1000X THE COLLEXION</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Apple AirPods Max 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Apple AirPods Max 2 costs Rs 1,23,500 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple AirPods Max 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 20 hours, With ANC on; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1.5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-04-01 18:15:00','2026-04-01 18:15:00'),(884,3,5,'Redmi Watch 6 Lite','redmi-watch-6-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-watch-6-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,14999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Watch 6 Lite costs <strong>Rs 14,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 4 August 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.96 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 18 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage); 470 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, BDS, Galileo, Glonass, QZSS. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-11-pro\">Huawei Band 11 Pro</a> (Rs 14,990) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-watch-s5\">Realme Watch S5</a> (Rs 15,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=redmi-watch-6-lite&g2=huawei-band-11-pro\">compare the Redmi Watch 6 Lite with the Huawei Band 11 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Watch 6 Lite costs Rs 14,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Watch 6 Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 18 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage); 470 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-08-03 18:15:00','2026-08-03 18:15:00'),(885,3,5,'Redmi Watch 6 Active','redmi-watch-6-active',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-watch-6-active.webp',NULL,NULL,10999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Watch 6 Active costs <strong>Rs 10,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 4 August 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.85 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 18 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage); 470 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, BDS, Galileo, Glonass, QZSS. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-watch-5\">Realme Watch 5</a> (Rs 10,999) and the <a href=\"/products/cmf-watch-pro-2\">CMF Watch Pro 2</a> (Rs 11,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=redmi-watch-6-active&g2=realme-watch-5\">compare the Redmi Watch 6 Active with the Realme Watch 5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 Active price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Watch 6 Active costs Rs 10,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Watch 6 Active launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Watch 6 Active battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 18 days (light usage), Up to 12 days (normal usage); 470 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-08-03 18:15:00','2026-08-03 18:15:00'),(886,38,5,'Honor Watch 6','honor-watch-6',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-watch-6.webp',NULL,NULL,33999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-09-11','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Watch 6 costs <strong>Rs 33,999</strong> in Nepal for the Shadow Black model. The Twilight Brown version costs Rs 36,999. It launched in Nepal on 11 September 2026. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.46 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 17 days (Standard usage), Up to 35 days (Casual light smart mode); 980 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, LE, EDR, GPS: Yes, with GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BDS, QZSS, NavIC, NFC. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance, IP69 dust and water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-gt-6\">Huawei Watch GT 6</a> (Rs 34,490) and the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-cheetah\">Amazfit Cheetah</a> (Rs 36,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=honor-watch-6&g2=huawei-watch-gt-6\">compare the Honor Watch 6 with the Huawei Watch GT 6</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch 6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Watch 6 starts at Rs 33,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 33,999 for Shadow Black; Rs 36,999 for Twilight Brown.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Watch 6 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 11 September 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch 6 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 17 days (Standard usage), Up to 35 days (Casual light smart mode); 980 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-09-10 18:15:00','2026-09-10 18:15:00'),(887,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-16agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-16agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445.webp',NULL,NULL,188999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) costs <strong>Rs 1,88,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.85 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pb14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-235u-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025</a> (Rs 1,88,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-7287-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050\">Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 1,89,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-16agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445&g2=dell-pro-14-plus-pb14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-235u-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) with the Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) costs Rs 1,88,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(888,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322.webp',NULL,NULL,191999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) costs <strong>Rs 1,91,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 322 (Intel 18A), 6 cores / 6 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.37 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-4050\">Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VU 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> (Rs 1,91,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-alienware-15-da15260-2026-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050\">Dell Alienware 15 DA15260 2026 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 1,89,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322&g2=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-4050\">compare