-14iph11-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-322&g2=acer-nitro-v-16-anv16-71-2025-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga-165hz\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 2-in-1 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) with the Acer Nitro V 16 ANV16-71 2025 (Core i7-14650HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 2-in-1 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 2-in-1 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) costs Rs 2,00,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 2-in-1 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 2-in-1 14IPH11 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 322) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 322, 6 cores \\/ 6 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(890,11,4,'boAt Nirvana Ion','boat-nirvana-ion',NULL,'gadgets/2026/boat-nirvana-ion.webp',NULL,NULL,3999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Twenty-four hours from the buds and 120 with the case, by boAt\'s figures at moderate volume. Even at two-thirds of that, the Nirvana Ion needs a charger about twice a month.</p>\n<p>There is no noise cancelling in this version, and the bass is heavy until you turn it down. Security staff, long-distance travellers and people who forget cables will forgive both. Commuters who want quiet should choose the ANC version or another pair.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the boAt Nirvana Ion price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The boAt Nirvana Ion costs Rs 3,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the boAt Nirvana Ion launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 January 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the boAt Nirvana Ion battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 24 hours (buds) \\/ 120 hours (case), 60% volume; 1 hour (buds) \\/ 2.5 hours (case).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-01-14 18:15:00','2025-01-14 18:15:00'),(891,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)','acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,109999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) costs <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1334U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.53 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 58 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-14-ep-2024\">HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> (Rs 1,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7-carbon-2022-i5-1240p-90hz\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7 Carbon 13IAP7 2022 (Intel Core i5-1240P)</a> (Rs 1,10,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u&g2=hp-notebook-14-ep-2024\">compare the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) with the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) costs Rs 1,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1334U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 thread