wer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 33 hours (case); Quick charge: 5 minutes = 2 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(924,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 14 5430 2023 (Intel Core i7-1360P)','dell-inspiron-14-5430-2023-i7-1360p',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,34,999 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Inspiron 14 5430 2023 (Intel Core i7-1360P) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,34,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1360P (Intel 7), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.69 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026\">Dell XPS 13 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,34,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 14 5430 2023 (Intel Core i7-1360P) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,34,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Inspiron 14 5430 2023 (Intel Core i7-1360P) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Inspiron 14 5430 2023 (Intel Core i7-1360P) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1360P (Intel 7), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(925,61,4,'Soundcore R50i NC','anker-soundcore-r50i-nc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-11-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore R50i NC costs <strong>Rs 4,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 10 November 2024. At this price, expe