54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022-i5-1235u\">HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U)</a> (Rs 95,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30\">Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)</a> (Rs 93,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-16-dc16251-2025-intel-core-5-120u&g2=hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022-i5-1235u\">compare the Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the HP Pavilion x360 DV2053TU 2022 (Intel Core i5-1235U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 94,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 16 DC16251 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(939,41,3,'Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14-71M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)','acer-aspire-go-14-intel-core-ultra-5-125h',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,10,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14-71M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,10,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores / 18 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.7 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 55 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u\">Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> (Rs 1,09,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14-71M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,10,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14-71M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14-71M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores \\/ 18 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(940,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED S5507QA (Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB/1TB)','asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100.webp',NULL,NULL,154999.00,169999.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook S15 OLED is the best-value Snapdragon laptop we\'ve seen in Nepal. ONIN Infosys sells the <strong>Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100</strong> model with 16GB LPDDR5X and a <strong>1TB SSD</strong> for <strong>Rs 1,54,999</strong>, which includes a 2-year warranty, a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty, and a bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The appeal is <strong>battery life</strong> and the <strong>screen</strong>. Qualcomm\'s 12-core Arm chip sips power, and with a 70Wh battery a full working day away from the charger is realistic. The 15.6-inch <strong>3K (2880 × 1620) OLED</strong> runs at 120Hz, covers 100% DCI-P3 and is DisplayHDR True Black 600 certified. It\'s gorgeous for movies and photo work.</p>\n<p>Before buying, understand the Arm trade-off. Office, Chrome, Edge, Spotify, Zoom, Teams, Photoshop and Lightroom all run natively and fast, and most other apps work through Windows\' Prism emulation. Some things don\'t: many online games with anti-cheat, certain VPN clients, older printer and scanner drivers, and niche engineering software. Check your must-have apps first.</p>\n<p>Ports are generous: two USB4 40Gbps, two USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and a microSD reader. The backlit keyboard has a number pad and a Copilot key, and the laptop weighs 1.43 kg. For a similar OLED on Intel or AMD, look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ga\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED Snapdragon X Elite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook S15 OLED (S5507QA) with Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,54,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Snapdragon Vivobook S15 run all Windows apps?\",\"answer\":\"Most apps run natively or through emulation, but some games with anti-cheat, older drivers and specialised software may not. Check the apps you rely on before buying.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Vivobook S15 OLED have?\",\"answer\":\"A 15.6-inch 3K (2880 \\u00d7 1620) OLED at 120Hz with 100% DCI-P3 and DisplayHDR True Black 600.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED S5507QA (Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(941,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS)','asus-tuf-gaming-a15-ryzen-7-7435hs-rtx-2050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,49,900 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,49,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS (6nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 2.3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 48 Wh; 150W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-m3407ha-2025\">Asus Vivobook S14 M3407HA 2025</a> (Rs 1,52,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,49,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS (6nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(942,8,3,'HP OmniBook 5 16–AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)','hp-omnibook-5-16-ag1175-2025-ryzen-ai-7-35016gb-512gb-16-ips-touch',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,36,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP OmniBook 5 16–AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,36,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen Al 7 350 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, 2K (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.80 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 59 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current HP alternative is the <a href=\"/products/hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-14-fk0033-2