:\"Which processor does the Infinix Note Edge use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7100 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Note Edge battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 6500 mAh; 45W Fast Charging; 10W reverse wired charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-03-19 18:15:00','2026-03-19 18:15:00'),(1003,70,2,'Infinix Smart 20','infinix-smart-20',NULL,'gadgets/2026/infinix-smart-20.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Infinix Smart 20 costs <strong>Rs 21,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 23,999. It launched in Nepal on 10 June 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 700 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultimate (12nm). Its Si/C Li-Ion 5200 mAh battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W Charging, 5W reverse wired charging. Cameras: 8MP, f/2.0, 1/4.0” sensor front. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-go-3\">Tecno Spark Go 3</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-note-80\">Realme Note 80</a> (Rs 21,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=infinix-smart-20&g2=tecno-spark-go-3\">compare the Infinix Smart 20 with the Tecno Spark Go 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 20 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix Smart 20 starts at Rs 21,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 21,999 for 4GB\\/64GB; Rs 23,999 for 4GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Smart 20 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 June 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Smart 20 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ul