iatek Dimensity 9500s (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Poco X8 Pro Max battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 8500 mAh, non-removable; 100W HyperCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-14 18:15:00','2026-04-14 18:15:00'),(1005,3,2,'Poco X8 Pro','poco-x8-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/poco-x8-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,69999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The X8 Pro is the fast POCO for people with normal hands. At 6.59 inches it is far easier to hold than the F7, yet the Dimensity 8500 Ultra is just as quick in daily life, and 100W charging fills its 6,500mAh battery in around forty minutes.</p>\n<p>IP68 and a strong main camera complete a convincing phone. The secondary cameras are the usual weak point. Compare memory versions with care: at the same price the F7 gives you more storage. If size decides it, the X8 Pro wins easily.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Poco X8 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Poco X8 Pro starts at Rs 69,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 69,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 76,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Poco X8 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Poco X8 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 8500 Ultra (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Poco X8 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 6500 mAh, non-removable; 100W HyperCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-14 18:15:00','2026-04-14 18:15:00'),(1006,1,2,'Samsung Galaxy A18','samsung-galaxy-a18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,54099.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-15','upcoming',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy A18 has not launched in Nepal yet. Our expected price is <strong>Rs 54,099</strong>, an estimate until the official launch.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7 inches Super AMOLED, 90Hz screen and runs on the Samsung Exynos 1610. Its Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 25W 