pad-x9a.webp',NULL,NULL,25999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-03','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At Rs 25,999 the Pad X9a is an under-noticed tablet. Its 11.5-inch screen runs at 120Hz, the top version has 8GB of memory, and 35W charging is quick for the class. Reading, lessons and films are all comfortable.</p>\n<p>The Redmi Pad 2 is sharper and sounds better for Rs 4,000 more. The Honor is smoother and cheaper. There is no useful pen support, and updates are limited, so think of it as a reading and watching device for the next three or four years.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Pad X9a price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Pad X9a costs Rs 25,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Pad X9a launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor Pad X9a use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Pad X9a battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 8300 mAh, non-removable; 35W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-02 18:15:00','2025-08-02 18:15:00'),(1011,49,31,'Blackview Zeno 5','blackview-zeno-5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-zeno-5.webp',NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Zeno 5 costs <strong>Rs 29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 1 August 2026. A tablet at this price is mainly for videos, reading, online classes and kids.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches IPS LCD, 90Hz, 350 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Unisoc T7250 (12nm). The 8300 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 18W Charging. It is rated IP54 for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-pad-2\">Redmi Pad 2 11-inch</a> (Rs 29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-pad-x8b\">Honor Pad X8b</a> (Rs 29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g