19','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Wave 10C costs <strong>Rs 14,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/32GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 17,999. It launched in Nepal on 19 May 2026. At this price the job is simple: calls, messaging, social apps and a battery that lasts the day.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.88 inches IPS LCD, 60Hz, 430 nits screen and runs on the Unisoc T310 (12 nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 10W charging. Cameras: Primary: 32MP, f/2.0, AF, 1/3.0” sensor. It is rated IP52 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/ai-plus-plus\">Ai+ Pulse</a> (Rs 14,999) and the <a href=\"/products/infinix-smart-10\">Infinix Smart 10</a> (Rs 14,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=blackview-wave-10c&g2=ai-plus-plus\">compare the Blackview Wave 10C with the Ai+ Pulse</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 10C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Wave 10C starts at Rs 14,499 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 14,499 for 4GB\\/32GB; Rs 17,999 for 4GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Blackview Wave 10C launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 19 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Wave 10C use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T310 (12 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 10C battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 10W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-18 18:15:00','2026-05-18 18:15:00'),(1028,3,4,'Redmi Buds 8 Lite','redmi-buds-8-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-buds-8-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,4999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-02','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>With a Xiaomi phone the Buds 8 Lite appear on the screen the moment you open the case, and their noise cancelling and equaliser sit in the control centre. That ease is their strength, along with steady sound and eight hours without ANC.</p>\n<p>At Rs 4,999 the OnePlus Nord Buds 4 cancel more noise with any phone. Choose the Redmi for its home advantage, or wait for a bundle.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Buds 8 Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Buds 8 Lite costs Rs 4,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Buds 8 Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 2 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Buds 8 Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 36 hours (case), With ANC off, 50% volume, AAC; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-01 18:15:00','2026-04-01 18:15:00'),(1029,3,2,'Redmi A7 4G','redmi-a7-4g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-a7-4g.webp',NULL,NULL,20499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi A7 4G costs <strong>Rs 20,499</strong> in Nepal for the 3GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal on 10 April 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.88 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 450 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Unisoc T7250 (12nm). Its Li-Po 5200 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W Charging. Cameras: Primary: 13MP, f/2.2 + Auxiliary lens. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x5c\">Honor X5c</a> (Rs 20,499) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-bv4800-se\">Blackview BV4800 SE</a> (Rs 20,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=redmi-a7-4g&g2=honor-x5c\">compare the Redmi A7 4G with the Honor X5c</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi A7 4G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi A7 4G costs Rs 20,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi A7 4G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi A7 4G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7250 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi A7 4G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5200 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-09 18:15:00','2026-04-09 18:15:00'),(1030,3,2,'Redmi A7 Pro 4G','redmi-a7-pro-4g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-a7-pro-4g.webp',NULL,NULL,21499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi A7 Pro 4G costs <strong>Rs 21,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 23,999. It launched in Nepal on 8 May 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.9 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 650 nits (typ), 800 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Unisoc T7250 (12nm). Its Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W Charging. Cameras: Primary: 13MP, f/2.2, 1/3.06\" sensor + Auxiliary lens. Software support: 4 years of OS updates; 6 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-go-3\">Tecno Spark Go 3</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-bv4800-se\">Blackview BV4800 SE</a> (Rs 20,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=redmi-a7-pro-4g&g2=tecno-spark-go-3\">compare the Redmi A7 Pro 4G with the Tecno Spark Go 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi A7 Pro 4G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi A7 Pro 4G starts at Rs 21,499 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 21,499 for 4GB\\/64GB; Rs 23,999 for 4GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi A7 Pro 4G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 8 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi A7 Pro 4G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7250 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi A7 Pro 4G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-07 18:15:00','2026-05-07 18:15:00'),(1031,3,2,'Redmi Note 15 5G','redmi-note-15-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-note-15-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,43999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If one phone had to suit a room full of strangers, this would be a safe guess. The Redmi Note 15 5G joins a very bright curved-feeling AMOLED to a stabilised 108MP camera, a sensible Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 and 256GB of storage in its base version, with service centres in most Nepali cities.</p>\n<p>Nothing about it is the best in the country, and nothing will annoy you weekly. Choose 8GB of memory over 6GB, because the phone has four years of Android updates ahead of it and the extra memory will be felt in the third. Heavy players are better off with a Realme P3 or POCO.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Note 15 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Note 15 5G starts at Rs 43,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 43,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 49,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Note 15 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Note 15 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Note 15 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5520 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1032,3,2,'Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G','redmi-note-15-pro-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-note-15-pro-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,53999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G costs <strong>Rs 53,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. The 12GB/512GB version costs Rs 59,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.83 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 3200 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7400 Ultra (4nm). Its Si-Ca 6580 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 200MP, f/1.7, 23 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.4” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor + Macro: 2MP. It is rated IP68 for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x9d\">Honor X9d</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-3a-lite\">Nothing Phone 3a Lite</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=redmi-note-15-pro-5g&g2=honor-x9d\">compare the Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G with the Honor X9d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G starts at Rs 53,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 53,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 59,999 for 12GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7400 Ultra (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 6580 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1033,3,2,'Redmi Note 15 Pro Plus 5G','redmi-note-15-pro-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-note-15-pro-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,63999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Note 15 Pro Plus 5G costs <strong>Rs 63,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. The 12GB/512GB version costs Rs 69,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<