NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-fort-1.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-27','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A phone for people whose phones get dropped off scaffolding. The Fort 1 wraps a 10,000mAh battery and IP68 sealing in a thick rubber-edged body and asks only Rs 21,999. Two or three days between charges is ordinary.</p>\n<p>The processor is slow, the display dim and the camera meant for records rather than memories. Charging at 18W needs a night. None of that matters on a construction site, a raft or a farm. Ask where it is serviced, and close the port covers firmly, because the rating depends on them.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Fort 1 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Fort 1 costs Rs 21,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Blackview Fort 1 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 27 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Fort 1 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T615 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Fort 1 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 10000 mAh, non-removable; 18W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-26 18:15:00','2026-07-26 18:15:00'),(1070,49,2,'Blackview Wave 2C','blackview-wave-2c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-wave-2c.webp',NULL,NULL,10999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Wave 2C costs <strong>Rs 10,999</strong> in Nepal for the 3GB/32GB model. It was announced on 8 June 2026. At this price the job is simple: calls, messaging, social apps and a battery that lasts the day.</p>\n<p>It has a 5 inches TFT LCD, 60Hz, 350 nits (typ), 400 nits (peak) screen and runs on the Unisoc SC9863A1 (28nm). The Li-Po 3000 mAh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 5W charging. Cameras: Primary: 2MP, f/2.4. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-go-2\">Tecno Spark Go 2</a> (Rs 11,499) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-wave-10c\">Blackview Wave 10C</a> (Rs 14,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=blackview-wave-2c&g2=tecno-spark-go-2\">compare the Blackview Wave 2C with the Tecno Spark Go 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 2C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Wave 2C costs Rs 10,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Wave 2C use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc SC9863A1 (28nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 2C battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 3000 mAh, non-removable; 5W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-06-07 18:15:00','2026-06-07 18:15:00'),(1071,9,3,'Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U)','dell-15-dc15255-2025-ryzen-7-7730u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,09,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (7nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230)</a> (Rs 1,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,09,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (7nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1072,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v.webp',NULL,NULL,187000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 1,87,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.57 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-ion 75Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100)</a> (Rs 1,88,100) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA 2024 (X Elite X1E 78 100)</a> (Rs 1,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v&g2=hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) with the HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs Rs 1,87,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1073,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060)','asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,388000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Strix G16 G614FM is a CPU-first gaming laptop. AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen 9 9955HX</strong> has 16 cores, 32 threads and a 5.4GHz boost, about as much processing power as fits in a laptop. That suits gamers who also stream with CPU encoding, run game servers, render in Blender or compile large projects. ONIN Infosys sells it in Eclipse Gray for <strong>Rs 3,88,000</strong> with a 2-year international warranty and a year of Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>The GPU is an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB</strong> at 115W with ROG Boost. It\'s good at 1080p and 1600p with DLSS, but it\'s the limiting part at the screen\'s native resolution in demanding games. Speaking of the screen: a <strong>16-inch 2.5K 240Hz</strong> ROG Nebula panel with 100% DCI-P3, 3ms response and Dolby Vision. There\'s a <strong>MUX switch</strong>, two <strong>USB4 40Gbps</strong> ports, HDMI 2.1, Ethernet and a 90Wh battery, and it weighs 2.5 kg.</p>\n<p>If gaming frame rates matter more than core count, the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">Strix G16 G614PP with RTX 5070</a> costs about Rs 65,000 more and is the faster gaming machine. The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Strix G18 G815JPR</a> gives you an RTX 5070 and a bigger screen for less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix G16 G614FM with Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 3,88,000.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Ryzen 9 9955HX have?\",\"answer\":\"16 cores and 32 threads, boosting to 5.4GHz.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Strix G16 G614FM have USB4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, two USB4 Type-C ports at 40Gbps.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g16-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-g16-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-08-23 18:15:00','2025-08-23 18:15:00'),(1074,6,4,'Realme Buds T100','realme-buds-t100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-12-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme Buds T100 costs <strong>Rs 2,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 17 December 2023. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 10 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 6 hours (buds) / 28 hours (case). Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX5 splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-airdopes-131-gen-2\">boAt Airdopes 131 Gen 2</a> (Rs 2,499) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-6-play\">Redmi Buds 6 Play</a> (Rs 2,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t100&g2=boat-airdopes-131-gen-2\">compare the Realme Buds T100 with the boAt Airdopes 131 Gen 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T100 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T100 costs Rs 2,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T100 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 December 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T100 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6 hours (buds) \\/ 28 hours (case).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-16 18:15:00','2023-12-16 18:15:00'),(1075,6,4,'Realme Buds T200','realme-buds-t200',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-buds-t200.webp',NULL,NULL,4499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme Buds T200 costs <strong>Rs 4,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 24 July 2026. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: 32 dB. Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LDAC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-airdopes-loop\">boAt Airdopes Loop</a> (Rs 4,499) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-8-active\">Redmi Buds 8 Active</a> (Rs 4,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t200&g2=boat-airdopes-loop\">compare the Realme Buds T200 with the boAt Airdopes Loop</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T200 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T200 costs Rs 4,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T200 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T200 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-23 18:15:00','2026-07-23 18:15:00'),(1076,4,31,'OnePlus Pad Go 2','oneplus-pad-go-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,49999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-12-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OnePlus Pad Go 2 costs <strong>Rs 49,999</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 17 December 2025. At this price it can double as a note-taking and light work device.</p>\n<p>It has a 12.1 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 900 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Ultra (4 nm). The Li-Po 10050 mAh battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 33W Fast Charging. Software support: 5 years of OS updates; 6 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/blackview-mega-5\">Blackview MEGA 5</a> (Rs 51,999) and the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-pad-7\">Xiaomi Pad 7</a> (Rs 44,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=oneplus-pad-go-2&g2=blackview-mega-5\">compare the OnePlus Pad Go 2 with the Blackview MEGA 5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Pad Go 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The OnePlus Pad Go 2 costs Rs 49,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Pad Go 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Ultra (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Pad Go 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 10050 mAh; 33W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-16 18:15:00','2025-12-16 18:15:00'),(1077,48,3,'MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H)','msi-katana-15-2023-i7-13620h-rtx-4060',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,209000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs <strong>Rs 2,09,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2023. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.25 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Po 53.5 Wh.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050\">Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> (Rs 2,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-13-pb13255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350\">Dell Pro 13 PB13255 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 Pro 350)</a> (Rs 2,09,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=msi-katana-15-2023-i7-13620h-rtx-4060&g2=lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050\">compare the MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) with the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs Rs 2,09,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the MSI Katana 15 B13VEK 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(1078,3,31,'Xiaomi Pad 8','xiaomi-pad-8',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-pad-8.webp',NULL,NULL,59999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-03-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>With a Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 the Pad 8 is close to flagship speed, and its 9,200mAh battery lasts a long day of study or editing. The 3.2K screen at 144Hz is shared with the cheaper Pad 7.</p>\n<p>That is the question to answer: the Pad 7 does the same reading and writing for Rs 15,000 less, enough to pay for a pen and keyboard. Choose the Pad 8 for heavy games, video work or if you plan to keep it for many years.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Xiaomi Pad 8 starts at Rs 59,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 59,999 for 8GB\\/128GB; Rs 69,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Xiaomi Pad 8 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 March 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Xiaomi Pad 8 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 8 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 9200 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-03-24 18:15:00','2026-03-24 18:15:00'),(1079,41,3,'Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H)','acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-7287-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,189000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) costs <strong>Rs 1,89,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 7 240H (Intel 7), 10 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 165Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.11 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: 57 Wh Li-ion; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-16agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)</a> (Rs 1,88,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pb14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-235u-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025</a> (Rs 1,88,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-7287-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050&g2=lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-16agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-7-445\">compare the Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) with the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 16AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) costs Rs 1,89,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-7287 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 7 240H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1080,76,4,'Kick Phantom Buds X2','kick-phantom-buds-x2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2026.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-31','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Kick Phantom Buds X2 costs <strong>Rs 2,026</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 35dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 8 hours (buds) / 100 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1.66 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX5 water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-5a\">Redmi Buds 5A</a> (Rs 1,999) and the <a href=\"/products/kick-phantom-buds-x-elite\">Kick Phantom Buds X Elite</a> (Rs 1,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=kick-phantom-buds-x2&g2=redmi-buds-5a\">compare the Kick Phantom Buds X2 with the Redmi Buds 5A</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Kick Phantom Buds X2 costs Rs 2,026 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Kick Phantom Buds X2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 100 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1.66 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-30 18:15:00','2025-10-30 18:15:00'),(1081,76,4,'Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo','kick-phantom-buds-x2-neo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-31','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo costs <strong>Rs 1,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic bass drivers. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX4 water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/ultima-atom-buds-2\">Ultima Atom Buds 2</a> (Rs 1,949) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-5a\">Redmi Buds 5A</a> (Rs 1,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=kick-phantom-buds-x2-neo&g2=ultima-atom-buds-2\">compare the Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo with the Ultima Atom Buds 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo costs Rs 1,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-30 18:15:00','2025-10-30 18:15:00'),(1082,3,31,'Redmi Pad SE 8.7','redmi-pad-se-8-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 19,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-10-05','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Pad SE 8.7 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 19,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 8.7 inches IPS LCD, 90Hz, 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G85 (12nm). Its Li-Po 6650 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 18W Charging. It is rated IP52 for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Xiaomi alternative is the <a href=\"/products/redmi-pad-2-9-7\">Redmi Pad 2 9.7</a> (Rs 25,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 19,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G85 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6650 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-10-04 18:15:00','2024-10-04 18:15:00'),(1083,41,3,'Acer Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61 (Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti)','acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,297499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This might be the best-value high-end GPU on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf. The Nitro 16S AI puts an <strong>RTX 5070 Ti with 12GB of GDDR7</strong>, a GPU usually found in laptops costing five or six lakh, into a slim Nitro chassis for <strong>Rs 2,97,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 12GB of VRAM matters. It lets you use high-resolution textures in new games without stutter, and it gives room for local AI image generation and heavier 3D scenes. ONIN lists a 110W TGP, lower than flagship laptops push the same chip, but still very fast at the <strong>16-inch WQXGA (2560 × 1600) 180Hz</strong> screen\'s native resolution with DLSS 4.</p>\n<p>The CPU is AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen AI 7 350</strong> (8 cores, 16 threads, 50 TOPS NPU). It\'s efficient, which helps the <strong>76Wh battery</strong> last longer when you\'re not gaming. You get a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD and 16GB of DDR5. Ports include two 10Gbps USB-A, a 10Gbps USB-C, a USB 2.0, HDMI and Ethernet. It weighs about 2.2 kg (4.81 lb).</p>\n<p>For more CPU power and an OLED screen at the same price, the <a href=\"/products/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Predator Helios Neo 16S AI</a> is the alternative, but its RTX 5060 is a clear step down for gaming.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro 16S AI RTX 5070 Ti price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61-R10J with Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti 12GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,97,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much VRAM does the RTX 5070 Ti laptop GPU have?\",\"answer\":\"12GB of GDDR7.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the display on the Nitro 16S AI?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch WQXGA (2560 \\u00d7 1600) IPS panel at 180Hz with a matte finish.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61 (Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-16-ai-an16s-61-r10j-rtx-5070-ti-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-16-ai-an16s-61-r10j-rtx-5070-ti-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1084,41,3,'Acer Predator Helios 16 AI PH16-73-95Q8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','acer-predator-helios-16-ai-ph16-73-95q8-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 6,99,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Predator Helios 16 AI PH16-73-95Q8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 6,99,999</strong>. It was announced in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 2.7 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 330W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-960e-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v\">Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Cor