ckview MEGA 8</a> (Rs 39,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=blackview-link-8-wifi&g2=oneplus-pad-go\">compare the Blackview Link 8 WiFi with the OnePlus Pad Go</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Link 8 WiFi price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Link 8 WiFi costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Blackview Link 8 WiFi launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 20 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Link 8 WiFi use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Link 8 WiFi battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8400 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-01-19 18:15:00','2026-01-19 18:15:00'),(1124,49,31,'Blackview MEGA 12 5G','blackview-mega-12-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-mega-12-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,59999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-29','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview MEGA 12 5G costs <strong>Rs 59,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 29 June 2026. At this price it can double as a note-taking and light work device.</p>\n<p>It has a 12.2 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 350 nits (typ) screen and runs on the MediaTek Dimensity 7200 (4nm). The 10000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 55W Fast Charging. It is rated IP68/IP69K for dust and water.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-pad-8\">Xiaomi Pad 8</a> (Rs 59,999) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-lite\">Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 lite</a> (Rs 63,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=blackview-mega-12-5g&g2=xiaomi-pad-8\">compare the Blackview MEGA 12 5G with the Xiaomi Pad 8</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview MEGA 12 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview MEGA 12 5G costs Rs 59,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"quest