 Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5100 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-28 18:15:00','2025-10-28 18:15:00'),(1126,1,31,'Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+','samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,41999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-30','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ costs <strong>Rs 41,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB - 128GB - Wi-Fi Only model. The 8GB - 256GB - Wi-Fi & 5G version costs Rs 53,999. It launched in Nepal on 30 November 2025. At this price it can double as a note-taking and light work device.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 (4nm). The Li-Po 7040 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 25W Fast Charging. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-pad-go\">OnePlus Pad Go</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-link-8-wifi\">Blackview Link 8 WiFi</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus&g2=oneplus-pad-go\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ with the OnePlus Pad Go</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ starts at Rs 41,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 41,999 for 6GB - 128GB - Wi-Fi Only; Rs 53,999 for 8GB - 256GB - Wi-Fi & 5G.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 30 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7040 mAh, non-removable; 25W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed