 <strong>Rs 1,34,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 5 120U, 16GB/512GB model. The Intel Core Ultra 5 235U, 16GB/256GB version costs Rs 2,01,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 235U (Intel 3), 12 cores / 14 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.84 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 45 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-neo\">Apple MacBook Neo</a> (Rs 1,34,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026\">Dell XPS 13 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,34,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-pro-16-plus-pb16250-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-235u-16gb-256gb-16-fhd&g2=macbook-neo\">compare the Dell Pro 16 Plus PB16250 2025 with the Apple MacBook Neo</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 16 Plus PB16250 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Pro 16 Plus PB16250 2025 starts at Rs 1,34,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,34,999 for Intel Core 5 120U, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 2,01,999 for Intel Core Ultra 5 235U, 16GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Pro 16 Plus PB16250 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Pro 16 Plus PB16250 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 235U (Intel 3), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1129,9,3,'Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230)','dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,119999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) costs <strong>Rs 1,19,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 230 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.56 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 55 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-16-ai-2025-snapdragon-x-x1-26100-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga\">Acer Aspire 16 AI A16-11M-X0LW 2025 (Snapdragon X X1-26100)</a> (Rs 1,19,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-52h-2024-intel-core-i7-13620h-16gb-1tb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-52H 2024 (Intel Core i7-13620H)</a> (Rs 1,19,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd&g2=acer-aspire-16-ai-2025-snapdragon-x-x1-26100-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga\">compare the Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) with the Acer Aspire 16 AI A16-11M-X0LW 2025 (Snapdragon X X1-26100)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) costs Rs 1,19,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 230 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1130,41,3,'Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260)','acer-swift-lite-14-sfl14-41m-r4qm-2025-amd-ryzen-7-260',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,132999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A Ryzen 7 260 is a lot of processor for a 14-inch laptop at Rs 1,32,999. With 16GB and a terabyte, the Swift Lite 14 suits developers and students who want desktop-like speed in a bag.</p>\n<p>The display is a standard 60Hz panel and the 50Wh battery is average, so it is at its best near a socket. Against the IdeaPad Slim 3 with an 8840HS it is smaller, with more storage. Against the Aspire 14 AI it is faster in long jobs and lasts less time.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260) costs Rs 1,32,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 260 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1131,41,3,'Acer Spin 3 A3SP14-31PT-37NV 2023 (Gen i3-N305)','acer-spin-3-2023-i3-n305',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,12,999 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-03','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Spin 3 A3SP14-31PT-37NV 2023 (Gen i3-N305) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,12,999</strong>. It was announced on 3 January 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-N305, 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, 16:10 aspect ratio, 60Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. At 1.54 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 40 Wh Li-ion; 45W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a