urs (buds) / 24 hours (case); Quick charge: 15 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance, Case: No.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sasmung-galaxy-buds3\">Samsung Galaxy Buds3</a> (Rs 22,999) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-clips\">JBL Soundgear Clips</a> (Rs 23,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=jbl-soundgear-sense&g2=sasmung-galaxy-buds3\">compare the JBL Soundgear Sense with the Samsung Galaxy Buds3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Soundgear Sense price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Soundgear Sense costs Rs 22,500 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Soundgear Sense launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Soundgear Sense battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6 hours (buds) \\/ 24 hours (case); Quick charge: 15 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-27 18:15:00','2026-01-27 18:15:00'),(1171,43,4,'Huawei FreeArc','huawei-freearc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,16990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-12','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei FreeArc costs <strong>Rs 16,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 12 August 2025. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 17 mm + 12 mm drivers. Battery: Music: 7 hours (buds) / 28 hours (case); 40 minutes (buds) / 1.5 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP57 dust and water resistance, Case: No.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/anker-soundcore-liberty-4-pro\">Soundcore Liberty 4 Pro</a> (Rs 16,999) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-flex-2\">JBL Tune Flex 2</a> (Rs 16,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=huawei-freearc&g2=anker-soundcore-liberty-4-pro\">compare the Huawei FreeArc with the Soundcore Liberty 4 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei FreeArc price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei FreeArc costs Rs 16,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei FreeArc launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei FreeArc battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 7 hours (buds) \\/ 28 hours (case); 40 minutes (buds) \\/ 1.5 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-11 18:15:00','2025-08-11 18:15:00'),(1172,36,4,'CMF Buds 2a','cmf-buds-2a',NULL,'gadgets/2026/cmf-buds-2a.webp',NULL,NULL,5999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-04-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The CMF Buds 2a costs <strong>Rs 5,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 28 April 2025. This is where noise cancellation, app support and better codecs start to appear.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 42dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 8 hours (buds) / 35.5 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance, Case: IPX2 splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-airdopes-flex-454-anc\">boAt Airdopes Flex 454 ANC</a> (Rs 5,999) and the <a href=\"/products/boat-nirvana-x-tws\">boAt Nirvana X TWS</a> (Rs 5,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=cmf-buds-2a&g2=boat-airdopes-flex-454-anc\">compare the CMF Buds 2a with the boAt Airdopes Flex 454 ANC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2a price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The CMF Buds 2a costs Rs 5,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Buds 2a launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 April 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2a battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 35.5 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-27 18:15:00','2025-04-27 18:15:00'),(1173,36,4,'CMF Buds 2','cmf-buds-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/cmf-buds-2.webp',NULL,NULL,7499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-04-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The CMF Buds 2 costs <strong>Rs 7,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 28 April 2025. This is where noise cancellation, app support and better codecs start to appear.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 48dB). Drivers: 11 mm PMI drivers. Battery: Music: 13.5 hours (buds) / 55 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 7.5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance, Case: IPX2 splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-freebuds-se-4-anc\">Huawei FreeBuds SE 4 ANC</a> (Rs 7,490) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-c50i\">Soundcore C50i</a> (Rs 7,799). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=cmf-buds-2&g2=huawei-freebuds-se-4-anc\">compare the CMF Buds 2 with the Huawei FreeBuds SE 4 ANC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The CMF Buds 2 costs Rs 7,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Buds 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 April 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 13.5 hours (buds) \\/ 55 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 7.5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-27 18:15:00','2025-04-27 18:15:00'),(1174,36,4,'CMF Buds 2 Plus','cmf-buds-2-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/cmf-buds-2-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,8999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-04-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Earbuds under Rs 10,000 are a crowded field, and these lead it. The Buds 2 Plus bring adaptive noise cancelling that calms a microbus, LDAC for Android phones, connection to two devices and a hearing test that shapes the sound to you. Fourteen hours per charge means forgetting the cable for a week.</p>\n<p>They do not reach the silence of Sony or Apple, and iPhone owners gain nothing from LDAC. The case is plain and charges only by cable. For commuters and students with a laptop and a phone, we would not look further without a special reason.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2 Plus price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The CMF Buds 2 Plus costs Rs 8,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Buds 2 Plus launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 April 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds 2 Plus battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 14 hours (buds) \\/ 61.5 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 8.5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-27 18:15:00','2025-04-27 18:15:00'),(1175,36,4,'CMF Buds Pro 2','cmf-buds-pro-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/cmf-buds-pro-2.webp',NULL,NULL,9599.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-07-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The dial on the case is the first thing people play with: turn for volume, press to pause, hold for noise cancelling. The second is the sound, livelier than most at this price thanks to separate drivers for bass and treble.</p>\n<p>Noise cancelling is strong and the app is clean. Battery life is a little shorter than that of the Buds 2 Plus, which cost less. Choose the Pro 2 if music is what you mostly listen to, and the Plus if you travel.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds Pro 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The CMF Buds Pro 2 costs Rs 9,599 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Buds Pro 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 8 July 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds Pro 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 11 hours (buds) \\/ 43 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-07-07 18:15:00','2024-07-07 18:15:00'),(1176,61,4,'Soundcore R50i','soundcore-r50i',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-08-20','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore R50i costs <strong>Rs 4,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 20 August 2023. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 10 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 10 hours (buds) / 30 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX5 splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-nord-buds-4\">OnePlus Nord Buds 4</a> (Rs 4,999) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-p30i\">Soundcore P30i</a> (Rs 4,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=soundcore-r50i&g2=oneplus-nord-buds-4\">compare the Soundcore R50i with the OnePlus Nord Buds 4</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore R50i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore R50i costs Rs 4,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore R50i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 20 August 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore R50i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 10 hours (buds) \\/ 30 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-08-19 18:15:00','2023-08-19 18:15:00'),(1177,61,4,'Soundcore R60i NC','anker-soundcore-r60i-nc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Soundcore\'s R60i NC gives you most of a Rs 9,000 pair for Rs 5,499. Noise cancelling is effective on engines and fans, LDAC is available for Android, two devices can stay connected, and the app has the best equaliser in the class.</p>\n<p>The bass arrives too heavy and improves after one minute in that equaliser. Calls are clear indoors and average beside traffic. If you were about to spend Rs 5,000 on something with a famous logo, listen to these first.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore R60i NC price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore R60i NC costs Rs 5,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore R60i NC launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore R60i NC battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 10 hours (buds) \\/ 50 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3.5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-09 18:15:00','2026-01-09 18:15:00'),(1178,61,4,'Soundcore P41i','soundcore-p41i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-p41i.webp',NULL,NULL,8499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-09','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The case is the product: a large one with a screen that stores enough energy for about 190 hours of listening and can top up a phone in an emergency. For trekkers and people on long duty, that removes a power bank from the bag.</p>\n<p>The buds themselves are solid, with noise cancelling and Soundcore\'s app. It will not fit a tight pocket. If you charge at home every night, spend the same on the CMF Buds 2 Plus.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore P41i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore P41i costs Rs 8,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore P41i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 9 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore P41i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 12 hours (buds) \\/ 192 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-08 18:15:00','2025-11-08 18:15:00'),(1179,61,4,'Soundcore Liberty 5','soundcore-liberty-5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-liberty-5.webp',NULL,NULL,17499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Liberty 5 costs <strong>Rs 17,499</strong> in Nepal. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 25dB). Drivers: 9.2 mm wool-paper diaphragm drivers. Battery: Music: 12 hours (buds) / 48 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LDAC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-freebuds-7i\">Huawei FreeBuds 7i</a> (Rs 17,990) and the <a href=\"/products/anker-soundcore-liberty-4-pro\">Soundcore Liberty 4 Pro</a> (Rs 16,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=soundcore-liberty-5&g2=huawei-freebuds-7i\">compare the Soundcore Liberty 5 with the Huawei FreeBuds 7i</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Liberty 5 costs Rs 17,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 12 hours (buds) \\/ 48 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(1180,1,4,'Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro','samsung-galaxy-buds3-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,31999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-07-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro costs <strong>Rs 31,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2024. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 10.5 mm woofer driver + 6.1 mm tweeter. Battery: Music: 5 hours (buds) / 22 hours (case), With ANC off. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC, SSC, SSC‑UHQ. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP57 dust and water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/airpods-5\">Apple AirPods 5</a> (Rs 31,000) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-freeclips-2\">Huawei FreeClip 2</a> (Rs 33,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=samsung-galaxy-buds3-pro&g2=airpods-5\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro with the Apple AirPods 5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro costs Rs 31,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 5 hours (buds) \\/ 22 hours (case), With ANC off.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-07-16 18:15:00','2024-07-16 18:15:00'),(1181,1,4,'Samsung Galaxy Buds3','sasmung-galaxy-buds3',NULL,'gadgets/2026/sasmung-galaxy-buds3.webp',NULL,NULL,22999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-07-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Buds3 costs <strong>Rs 22,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2024. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 11 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 6 hours (buds) / 30 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) / 1.5 hours (case). Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, SSC, SSC-UHQ. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP57 dust and water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-clips\">JBL Soundgear Clips</a> (Rs 23,000) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-sense\">JBL Soundgear Sense</a> (Rs 22,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=sasmung-galaxy-buds3&g2=jbl-soundgear-clips\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Buds3 with the JBL Soundgear Clips</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Buds3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Buds3 costs Rs 22,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Buds3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Buds3 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6 hours (buds) \\/ 30 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) \\/ 1.5 hours (case).\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-07-16 18:15:00','2024-07-16 18:15:00'),(1182,1,4,'Galaxy Buds Core','galaxy-buds-core',NULL,'gadgets/2026/galaxy-buds-core.webp',NULL,NULL,7999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Samsung\'s cheapest earbuds are small, light and at their best with a Galaxy phone, where they pair by opening the lid and share controls with the system. Basic noise cancelling and a long battery are included.</p>\n<p>Judged on features alone, the CMF Buds 2 Plus give more for a little extra. The Core\'s price has fallen sharply during Samsung\'s pre-order offers, and that is the moment to take them.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Galaxy Buds Core price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Galaxy Buds Core costs Rs 7,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Galaxy Buds Core launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Galaxy Buds Core battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: With ANC off.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-30 18:15:00','2025-06-30 18:15:00'),(1183,8,3,'HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100)','hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,188100.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100) costs <strong>Rs 1,88,100</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100 (4nm), 12 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, 2.2K (2240 x 1400 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for