24 (Intel Core i7-13620H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-52H 2024 (Intel Core i7-13620H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1191,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)','acer-aspire-ai-a14-52mt-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,139999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>One laptop for five years of work or study: that is the case for this Aspire 14 AI. Intel\'s Core Ultra 7 258V is built for battery life, 32GB of memory removes any worry about multitasking, and a terabyte of storage is enough for most careers.</p>\n<p>Acer saved on the display, an ordinary 60Hz panel, and on looks. Neither will slow you down. It is not for games or 3D, where a graphics card is needed. Compared with Snapdragon laptops at the same price it lasts nearly as long and runs every Windows program, which in Nepal is worth a lot.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) costs Rs 1,39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-31 18:15:00','2026-01-31 18:15:00'),(1192,8,3,'HP OmniBook X Flip 14 14-fm0023dx 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-fm0023dx-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-ips-multitouch',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'R