ce in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 91,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080), 60Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell Li-ion 42 Wh; 45W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 93,000).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 91,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1208,40,3,'Asus Gaming V16 V3607VH 2025 (Core 7 240H)','asus-v16-2025-core-7-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-v16-2025-core-7-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,207999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Asus built the V16 for people who need a graphics card and prefer a laptop that does not announce it. A Core 7 240H, RTX 5050, 16GB and a terabyte sit in a calm 16-inch body at about Rs 2,08,000.</p>\n<p>Its 150W adapter sets a ceiling on graphics power, so compare it with a LOQ 15 before c