eCel sensor + Depth: 2MP, f/2.4, 1/5\" sensor. It is rated IP68 / IP69 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Realme alternative is the <a href=\"/products/realme-c71\">Realme C71</a> (Rs 25,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Realme C75 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 24,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme C75 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G92 Max (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme C75 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-22 18:15:00','2025-05-22 18:15:00'),(1214,70,2,'Infinix Smart 10','infinix-smart-10',NULL,'gadgets/2026/infinix-smart-10.webp',NULL,NULL,14999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Nearly the same as a Tecno Spark Go 2 with a different badge, the Smart 10 runs the lighter Go edition of Android, which suits its small memory, and has a screen that copes with sunlight.</p>\n<p>Choose the version with 4GB and 128GB. At Rs 1,000 more the Smart 10 Plus brings a larger battery and that storage as standard, so this one is for buyers with exactly Rs 15,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix Smart 10 costs Rs 14,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Smart 10 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Smart 10 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7250 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 10 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-07-03 18:15:00','2025-07-03 18:15:00'),(1215,70,2,'Infinix Smart 10 Plus','infinix-smart-10-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/infinix-smart-10-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,15999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At Rs 15,999 the Smart 10 Plus avoids the two mistakes that ruin cheap phones. It has 128GB of storage, so WhatsApp will not choke it in six months, and a 6,000mAh battery that lasts a day and a half.</p>\n<p>The processor is basic and the 8MP camera is for documents and daylight. Four gigabytes of memory means one thing at a time. As a first phone, a second phone or a careful gift to a grandparent, it does its work better than anything else at the price we have listed.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 10 Plus price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix Smart 10 Plus costs Rs 15,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Smart 10 Plus launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Smart 10 Plus use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7250 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 10 Plus battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-07-03 18:15:00','2025-07-03 18:15:00'),(1216,70,2,'Infinix Hot 60i 4G','infinix-hot-60i-4g',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,16999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-21','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Infinix Hot 60i 4G costs <strong>Rs 16,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/128GB model. The 6GB/128GB version costs Rs 18,999. It launched in Nepal on 21 July 2025. At this price the job is simple: calls, messaging, social apps and a battery that lasts the day.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 700 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultimate (12nm). Its Li-Po 5160 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: 50MP, PDAF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/blackview-wave-7c\">Blackview Wave 7C</a> (Rs 16,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-note-70\">Realme Note 70</a> (Rs 16,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=infinix-hot-60i-4g&g2=blackview-wave-7c\">compare the Infinix Hot 60i 4G with the Blackview Wave 7C</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Hot 60i 4G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix Hot 60i 4G starts at Rs 16,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 16,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 18,999 for 6GB\\/128GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Hot 60i 4G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 21 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Hot 60i 4G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultimate (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Hot 60i 4G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5160 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-07-20 18:15:00','2025-07-20 18:15:00'),(1217,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','lenovo-legion-7i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-7i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,349999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs <strong>Rs 3,49,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 2.0 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-ion 84 Wh; 245W adapter, Supports Rapid Charge Pro.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-vector-gp68-hx-2023-i9-13980hx-rtx-4070\">MSI Vector GP68 HX 13VG 2023 (Intel Core i9-13980HX)</a> (Rs 3,47,700) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp11-2026-ryzen-7-250-rtx-5060\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 250)</a> (Rs 3,45,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-legion-7i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060&g2=msi-vector-gp68-hx-2023-i9-13980hx-rtx-4070\">compare the Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) with the MSI Vector GP68 HX 13VG 2023 (Intel Core i9-13980HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs Rs 3,49,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores \\/ 24 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1218,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 5a Gen 11 (Ryzen AI 9 465, RTX 5060, OLED)','lenovo-legion-5a-g11-15agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-9-465-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-5a-g11-15agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-9-465-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,442999.00,476900.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most gaming laptops ask you to carry 2.4 kg or more. The 2026 Legion 5a Gen 11 starts at <strong>1.87 kg</strong>, has an <strong>80Wh battery</strong>, and runs AMD\'s new <strong>Ryzen AI 9 465</strong> with a 50 TOPS NPU. It\'s a gaming laptop that also works as an everyday machine you take to the office. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 4,42,999</strong> with a 2-year warranty.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen AI 9 465 has 10 cores and 20 threads with a 5.0GHz boost. It\'s more efficient than Intel\'s HX chips, which means longer battery life on the go and Copilot+ PC features in Windows. Graphics come from an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB at 115W</strong>. Memory is <strong>32GB DDR5-5600</strong> in dual channel with a 512GB SSD. Storage is the one spec we\'d upgrade soon, because that\'s small for a gaming library.</p>\n<p>The <strong>15.3-inch 2.5K OLED</strong> is excellent: 165Hz, 1000 nits peak, True Black 1000 and 100% DCI-P3. Two <strong>USB4 40Gbps</strong> ports, HDMI 2.1, Ethernet, Wi-Fi 7 and a <strong>5MP + IR</strong> webcam for face login make it a strong work laptop too.</p>\n<p>At this price, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Legion Pro 5 with RTX 5070</a> is faster for pure gaming. The 5a is for buyers who value portability and battery life just as much.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion 5a Gen 11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Legion 5a Gen 11 with Ryzen AI 9 465, RTX 5060 8GB, 32GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 4,42,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Legion 5a Gen 11?\",\"answer\":\"It starts at 1.87 kg, light for a gaming laptop with an RTX 5060.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Legion 5a support Windows Hello?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its 5MP webcam includes an IR sensor for face login.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion 5a Gen 11 (Ryzen AI 9 465, RTX 5060, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-5-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-9-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-5-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-9-rtx-5060-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1219,41,3,'Acer Aspire 7 A715-42G-R2NE 2022 (Ryzen 5 500U)','acer-aspire-7-2022-ryzen-5500u-gtx-1650',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 89,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire 7 A715-42G-R2NE 2022 (Ryzen 5 500U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 89,000</strong>. It was announced in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Ryzen 5500U, 6 cores / 12 threads with NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4GB GDDR6 VRAM) graphics. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.1 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: 3-cell 50 Wh Li-ion; 135W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-41-2024-ryzen-5-7430u\">Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-41 2024 (Ryzen 5 7430U)</a> (Rs 97,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 7 A715-42G-R2NE 2022 (Ryzen 5 500U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 89,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire 7 A715-42G-R2NE 2022 (Ryzen 5 500U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Ryzen 5500U, 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(1220,41,3,'Acer Aspire 5 A515-58GM-76BK 2023 (13th Gen i7-1355U)','acer-aspire-5-15-2023-i7-1355u-rtx-2050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,15,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-03','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire 5 A515-58GM-76BK 2023 (13th Gen i7-1355U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,15,000</strong>. It was announced on 3 January 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1355U, 10 cores / 12 threads with NVIDIA RTX 2050 (4GB DDR6 VRAM) graphics. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1200), 60Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.7 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 50 Wh Li-io