 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 155H, 16 cores \\/ 22 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-01-02 18:15:00','2024-01-02 18:15:00'),(1222,41,3,'Acer Extensa 15 EX215-57 2024 (Intel Core i5-13420H)','acer-extensa-15-ex215-57-2024-intel-core-i5-13420h',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,107999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Extensa is Acer\'s plain office laptop, and this one hides a Core i5-13420H, an H-class processor that is far stronger than the usual chips near a lakh. With 16GB and 512GB it suits accounting, coding and data work at a desk.</p>\n<p>It is not slim, the display is ordinary and the battery is used quickly when the chip works hard. If speed for the money is the aim and looks are not, put it on your list beside the Aspire Lite 15.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Extensa 15 EX215-57 2024 (Intel Core i5-13420H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Extensa 15 EX215-57 2024 (Intel Core i5-13420H) costs Rs 1,07,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Extensa 15 EX215-57 2024 (Intel Core i5-13420H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Extensa 15 EX215-57 2024 (Intel Core i5-13420H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-13420H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1223,41,3,'Acer Swift 14 AI 51-719M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','acer-swift-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,72,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Swift 14 AI 51-719M 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,72,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC 