-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL 2024 (Intel Core i7-1355U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,30,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.38 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5i-gen-9-2024-core-ultra-5\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5i Gen 9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)</a> (Rs 1,29,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL 2024 (Intel Core i7-1355U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,30,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL 2024 (Intel Core i7-1355U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL 2024 (Intel Core i7-1355U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1244,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS)','lenovo-thinkbook-14-g7-2024-ryzen-5-7535hs',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkbook-14-g7-2024-ryzen-5-7535hs.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,72,900 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,72,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS (6nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.36 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z13-gen-1-ryzen-7-pro-6850u\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z13 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850U)</a> (Rs 1,75,120).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,72,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS (6nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1245,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h.webp',NULL,NULL,266499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 is for people who spend the whole day inside spreadsheets, ERPs and dashboards and want a bigger canvas without losing the ThinkPad keyboard. It costs <strong>Rs 2,66,499</strong> at ONIN Infosys, ships with <strong>Windows 11 Pro</strong>, and has a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>This model moves to the H-series <strong>Core Ultra 7 255H</strong>: 16 cores, 22 threads and up to 5.1GHz. It\'s a big jump over the U-series chips in the 14-inch ThinkPads when you\'re crunching data or compiling code. Its <strong>Intel Arc 140T</strong> graphics are strong for an integrated GPU and drive high-resolution external monitors smoothly. You get 16GB of DDR5-5600 (expandable to 64GB) and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>The 16-inch WUXGA panel is 400 nits and anti-glare, and the full-size keyboard has a number pad, which accountants will appreciate. Connectivity matches the L14: two Thunderbolt 4 ports, three USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet. At 1.79 kg it\'s portable for its size, and the 57Wh battery is reasonable. If you mostly work in one place and want something more compact, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u\">L14 Gen 6</a> is about Rs 60,000 cheaper.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 with Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,66,499, with Windows 11 Pro and a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 have a number pad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 16-inch body fits a full keyboard with a numeric keypad.\"},{\"question\":\"What graphics does the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"Integrated Intel Arc 140T graphics, which are part of the Core Ultra 7 255H.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-core-ultra-7-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-core-ultra-7-price-nepal',NULL,1,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1246,39,3,'Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i 15ILL9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)','lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition-15ill9-2024-core-ultra-7-258v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,24,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i 15ILL9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,24,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.3 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA+ (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.53 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 70 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 2025</a> (Rs 2,25,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i 15ILL9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,24,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i 15ILL9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i 15ILL9 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1247,39,3,'Lenovo Slim 7 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','lenovo-slim-7-14ill10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-slim-7-14ill10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,64,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo Slim 7 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,64,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WQXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.28 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 70 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports Rapid Charge Pro.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i Aura Edition</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo Slim 7 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,64,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo Slim 7 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Slim 7 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1248,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U)','dell-inspiron-14-7420-i7-1255u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-14-7420-i7-1255u.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,50,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,50,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1255U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.57 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,50,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1255U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(1249,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 (Core 5 120U, 16GB/1TB)','dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u.webp',NULL,NULL,131500.00,143999.00,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 folds back into a tablet, comes in a soft <strong>Ice Blue</strong>, and has a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, which is rare at this price. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,31,500</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong> (10 cores, 12 threads, up to 5.0GHz) with 16GB of DDR5. That\'s a good combination for students and home users who take notes by hand, watch a lot of video, and want plenty of room for photos and downloads. The 14-inch FHD+ (1920 × 1200) touchscreen is anti-glare at 300 nits, so it holds up better under room lights than glossy convertibles.</p>\n<p>The battery is a healthy 54Wh. Ports include two 10Gbps USB ports, two 5Gbps USB ports, HDMI and a microSD slot. At 1.71 kg it\'s heavier than the 1.5 kg convertibles, which you\'ll notice in tablet mode. Note that the 1TB drive is a QLC type, so large sustained file copies slow down a little.</p>\n<p>For a faster AMD chip with Copilot+ AI features in a similar body, see the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 with Core 5 120U, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,31,500.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 14 7440 a touchscreen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is a 2-in-1 with a 14-inch FHD+ anti-glare touchscreen.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is it?\",\"answer\":\"About 1.71 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 (Core 5 120U, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-inspiron-14-2in1-7440-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-inspiron-14-2in1-7440-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1250,9,3,'Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 (Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB/1TB)','dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd.webp',NULL,NULL,178499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 is a convertible with a properly fast processor. AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen AI 7 350</strong> has 8 cores, an NPU for Copilot+ features and <strong>Radeon 860M</strong> graphics, among the better integrated GPUs for photo editing and light gaming. ONIN Infosys sells it in Midnight Blue for <strong>Rs 1,78,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It comes with 16GB of LPDDR5X-7500 and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, so storage isn\'t a worry. The 14-inch 16:10 touchscreen (1920 × 1200, 300 nits) uses Dell\'s ComfortView low-blue-light tech, and the 360-degree hinge lets you use it as a tablet for notes or reading. A fingerprint reader and backlit keyboard round out the daily-use details.</p>\n<p>The <strong>64Wh battery</strong> is generous for a 1.59 kg convertible, and both USB-C ports (10Gbps) support charging and DisplayPort. There\'s also a USB-A and HDMI.</p>\n<p>It costs more than the Intel-based <a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u\">Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440</a>. That extra buys a considerably faster CPU and GPU, Copilot+ AI features and a bigger battery, all worth it if you\'ll keep the laptop for years.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 with Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,78,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 a Copilot+ PC?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The Ryzen AI 7 350\'s NPU supports Windows Copilot+ features.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a fingerprint reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists a fingerprint reader and backlit keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 (Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-14-plus-2in1-amd-ryzen-ai7-350-copilot-pc-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-14-plus-2in1-amd-ryzen-ai7-350-copilot-pc-price',NULL,1,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1251,9,3,'Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,164999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 1,64,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.61 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 64 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i Aura Edition</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition-14ill10-2