 Core Ultra 7 165U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP EliteBook 640 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 7 165U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 165U (Intel 4), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1256,8,3,'HP ProBook 445 G11 (Ryzen 5 7535U)','hp-probook-445-g11-ryzen-5-7535u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,114999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Thirty-two gigabytes of memory, a 16:10 screen, a 56Wh battery and Windows 11 Pro for Rs 1,14,999. The ProBook 445 G11 is the kind of laptop offices buy by the dozen and students rarely hear about.</p>\n<p>Its Ryzen 5 7535U is not the latest, and for documents, code, spreadsheets and calls it is plenty. Keyboard and build are a class above consumer models. Check the product number and warranty on HP\'s site, as business stock comes from several routes.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP ProBook 445 G11 (Ryzen 5 7535U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP ProBook 445 G11 (Ryzen 5 7535U) costs Rs 1,14,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP ProBook 445 G11 (Ryzen 5 7535U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP ProBook 445 G11 (Ryzen 5 7535U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7535U (6nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2026-02-23 18:15:00','2026-02-23 18:15:00'),(1257,48,3,'MSI Modern 14 C12M 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U)','msi-modern-14-2022-i5-1235u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,92000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Modern 14 C12M 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) costs <strong>Rs 92,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It was announced in 2022. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores / 12 threa