14,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-73m0-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-5050\">Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-52-73M0 2025 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 2,14,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-s-16-oled-s5606ma-2025-core-ultra-9-285h-16gb-1tb-16-32k-oled&g2=dell-14-plus-db14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v-32gb-1tb-14-wqxga-oled-90hz\">compare the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H) with the Dell 14 Plus DB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H) costs Rs 2,14,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook S 16 OLED S5606MA 2025 (Core Ultra 9 285H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 285H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1260,40,3,'Asus Vivobook S 15 M5506WA 2025 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370)','asus-vivobook-s15-2025-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s15-2025-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370.webp',NULL,NULL,219999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook S 15 M5506WA 2025 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370) costs <strong>Rs 2,19,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal on 8 February 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370 (4nm), 12 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1620 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 90W Adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same bud