dmi Pad 2 9.7</a> (Rs 25,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=infinix-xpad-20-pro&g2=blackview-tab-13-pro\">compare the Infinix XPAD 20 Pro with the Blackview Tab 13 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix XPAD 20 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix XPAD 20 Pro starts at Rs 26,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 26,999 for 4GB\\/128GB; Rs 31,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix XPAD 20 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix XPAD 20 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultimate (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix XPAD 20 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 8000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-11 18:15:00','2026-01-11 18:15:00'),(1262,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 16 M1607KA-MB117W 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)','asus-vivobook-16-m1607ka-mb117w-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,145999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 16 M1607KA-MB117W 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) costs <strong>Rs 1,45,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.88 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025\">ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025</a> (Rs 1,45,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430\">Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)</a> (Rs 1,45,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop