ra 9 285H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 3,98,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook Duo UX8406CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook Duo UX8406CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 285H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1264,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA608UP 2025 (Ryzen 9 270)','asus-tuf-gaming-a16-2025-ryzen-9-270-rtx-5070',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,43,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA608UP 2025 (Ryzen 9 270) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,43,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Ryzen 9 270, 8 cores / 16 threads with NVIDIA RTX 5070 (8GB GDDR7 VRAM, Up to 115W TGP) graphics. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200), 165Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 2.20 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-ion 90Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026\">Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465)</a> (Rs 2,39,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA608UP 2025 (Ryzen 9 270) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,43,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA608UP 2025 (Ryzen 9 270) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA608UP 2025 (Ryzen 9 270) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Ryzen 9 270, 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1265,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix Scar 18 G835LX (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090)','asus-rog-strix-g18-scar-g835lx-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-scar-g835lx-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090.webp',NULL,NULL,778999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is the top of the mountain for gaming laptops in Nepal. The ROG Strix Scar 18 G835LX pairs NVIDIA\'s <strong>RTX 5090 Laptop GPU with 24GB of GDDR7</strong>, running at a full <strong>175W</strong>, with Intel\'s 24-core <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong>. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 7,78,999</strong>, with an ROG backpack and 2 years of official warranty (including a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty).</p>\n<p>The 24GB of VRAM is what separates it from RTX 5080 laptops. It means 4K textures, path tracing in every game, and room for large local AI models and complex 3D scenes that won\'t fit on 16GB cards. The <strong>18-inch Mini LED</strong> ROG Nebula HDR panel runs at 2560 × 1600 and 240Hz with 100% DCI-P3 and Dolby Vision. HDR games and films look superb on it.</p>\n<p>It has 32GB DDR5, a 2TB SSD, <strong>two Thunderbolt 5</strong> ports, three USB-A, HDMI 2.1, 2.5Gb Ethernet, Wi-Fi 7, a per-key RGB keyboard and an IR webcam. It weighs <strong>3.3 kg</strong> and comes with a large power brick. Plan for a sturdy table and a good UPS rather than a backpack.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t need the 24GB card, the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5080\">Scar 16 with RTX 5080</a> saves nearly Rs 1,80,000 and is far more portable.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix Scar 18 RTX 5090 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix Scar 18 G835LX with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090 24GB, 32GB DDR5 and 2TB SSD for Rs 7,78,999.\"},{\"question\":\"How much VRAM does the RTX 5090 laptop GPU have?\",\"answer\":\"24GB of GDDR7.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Scar 18?\",\"answer\":\"About 3.3 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix Scar 18 G835LX (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-scar-g18-g835lx-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-scar-g18-g835lx-nepal',NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1266,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,329999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) costs <strong>Rs 3,29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (TSMC N3B), 24 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 3.2 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX)</a> (Rs 3,31,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024\">Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 3,25,755). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060&g2=lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) with the Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G1