ort update promises. A Redmi 17 5G for Rs 3,300 more lasts far longer, and a Spark 40 Pro has a much finer screen. Choose the G35 only for the software, and look for the 8GB version.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G35 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G35 5G costs Rs 30,699 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G35 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G35 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T760 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G35 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-09 18:15:00','2025-08-09 18:15:00'),(1283,7,37,'Sony WH-CH720N','sony-wh-ch720n',NULL,'gadgets/2026/sony-wh-ch720n.webp',NULL,NULL,27000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Sony WH-CH720N costs <strong>Rs 27,000</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2023. This range brings noise cancellation and longer battery life.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 30 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 35 hours, With ANC on, 50 hours, With ANC off; 3.5 hours, Quick charge: 3 minutes = 1 hour playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/nothing-headphone-a\">Nothing Headphone (a)</a> (Rs 26,999) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-space-one-pro\">Soundcore Space One Pro</a> (Rs 25,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=sony-wh-ch720n&g2=nothing-headphone-a\">compare the Sony WH-CH720N with the Nothing Headphone (a)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Sony WH-CH720N price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Sony WH-CH720N costs Rs 27,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Sony WH-CH720N launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Sony WH-CH720N battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 35 hours, With ANC on, 50 hours, With ANC off; 3.5 hours, Quick charge: 3 minutes = 1 hour playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(1284,7,37,'Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9','sony-wh-g900n-inzone-h9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,55499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 costs <strong>Rs 55,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2024. At this price you are buying top-tier noise cancellation, comfort and sound quality.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 32 hours, With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1 hour playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sony-wh-1000xm5\">Sony WH-1000XM5</a> (Rs 57,600) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tour-one-m2\">JBL TOUR ONE M2</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=sony-wh-g900n-inzone-h9&g2=sony-wh-1000xm5\">compare the Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 with the Sony WH-1000XM5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 costs Rs 55,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Sony WH-G900N INZONE H9 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 32 hours, With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1 hour playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1285,65,5,'Ultima Watch Circle 2.0','ultima-watch-circle-2-0',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3699.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-12','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Ultima Watch Circle 2.0 costs <strong>Rs 3,699</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 12 September 2025. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches displa