d in Nepal on 17 December 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the ZTE nubia Air use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T8300 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the ZTE nubia Air battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-16 18:15:00','2025-12-16 18:15:00'),(1287,6,2,'Realme 14 5G','realme-14-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-14-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,49999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-13','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme 14 5G is the Rs 50,000 phone for people who want few compromises: a quick Snapdragon 6 Gen 4, faster memory than its siblings, a stabilised camera, a bright AMOLED and water resistance, with a 6,000mAh battery behind it all.</p>\n<p>It costs Rs 5,000 more than the P3, which shares the chip and loses the stabilisation. For photos after dark the extra is worth paying. It has been on sale since 2025, so expect a discount and ask for one.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme 14 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme 14 5G costs Rs 49,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme 14 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 13 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme 14 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme 14 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 6000 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-12 18:15:00','2025-06-12 18:15:00'),(1288,8,3,'HP Victus 15 2024 (Ryzen 5 8645HS)','hp-victus-15-2024-ryzen-5-8645hs-rtx-4050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,22,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Victus 15 2024 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,22,999</strong>. It was announced in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Ryzen 5 8645HS, 6 cores / 12 threads with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 (6GB GDDR6 VRAM, 85W TGP) graphics. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080), 144Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.30 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: 70Wh; 200W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current HP alternative is the <a href=\"/products/hp-elitebook-655-g10-ryzen-5-pro-7530u\">HP EliteBook 655 G10 (Ryzen 5 Pro 7530U)</a> (Rs 1,29,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the HP Victus 15 2024 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,22,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Victus 15 2024 (Ryzen 5 8645HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Ryzen 5 8645HS, 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1289,2,37,'Apple AirPods Max (2024)','apple-airpods-max-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-airpods-max-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,105000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple AirPods Max (2024) costs <strong>Rs 1,05,000</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2024. At this price you are buying top-tier noise cancellation, comfort and sound quality.</p>\n<p>Drivers: Apple-designed dynamic driver. Battery: Music: 20 hours, With ANC or Spartial Audio on; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1.5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/sony-1000x-the-collexion\">Sony 1000X THE COLLEXION</a> (Rs 1,06,900) and the <a href=\"/products/sony-wh-1000xm6\">Sony WH-1000XM6</a> (Rs 88,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=apple-airpods-max-2024&g2=sony-1000x-the-collexion\">compare the Apple AirPods Max (2024) with the Sony 1000X THE COLLEXION</a> side b