/strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 3 October 2024. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 6 days (normal usage); 390 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-ultima-ember\">boAt Ultima Ember</a> (Rs 6,799) and the <a href=\"/products/mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\">MWC Aether One Watch Pro</a> (Rs 6,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=boat-enigma-radiant&g2=boat-ultima-ember\">compare the boAt Enigma Radiant with the boAt Ultima Ember</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the boAt Enigma Radiant price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The boAt Enigma Radiant costs Rs 6,799 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the boAt Enigma Radiant launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 October 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the boAt Enigma Radiant battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 6 days (normal usage); 390 mAh.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-10-02 18:15:00','2024-10-02 18:15:00'),(1293,11,5,'boAt Ultima Regal','boat-ultima-regal',NULL,'gadgets/2026/boat-ultima-regal.webp',NULL,NULL,6099.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-10-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>From across a table the Ultima Regal could pass for a watch at three times the price. The two-inch AMOLED is bright, the finish is metallic and calls work from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Look closer and it is a style piece: heart-rate and sleep data are rough, there is no GPS, and the battery manages a few days with calling on. At a similar price a Galaxy Fit 3 or Huawei Band 10 tracks better. Buy it for how it looks on you, and it will not disappoint.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the boAt Ultima Regal price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The boAt Ultima Regal costs Rs 6,099 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\"