\":\"Is the CMF Buds Pro still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 8,499.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the CMF Buds Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 12 June 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the CMF Buds Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 11 hours (buds) \\/ 39 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-06-11 18:15:00','2024-06-11 18:15:00'),(1329,76,4,'Kick Phantom Buds X Pro','kick-phantom-buds-x-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2599.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-31','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Noise cancelling and a connection to two devices under Rs 3,000 used to be impossible. The Phantom Buds X Pro offer both. The cancelling softens a bus engine without silencing it, and multipoint lets you take a phone call in the middle of a laptop lecture.</p>\n<p>Sound is bass-first, the microphones are for quiet rooms, and nobody should expect more than two years of daily use. Try all the ear tips, since a good seal changes everything. For students counting rupees, they are the most feature for the money in the shop.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Kick Phantom Buds X Pro costs Rs 2,599 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Kick Phantom Buds X Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1.66 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-30 18:15:00','2025-10-30 18:15:00'),(1330,43,5,'Huawei Watch Fit 3','huawei-watch-fit-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 18,990 last listed price in Nepal','2024-09-22','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch Fit 3 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 18,990</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 22 Septem