ted price was Rs 39,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Vivo Y400 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Vivo Y400 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-ion 6000 mAh, non-removable; 44W Wired.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1352,37,2,'Vivo Y21d','vivo-y21d',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 21,499 last listed price in Nepal','2025-05-23','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivo Y21d is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 21,499</strong>. It was announced on 23 May 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.68 inches LCD, 90Hz, 1000 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Unisoc T7225 (12nm). Its Li-Ion 6500 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 44W FlashCharge. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8 + Depth : 0.08MP, f/3.0. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current vivo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/vivo-y05e\">Vivo Y05e</a> (Rs 19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Vivo Y21d still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 21,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Vivo Y21d use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T7225 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Vivo Y21d battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 6500 mAh, non-removable; 44W FlashCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-22 18:15:00','2025-05-22 18:15:00'),(1353,3,2,'Xiaomi 15T','xiaomi-15t',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-15t.webp',NULL,NULL,64999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 15T is how to get Leica-tuned cameras without paying for a flagship. Three useful lenses, including a telephoto, sit with a Dimensity 8400 Ultra, 12GB of memory and a large bright AMOLED for about Rs 65,000.</p>\n<p>It is no longer the latest, which is why it is affordable, and it remains faster than most new phones at the price. Battery and 67W charging are solid. For travel and street photography on a budget, look at this before the fashionable mid-rangers.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi 15T price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Xiaomi 15T costs Rs 64,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Xiaomi 15T launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Xiaomi 15T use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 8400 Ultra (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi 15T battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5500 mAh, non-removable; 67W TurboCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 18:15:00','2025-10-06 18:15:00'),(1354,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 15 3520 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U)','dell-inspiron-15-2022-i5-1235u-mx550-120hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-15-2022-i5-1235u-mx550-120hz.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,30,299 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Inspiron 15 3520 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,30,299</strong>. It was announced in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, WVA LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 120Hz, 220 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.94 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 41 Wh Li-ion; 65W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320\">Dell XPS 13 DX13260 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 5 3