 XPS 13 9345 2024 (Snapdragon X Plus) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Snapdragon X Plus X1P-64-100.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1357,73,2,'Google Pixel 10','google-pixel-10',NULL,'gadgets/2026/google-pixel-10.webp',NULL,NULL,128000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-20','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Google Pixel 10 costs <strong>Rs 1,28,000</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. It was announced on 20 August 2025. That is flagship money, so the camera system, the chip and the build quality all need to justify it.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.3 inches OLED, 120Hz, 2000 nits (HDR), 3000 nits (peak) screen and runs on the Google Tensor G5 (3nm). The Li-Ion 4970 mAh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 30W USB-PD Charging, 15W Wireless Charging. Cameras: Primary: 48MP, f/1.7, 25 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/2.0\" sensor + Ultrawide: 13MP, f/2.2, 16 mm, PDAF, 120° FOV, 1/3.1\" sensor + Telephoto: 10.8MP, f/3.1, 112 mm, 5x optical zoom, OIS, PDAF. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-iphone-15\">iPhone 15</a> (Rs 1,27,499) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-600-pro\">Honor 600 Pro</a> (Rs 1,29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=google-pixel-10&g2=apple-iphone-15\">compare the Google Pixel 10 with the iPhone 15</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Google Pixel 10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Google Pixel 10 costs Rs 1,28,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Google Pixel 10 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Google Tensor G5 (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Google Pixel 10 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 4970 mAh, non-removable; 30W USB-PD Charging; 15W Wireless Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-19 18:15:00','2025-08-19 18:15:00'),(1358,73,2,'Google Pixel 10 Pro XL','google-pixel-10-pro-xl',NULL,'gadgets/2026/google-pixel-10-pro-xl.webp',NULL,NULL,200000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-20','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Google Pixel 10 Pro XL costs <strong>Rs 2,00,000</strong> in Nepal for the Google Pixel 10 Pro - 16GB - 256GB model. It was announced on 20 August 2025. It is one of the most expensive phones you can buy in Nepal.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8 inches LTPO OLED, 120Hz, 2200 nits (HDR), 3300 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Google Tensor G5 (3nm). Its Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W Fast Charging, 25W Qi2 Wireless Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.7, 25 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.31\" sensor + Ultrawide: 48MP, f/1.7, PDAF, 123° FOV, 1/2.55\" sensor + Periscope: 48MP, f/2.8, 113 mm, 5x optical zoom, OIS, PDAF. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-17-ultra\">Xiaomi 17 Ultra</a> (Rs 1,99,999) and the <a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a> (Rs 1,99,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=google-pixel-10-pro-xl&g2=xiaomi-17-ultra\">compare the Google Pixel 10 Pro XL with the Xiaomi 17 Ultra</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Google Pixel 10 Pro XL price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Google Pixel 10 Pro XL costs Rs 2,00,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Google Pixel 10 Pro XL use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Google Tensor G5 (3nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Google Pixel 10 Pro XL battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging; 25W Qi2 Wireless Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-19 18:15:00','2025-08-19 18:15:00'),(1359,9,3,'Dell Vostro 15 3520 2022 (12th Gen i3-1215U)','dell-vostro-15-3520-2022-12th-gen-i3-1215u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-vostro-15-3520-2022-12th-gen-i3-1215u.webp',NULL,