n 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 14 DC14255 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 330) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 330 (4nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1420,4,31,'OnePlus Pad 2','oneplus-pad-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 74,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-08-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OnePlus Pad 2 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 74,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in August 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 12.1 inches IPS LCD, 144Hz, 600 nits (typ), 900 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 (4nm). The Li-Po 9510 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 67W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current OnePlus alternative is the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-pad-go-2\">OnePlus Pad Go 2</a> (Rs 49,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the OnePlus Pad 2 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 74,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Pad 2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in August 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the OnePlus Pad 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Pad 2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 9510 mAh, non-removable; 67W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-07-31 18:15:00','2024-07-31 18:15:00'),(1421,73,2,'Google Pixel 10 Pro','google-pixel-10-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/google-pixel-10-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,176000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-20','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Google Pixel 10 Pro costs <strong>Rs 1,76,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/256GB model. It was announced on 20 August 2025. T