is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)</a> (Rs 78,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-52M-54V4 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 79,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-52M-54V4 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-52M-54V4 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1334U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1471,41,3,'Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P (Core 3 N355, 8GB/256GB)','acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd.webp',NULL,NULL,73999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire Go 15 is a no-fuss 15.6-inch laptop for the jobs most people actually do: email, online classes, YouTube, Office files and banking. ONIN Infosys sells the AG15-32P-39R2 for <strong>Rs 73,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 3 N355</strong>, an 8-core, 8-thread efficiency chip. It\'s not quick at heavy tasks, but it stays cool and quiet, and paired with a <strong>53Wh battery</strong> it lasts well through a day of light use. The 15.6-inch Full HD panel is IPS, so colours stay consistent at an angle. You get <strong>two 10Gbps USB-C ports</strong>, two USB-A ports and HDMI, which is better connectivity than many cheaper laptops offer.</p>\n<p>Keep your expectations realistic. 8GB of memory and a 256GB SSD are entry-level, so this isn\'t the laptop for Photoshop, programming IDEs or games beyond simple titles. At 1.73 kg it\'s portable but not light. If your budget allows another Rs 10,000–15,000, a 4-core Ryzen model like the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">IdeaPad 1 15AMN7</a> or the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40\">Vivobook 15 E1504FA</a> (with 512GB) will age better.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 with Core 3 N355, 8GB RAM and 256GB SSD for Rs 73,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Core 3 N355 good for students?\",\"answer\":\"For online classes, documents, browsing and video streaming, yes. It is an efficiency chip, so heavy software will be slow.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Aspire Go 15 have USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, two USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C ports, plus two USB-A ports and HDMI.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P (Core 3 N355, 8GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-go-15-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-go-15-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1472,41,3,'Acer Swift Go 14 SFG14 2023 (Ryzen 5 7530U)','acer-swift-go-14-2023-ryzen-5-7530u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 85,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Swift Go 14 SFG14 2023 (Ryzen 5 7530U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 85,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7530U (7nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. At 1.25 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 50 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer