"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-04-25 18:15:00','2022-04-25 18:15:00'),(1818,70,2,'Infinix Note 50x','infinix-note-50x',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-04','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Few phones embarrass their rivals like the Note 50x. For about Rs 22,000 it carries a Dimensity 7300 Ultimate, the kind of chip found in phones at twice the price, together with UFS storage and 45W charging. PUBG and Free Fire run properly.</p>\n<p>To afford it, Infinix fitted an ordinary LCD and a simple selfie camera. Service is through Carlcare, so make sure there is a centre within reach, and expect two or three years of updates. If you are a student who plays, start your search here and see whether anything pulls you away.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Note 50x price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix Note 50x costs Rs 21,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Note 50x launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 4 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Note 50x use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Ultimate (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Note 50x battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5200 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-03 18:15:00','2025-06-03 18:15:00'),(1819,70,2,'Infinix Note 30','infinix-note-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 23,999 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Infinix Note 30 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 23,999</strong>. It was announced in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 Inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 580 nits (peak) screen and runs on the Mediatek MT8781 Helio G99 (6nm). Its Li-Ion 5000mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W Wired Fast Charging. Software support: No promis