,12,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo Yoga 7 16IML9 2-in-1 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125U, 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(2056,40,3,'ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304VA (Core i7-1355U, 16GB/1TB)','asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-2023-i7-1355u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-2023-i7-1355u.webp',NULL,NULL,191000.00,205000.00,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Pick up the Zenbook S13 and the first thing you notice is that it barely weighs anything: <strong>1.0 kg</strong>, with a body that\'s thinner than most phones are tall. For people who carry their laptop all day, such as consultants, journalists and students walking between campus buildings, that changes how the day feels. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 1,91,000</strong> with a 2-year global warranty and a bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The screen is a <strong>13.3-inch 3K (2880 × 1800) OLED</strong>, Pantone-validated with 100% DCI-P3 and 550-nit HDR peaks, so text is crisp and photos look accurate. A <strong>Core i7-1355U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.0GHz) with 16GB LPDDR5 and a <strong>1TB</strong> PCIe 4.0 SSD keeps office and browser work fast. A 63Wh battery is big for such a small laptop.</p>\n<p>Despite the thinness you still get <strong>two Thunderbolt 4</strong> ports, a full-size USB-A and HDMI 2.1, so no dongles needed for a projector. The trade-offs: memory is fixed at 16GB, the panel is 60Hz, and Iris Xe graphics are only for light creative work.</p>\n<p>The newer <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s13-oled-ux5304ma-core-ultra-7-155u\">Zenbook S13 with Core Ultra 7 155U</a> adds an NPU and slightly better graphics for about Rs 9,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304VA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Zenbook S13 OLED with Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD 