axy A07</a> (Rs 25,499).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Samsung Galaxy A05 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 14,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy A05 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Helio G85 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy A05 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable; 25W charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(2387,3,31,'Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro','xiaomi-pad-6-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 52,999 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 52,999</strong>. It was announced in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches IPS LCD, 144Hz, 550 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8+ Gen 1 (4nm). The Li-Ion 8600 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 67W Fast Charging, PD3.0, QC4.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Xiaomi alternative is the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-pad-8\">Xiaomi Pad 8</a> (Rs 59,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 52,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8+ Gen 1 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 8600 mAh, non-removable; 67W Fast Charging, PD3.0, QC4.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(2388,3,31,'Xiaomi Pad 6','xiaomi-pad-6',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-pad-6.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 39,999 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Xiaomi Pad 6 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 39,999</strong>. It was announced in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches IPS LCD, 144Hz, 550 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 870 (7nm). The Li-Ion 8840 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 33W Fast Charging, PD3.0, QC4.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Xiaomi alternative is the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-pad-7\">Xiaomi Pad 7</a> (Rs 44,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Xiaomi Pad 6 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 39,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Xiaomi Pad 6 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 870 (7nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Pad 6 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 8840 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging, PD3.0, QC4.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(2389,47,2,'Motorola Moto G42','motorola-moto-g42-4g',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'No Nepal price on record','2022-06-09','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G42 is no longer stocked in Nepal. It was announced on 9 June 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.4 inches OLED, 60Hz screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 680 4G (6nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 20W Fast Charging.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Motorola alternative is the <a href=\"/products/moto-g06-power\">Motorola Moto G06 Power</a> (Rs 31,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Motorola Moto G42 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G42 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 680 4G (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G42 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 20W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-06-08 18:15:00','2022-06-08 18:15:00'),(2390,37,2,'Vivo T1 5G','vivo-t1-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/vivo-t1-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'No Nepal price on record','2022-02-14','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivo T1 5G is no longer stocked in Nepal. It was announced on 14 February 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.58 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz screen and runs on the Snapdragon 695 5G (6nm). Its Li-Po 5000mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 18W Fast Charging.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current vivo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a> (Rs 1,99,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Vivo T1 5G still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Vivo T1 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Snapdragon 695 5G (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Vivo T1 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000mAh, non-removable; 18W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-02-13 18:15:00','2022-02-13 18:15:00'),(2391,37,2,'Vivo V21s','vivo-v21s',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'No Nepal price on record','2022-11-17','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivo V21s is no longer stocked in Nepal. It was announced on 17 November 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.44 inches AMOLED, 90Hz, 800 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the MediaTek Dimensity 800U (7 nm). The Li-Po 4000mAh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 33W FlashCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current vivo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a> (Rs 1,99,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Vivo V21s still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Vivo V21s use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Dimensity 800U (7 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Vivo V21s battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 4000mAh, non-removable; 33W FlashCharge.\"}]','[{\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-11-16 18:15:00','2022-11-16 18:15:00'),(2392,7,32,'God of War Ragnarök','god-of-war-ragnarok',NULL,'gadgets/2026/god-of-war-ragnarok.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$69.99 US launch price (PS5)','2022-11-09','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>God of War Ragnarök came out on 9 November 2022 for PS5, PS4, PC (2024). It is developed by Santa Monica Studio and published by Sony Interactive Entertainment. Genre: Action-adventure.</p>\n<p>There is no official Nepal price for the game. It launched at $69.99 in the US (PS5). In Nepal you can pay the store price with a dollar card, or buy a disc or code from a local game shop. Avoid cheap \"shared account\" offers, which can stop working at any time.</p>\n<p>Modes: Single-player. To play it, see the <a href=\"/products/sony-playstation-5\">Sony PlayStation 5</a> price in Nepal. You can also <a href=\"/compare?category=games&g1=god-of-war-ragnarok&g2=gta-6\">compare it with GTA VI</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was God of War Ragnar\\u00f6k released?\",\"answer\":\"It was released on 9 November 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"Which platforms is God of War Ragnar\\u00f6k on?\",\"answer\":\"PS5, PS4, PC (2024)\"},{\"question\":\"What is the God of War Ragnar\\u00f6k price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"There is no official Nepal price. It launched at $69.99 in the US (PS5).\"}]','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2022-11-08 18:15:00','2022-11-08 18:15:00'),(2393,3,2,'Xiaomi 18 Pro Max','xiaomi-18-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-18-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,219999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-11-17','announced','Launched globally 17 Nov 2026; Nepal date not announced',0,1,'<p>The Xiaomi 18 Pro Max is Xiaomi\'s top phone this year. It launched in China in September 2026 and globally at an event in Paris on 17 November, starting at <strong>€1,599</strong> in Europe for 12GB/256GB. Xiaomi Nepal hasn\'t announced it yet.</p>\n<p>It is the first phone with a chip that runs at 5GHz, the Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6. It has two 200MP Leica cameras (main and periscope telephoto) plus a 50MP ultra wide, and a 2.9-inch screen on the back for selfies with the main camera and for notifications.</p>\n<h3>Smaller battery outside China</h3>\n<p>The global model has a <strong>7,050mAh</strong> battery, against 8,500mAh in China. That\'s still bigger than most flagships, but if you\'re thinking of importing one, know which version you\'re getting.</p>\n<h3>Expected price in Nepal</h3>\n<p>Our estimate is about <strong>Rs 2,19,999</strong> for 12GB/256GB. The <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-17-ultra\">Xiaomi 17 Ultra</a> sells here for Rs 1,99,999, and the 18 Pro Max costs more in Europe. Choose a storage option above to see the estimate for each one. We\'ll update this page when Xiaomi Nepal announces official prices.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Xiaomi 18 Pro Max available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Not officially yet. It launched globally on 17 November 2026 and Xiaomi Nepal has not announced a date.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the Xiaomi 18 Pro Max cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 2,19,999 for 12GB\\/256GB, based on the \\u20ac1,599 European price and the Xiaomi 17 Ultra\'s Nepal price. It is not an official figure.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the Xiaomi 18 Pro Max battery?\",\"answer\":\"The global model has 7,050mAh. The Chinese model has 8,500mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"Xiaomi UK \\u2013 Xiaomi 18 Pro Max specs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.mi.com\\/uk\\/product\\/xiaomi-18-pro-max\\/specs\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Android Headlines \\u2013 Xiaomi 18 Pro and Pro Max global prices\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.androidheadlines.com\\/2026\\/11\\/xiaomi-18-pro-and-18-pro-max-are-finally-going-global-and-the-prices-are-steep.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Gizchina \\u2013 European 18 Pro costs more, packs less battery\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gizchina.com\\/xiaomi-phones\\/xiaomis-european-18-pro-costs-more-and-packs-less-battery\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"91mobiles \\u2013 Xiaomi 18 Pro series launched in China\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.91mobiles.com\\/hub\\/xiaomi-18-pro-series-launched-price-specifications-global-debut-confirmed\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,9,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 07:24:10'),(2394,3,2,'Xiaomi 18 Pro','xiaomi-18-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-18-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,189999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-11-17','announced','Launched globally 17 Nov 2026; Nepal date not announced',0,0,'<p>The Xiaomi 18 Pro is the smaller of Xiaomi\'s two new flagships. It launched globally in Paris on 17 November 2026 at <strong>€1,399</strong>, alongside the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-18-pro-max\">18 Pro Max</a>. It isn\'t on sale in Nepal yet.</p>\n<p>It uses the regular Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6 (the Pro Max gets the faster \"Extreme\" version), keeps the two 200MP Leica cameras, and has a 2.7-inch rear display. The global battery is 6,000mAh, down from 7,000mAh in China.</p>\n<p>Our Nepal estimate is about <strong>Rs 1,89,999</strong>, based on the European price and current Xiaomi flagship prices here. It isn\'t an official figure.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the difference between the Xiaomi 18 Pro and 18 Pro Max?\",\"answer\":\"The Pro Max has a bigger screen and rear display, the faster Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6 chip and a bigger battery (7,050mAh vs 6,000mAh globally). Both have two 200MP Leica cameras.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the Xiaomi 18 Pro cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 1,89,999. Xiaomi Nepal has not announced a price.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"Gizchina \\u2013 Xiaomi 18 Pro launches in Europe at \\u20ac1,399\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gizchina.com\\/xiaomi-phones\\/xiaomis-european-18-pro-costs-more-and-packs-less-battery\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"PhoneArena \\u2013 Xiaomi 18 Pro and 18 Pro Max official\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.phonearena.com\\/news\\/xiaomi-18-pro-18-pro-max-official-specs-features-prices_id183565\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,7,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:40:27'),(2395,37,2,'vivo X500 Pro Max','vivo-x500-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/vivo-x500-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-10-27','announced','Launched globally 27 Oct 2026; South Asia launch expected around end of November',0,0,'<p>vivo\'s camera flagship for 2026 launched in China in September and globally on 27 October. It isn\'t sold in Nepal yet, but reports say vivo plans to bring the X500 series to India by the end of November, and Nepal usually follows soon after.</p>\n<p>The headline is a 200MP Zeiss periscope telephoto, plus an optional clip-on telephoto extender for very long zoom. It has a 6.85-inch screen, MediaTek\'s 2nm Dimensity 9600 Pro and a battery of up to 7,800mAh with 90W charging.</p>\n<p>Our Nepal estimate is about <strong>Rs 2,39,999</strong>. The <a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a> sells for Rs 1,99,999, and the Pro Max is the bigger, pricier model. Treat the European price reports as unconfirmed: we found €1,299 to €1,599 depending on the source and the model.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When will the vivo X500 Pro Max launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"vivo Nepal has not announced a date. Reports say the series reaches India by the end of November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the vivo X500 Pro Max cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 2,39,999. It is not an official figure.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"91mobiles \\u2013 vivo X500 series goes global\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.91mobiles.com\\/hub\\/vivo-x500-pro-pro-max-launched-globally-price-specifications\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Fonearena \\u2013 vivo X500, X500 Pro and X500 Pro Max go global\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.fonearena.com\\/blog\\/495857\\/vivo-x500-x500-pro-x500-pro-max-price-specifications-global.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Notebookcheck \\u2013 vivo X500 Pro series launches\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.notebookcheck.net\\/Vivo-X500-Pro-series-launches-with-new-flagship-SoC-tweaked-Zeiss-camera-setup-and-up-to-8-000mAh-battery.1404721.0.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:12'),(2396,37,2,'vivo X500 Pro','vivo-x500-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/vivo-x500-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,209999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-10-27','announced','Launched globally 27 Oct 2026; South Asia launch expected around end of November',0,0,'<p>The vivo X500 Pro is the compact model of vivo\'s new camera flagships, with a 6.36-inch screen and a 6,510mAh battery, which is a lot for a phone this size. It launched in China on 21 September 2026 and globally on 27 October. It isn\'t sold in Nepal yet.</p>\n<p>The cameras are a 50MP main, a 50MP ultra wide and a 64MP Zeiss APO telephoto at 85mm, which suits portraits. Charging is 90W wired and 40W wireless.</p>\n<p>Our Nepal estimate is about <strong>Rs 2,09,999</strong>, slightly above the <a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a>\'s Rs 1,99,999. Reported European prices start at about €1,299. If you want the bigger 200MP telephoto, look at the <a href=\"/products/vivo-x500-pro-max\">X500 Pro Max</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the vivo X500 Pro a compact phone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a 6.36-inch screen, which is small for a 2026 flagship, and still has a 6,510mAh battery.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the vivo X500 Pro cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 2,09,999. vivo Nepal has not announced a price.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"9to5Google \\u2013 vivo X500 series launches globally\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/9to5google.com\\/2026\\/10\\/27\\/vivos-x500-series-launches-globally\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Gizchina \\u2013 vivo X500 series goes global from \\u20ac1,299\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gizchina.com\\/vivo-phones\\/vivo-x500-series-goes-global-with-european-prices-starting-at-eur1299\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Gizmochina \\u2013 vivo X500 series roundup\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gizmochina.com\\/2026\\/09\\/09\\/vivo-x500-series-roundup-specs-leaks-and-launch-details\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:13'),(2397,5,2,'OPPO Find X10 Pro Max','oppo-find-x10-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/oppo-find-x10-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-10-21','announced','Launched globally 21 Oct 2026; Nepal availability not announced',0,0,'<p>The OPPO Find X10 Pro Max is the first phone with three 200MP rear cameras. OPPO announced it in China in September 2026 and launched it globally on 21 October. There\'s no \"Find X10 Pro\": this year OPPO sells the Find X10E, Find X10 and Find X10 Pro Max.</p>\n<p>It has MediaTek\'s 2nm Dimensity 9600 Pro, a 6.78-inch 144Hz screen and an 8,000mAh battery with 80W charging.</p>\n<h3>Will it come to Nepal?</h3>\n<p>OPPO Nepal hasn\'t announced it, and OPPO\'s recent Find flagships have mostly reached Nepal through importers rather than official channels. If it does arrive officially, we expect about <strong>Rs 2,39,999</strong>, based on the reported €1,799 European price and $1,599 import price. OPPO\'s official line-up in Nepal is the Reno series. The <a href=\"/products/oppo-reno-16-5g\">OPPO Reno 16 5G</a> costs Rs 1,09,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the OPPO Find X10 Pro Max have three 200MP cameras?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The main, telephoto and ultra wide cameras are all 200MP.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there an OPPO Find X10 Pro?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 2026 line-up is the Find X10E, Find X10 and Find X10 Pro Max.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the Find X10 Pro Max cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"If it launches officially, we expect about Rs 2,39,999. OPPO Nepal has not announced it.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"TechRepublic \\u2013 OPPO Find X10 Pro Max cheat sheet\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.techrepublic.com\\/article\\/news-oppo-find-x10-pro-max-cheat-sheet\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"My Mobile India \\u2013 Find X10 Pro Max launched globally\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.mymobileindia.com\\/oppo-find-x10-pro-max-launched-globally-with-worlds-first-triple-200mp-camera-system-price-specs-and-features\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Gizmochina \\u2013 Find X10 Pro Max global version pre-sale\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gizmochina.com\\/2026\\/10\\/21\\/oppo-find-x10-pro-max-global-version-giztop\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"DXOMARK \\u2013 OPPO Find X10 Pro Max (testing pending)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dxomark.com\\/smartphones\\/Oppo\\/Find-X10-Pro-Max\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:13'),(2398,38,2,'Honor Magic 9 Pro Max','honor-magic-9-pro-max',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,219999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-09-28','announced','Launched in China Sep 2026; Europe expected January 2027',0,0,'<p>Honor launched the Magic 9 series in Beijing on 28 September 2026. This year there\'s no plain \"Magic 9 Pro\": the models are the Magic 9, the Magic 9 Pro Max and a Super Edition. The Pro Max is the one most likely to come to Nepal, as the successor to the <a href=\"/products/honor-magic-8-pro\">Honor Magic 8 Pro</a> (Rs 1,99,999).</p>\n<p>It has a 6.8-inch LTPO OLED, the Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6, two 200MP cameras (main and telephoto), a 50MP ultra wide and a 55MP selfie camera. The Chinese model has an 8,800mAh battery. Hong Kong listings for the global version show about 8,000mAh.</p>\n<p>Reports point to a European launch in January 2027 at around €1,499. Our Nepal estimate is about <strong>Rs 2,19,999</strong>. It isn\'t official yet.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is there an Honor Magic 9 Pro?\",\"answer\":\"Not as a separate model. Honor launched the Magic 9, Magic 9 Pro Max and Magic 9 Super Edition.\"},{\"question\":\"When will the Honor Magic 9 Pro Max launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Honor has not announced a date. Reports point to Europe in January 2027, and Nepal launches usually follow the international launch.\"},{\"question\":\"What will it cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 2,19,999, based on the Magic 8 Pro\'s Nepal price and the reported \\u20ac1,499 European price.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"PhoneArena \\u2013 Honor Magic 9 Pro Max made official\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.phonearena.com\\/news\\/honor-magic-9-pro-max-is-made-official_id183646\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"PhoneDroid \\u2013 Honor Magic 9 Pro Max price and release date\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.phonedroid.net\\/blog\\/honor-magic-9-pro-max-specs\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"TechNetBooks \\u2013 Magic 9 Pro Max global edition\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.technetbooks.com\\/2026\\/11\\/honor-magic-9-pro-max-global-edition.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:12'),(2399,4,2,'OnePlus 16','oneplus-16',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,199999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-10-12','announced','Launched in China 12 Oct 2026; global/India launch expected late 2026 to January 2027',0,1,'<p>OnePlus launched the OnePlus 16 in China on 12 October 2026. It has the Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6, a 185Hz screen (the highest refresh rate on any OnePlus), a 200MP main camera with a 50MP 3x telephoto, and a 9,000mAh battery with 100W charging.</p>\n<p>OnePlus hasn\'t confirmed the global or India launch. Reports range from the end of 2026 to January 2027. Global models sometimes get a smaller battery than the Chinese version, so check the final spec sheet.</p>\n<p>Our Nepal estimate is about <strong>Rs 1,99,999</strong>, a little above the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-15\">OnePlus 15</a>\'s Rs 1,89,999. In China it starts at CNY 5,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When will the OnePlus 16 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"OnePlus has not announced a global or Nepal date. It launched in China on 12 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What will the OnePlus 16 cost in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Our estimate is about Rs 1,99,999. It is not official.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"Android Authority \\u2013 OnePlus 16 launch date\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.androidauthority.com\\/oneplus-16-launch-date-3715892\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"tech-ish \\u2013 OnePlus 16 confirmed specs and price\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/tech-ish.com\\/2026\\/09\\/24\\/oneplus-16-confirmed-with-snapdragon-8-elite-extreme-gen-6-specs-colours-price-and-launch-details\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"TelecomTalk \\u2013 OnePlus 16 India launch\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/telecomtalk.info\\/oneplus16-indialaunch-top3reasons-why-you-should-wait\\/1013173\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,7,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:08'),(2400,1,2,'Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 9','samsung-galaxy-z-fold9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,279999.00,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'upcoming','July 2027 (Samsung\'s usual Unpacked timing)',0,0,'<p>Samsung hasn\'t announced the Galaxy Z Fold 9. Samsung has launched its foldables every July, so July 2027 is the likely date. Reports so far say:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>There will be a <strong>Fold 9 and a Fold 9 Ultra</strong>, like this year\'s <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-z-fold8\">Z Fold 8</a> and <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-z-fold-8-ultra\">Z Fold 8 Ultra</a>.</li>\n<li>The wider, passport-style 4:3 shape stays.</li>\n<li>No S Pen support is expected.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It\'s early, so treat all of this as rumour. Our placeholder Nepal estimate is <strong>Rs 2,79,999</strong>, a little above the Z Fold 8\'s Rs 2,74,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When will the Galaxy Z Fold 9 launch?\",\"answer\":\"Samsung has not confirmed it. Based on past launches, July 2027 is most likely.\"},{\"question\":\"Should I wait for the Z Fold 9?\",\"answer\":\"If you need a phone now, the Z Fold 8 is on sale in Nepal at Rs 2,74,999. The Fold 9 is more than six months away.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"PhoneArena \\u2013 Galaxy Z Fold 9 release date expectations\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.phonearena.com\\/galaxy-z-fold-9-release-date-price-features-news\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"Gulf News \\u2013 Galaxy Z Fold 9 leaks\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/gulfnews.com\\/technology\\/samsung-galaxy-z-fold-9-leaks-hidden-camera-s-pen-ultra-model-and-everything-we-know-1.500707251\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2026-11-23 08:07:21','2026-11-24 01:00:13'),(2401,2,2,'Apple iPhone XS Max','apple-iphone-xs-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-iphone-xs-max.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$1,099 US launch price (64GB)','2018-09-21','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple iPhone XS Max launched on 21 September 2018 at $1,099 in the US (64GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It was the first \"Max\" iPhone: the XS with a 6.5-inch screen, the biggest Apple had made at the time.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.5-inch Super Retina OLED, 2688 x 1242 screen and the Apple A12 Bionic (7nm). Cameras: 12MP wide + 12MP 2x telephoto, with a 7MP TrueDepth selfie camera. Battery: 3174mAh, 15W wired (5W charger in the box), Qi wireless charging. Notable: Stainless steel frame, IP68, Face ID.</p>\n<p>DXOMARK has not published a main camera score for it; its page lists selfie 105.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> (Rs 2,59,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Apple iPhone XS Max released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 21 September 2018.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Apple iPhone XS Max launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $1,099 in the US (64GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple iPhone XS Max use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple A12 Bionic (7nm).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"DXOMARK \\u2013 Apple iPhone XS Max\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dxomark.com\\/smartphones\\/Apple\\/iPhone-XS-Max\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2018-09-20 18:15:00','2018-09-20 18:15:00'),(2402,2,2,'Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max','apple-iphone-11-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-iphone-11-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$1,099 US launch price (64GB)','2019-09-20','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max launched on 20 September 2019 at $1,099 in the US (64GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.5-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 2688 x 1242 screen and the Apple A13 Bionic (7nm). Cameras: 12MP wide + 12MP ultra wide + 12MP 2x telephoto, with a 12MP TrueDepth selfie camera. Battery: 3969mAh, 18W fast charger in the box, Qi wireless charging. Notable: Matte glass back, stainless steel frame, IP68 (4m), Night mode.</p>\n<p>DXOMARK gave it a camera score of 122 under its version-5 test protocol, so compare it only with other v5 scores, not with phones tested under the current version 6. Its display scored 122.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> (Rs 2,59,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 20 September 2019.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $1,099 in the US (64GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple A13 Bionic (7nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max DXOMARK camera score?\",\"answer\":\"DXOMARK scored its camera 122 (version-5 protocol).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"DXOMARK \\u2013 Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dxomark.com\\/smartphones\\/Apple\\/iPhone-11-Pro-Max\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2019-09-19 18:15:00','2019-09-19 18:15:00'),(2403,2,2,'Apple iPhone 12 Pro','apple-iphone-12-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-iphone-12-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$999 US launch price (128GB)','2020-10-23','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple iPhone 12 Pro launched on 23 October 2020 at $999 in the US (128GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 2532 x 1170 screen and the Apple A14 Bionic (5nm). Cameras: 12MP wide + 12MP ultra wide + 12MP 2x telephoto + LiDAR, with a 12MP TrueDepth selfie camera. Battery: 2815mAh, 20W wired, 15W MagSafe charging. Notable: 5G, Ceramic Shield, flat stainless steel sides, IP68, MagSafe.</p>\n<p>DXOMARK gave it a camera score of 127 under its version-5 test protocol, so compare it only with other v5 scores, not with phones tested under the current version 6. Its display scored 124.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> (Rs 2,59,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Apple iPhone 12 Pro released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 23 October 2020.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Apple iPhone 12 Pro launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $999 in the US (128GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple iPhone 12 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple A14 Bionic (5nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple iPhone 12 Pro DXOMARK camera score?\",\"answer\":\"DXOMARK scored its camera 127 (version-5 protocol).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"DXOMARK \\u2013 Apple iPhone 12 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dxomark.com\\/smartphones\\/Apple\\/iPhone-12-Pro\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2020-10-22 18:15:00','2020-10-22 18:15:00'),(2404,2,2,'Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max','apple-iphone-12-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-iphone-12-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$1,099 US launch price (128GB)','2020-11-13','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max launched on 13 November 2020 at $1,099 in the US (128GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 2778 x 1284 screen and the Apple A14 Bionic (5nm). Cameras: 12MP wide with sensor-shift stabilisation + 12MP ultra wide + 12MP 2.5x telephoto + LiDAR, with a 12MP TrueDepth selfie camera. Battery: 3687mAh, 20W wired, 15W MagSafe charging. Notable: 5G, Ceramic Shield, IP68, MagSafe; first iPhone with sensor-shift stabilisation.</p>\n<p>DXOMARK gave it a camera score of 131 under its version-5 test protocol, so compare it only with other v5 scores, not with phones tested under the current version 6. Its display scored 127.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> (Rs 2,59,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 13 November 2020.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $1,099 in the US (128GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple A14 Bionic (5nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max DXOMARK camera score?\",\"answer\":\"DXOMARK scored its camera 131 (version-5 protocol).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"DXOMARK \\u2013 Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dxomark.com\\/smartphones\\/Apple\\/iPhone-12-Pro-Max\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2020-11-12 18:15:00','2020-11-12 18:15:00'),(2405,1,2,'Samsung Galaxy S10+','samsung-galaxy-s10-plus',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$999 US launch price (8GB/128GB)','2019-03-08','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy S10+ launched on 8 March 2019 at $999 in the US (8GB/128GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.4-inch Dynamic AMOLED, QHD+, Infinity-O punch-hole screen and the Exynos 9820 (8nm) in Asia including Nepal; Snapdragon 855 in the US and China. Cameras: 12MP dual-aperture main + 12MP 2x telephoto + 16MP ultra wide, with a 10MP + 8MP depth selfie camera. Battery: 4100mAh, 15W wired, 15W wireless, reverse wireless charging. Notable: Ultrasonic in-display fingerprint, headphone jack, IP68.</p>\n\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26\">Samsung Galaxy S26</a> (Rs 1,39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra</a> (Rs 2,24,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Samsung Galaxy S10+ released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 8 March 2019.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Samsung Galaxy S10+ launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $999 in the US (8GB\\/128GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy S10+ use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Exynos 9820 (8nm) in Asia including Nepal; Snapdragon 855 in the US and China.\"}]','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2019-03-07 18:15:00','2019-03-07 18:15:00'),(2406,1,2,'Samsung Galaxy Note20 Ultra','samsung-galaxy-note20-ultra',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$1,299 US launch price (12GB/128GB 5G)','2020-08-21','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Note20 Ultra launched on 21 August 2020 at $1,299 in the US (12GB/128GB 5G). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and 