rice in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen 7 6800H is a 45W-class AMD performance chip that\'s comfortable with coding, content work and pairing with a dedicated GPU for games. The NVIDIA RTX 3050 with 4GB of VRAM is an entry gaming GPU: esports titles run at high frame rates, and most big games are playable at 1080p medium with DLSS turned on. 16GB of RAM is comfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>Its 15.6-inch Full HD 144Hz display makes games and even scrolling look smooth. It carries a 56Wh battery and weighs about 2.1 kg. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 2 Year international Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the ASUS ROG Strix G15 G513RC (Ryzen 7 6800H, 16GB\\/512GB, RTX 3050) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,57,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the ASUS ROG Strix G15 G513RC run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"Graphics come from the NVIDIA RTX 3050 with 4GB of VRAM. Expect smooth Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite, and 1080p medium settings in heavier AAA games.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this ASUS ROG Strix G15 G513RC?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G15 G513RC Ryzen 7 6800H Processor 16GB RAM 512GB SSD NVIDIA RTX 3050 4GB G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g15-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-g15-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:0