n X Plus | 16\\u202fGB LPDDR5X | 256\\u202fGB NVMe | 13.4\\u2033 2K 120\\u202fHz IPS |\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-xps-13-9345-snapdragon-x-plus-16gb-256gb-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-xps-13-9345-snapdragon-x-plus-16gb-256gb-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2834,9,3,'Dell XPS 15 9530 (Core i9-13900H, 32GB/1TB, RTX 4060)','dell-xps-15-9530-core-i9-13900h-32gb-1tb-rtx-4060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-xps-15-9530-core-i9-13900h-32gb-1tb-rtx-4060.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 4,41,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Dell XPS 15 9530 configuration is built for games first: ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 4,41,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core i9-13900H is a 13th-gen H-series chip with enough cores and clock speed for programming, editing and gaming alongside a dedicated GPU. With the NVIDIA RTX 4060 with 8GB of VRAM, most current games run at 1080p high, and esports titles can use a high-refresh screen properly. 32GB of RAM is generous: large projects, virtual machines and big Photoshop or video timelines are all fine. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch 3.5K OLED screen is a highlight: true blacks, rich colour and excellent contrast for films and photo work; it is also a touchscreen. It carries a 86Wh battery and weighs about 1.92 kg. Ports include USB-C. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 2 Year Global Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Dell XPS 15 9530 (Core i9-13900H, 32GB\\/1TB, RTX 4060) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 4,41,000.