lots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion Pro 7i Core i9 14900HX | 32GB RAM | 1TB SSD | RTX 4090 |16\\\" WQXGA 240Hz disp\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-7i-core-i9-rtx-4090-laptop-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-pro-7i-core-i9-rtx-4090-laptop-price-nepal',NULL,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2896,39,3,'Lenovo Legion R7000 (Ryzen 7 7735H, 16GB/512GB, RTX 4060)','lenovo-legion-r7000-ryzen-7-7735h-16gb-512gb-rtx-4060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-r7000-ryzen-7-7735h-16gb-512gb-rtx-4060.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,57,499 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>Lenovo Legion R7000 (Ryzen 7 7735H, 16GB/512GB, RTX 4060) is a gaming laptop that ONIN Infosys sold in Nepal for Rs 1,57,499. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen 7 7735H is a 45W-class AMD performance chip that\'s comfortable with coding, content work and pairing with a dedicated GPU for games. The NVIDIA RTX 4060 with 8GB of VRAM is the sweet spot for 1080p gaming: high settings in most new games, and it\'s also good for Blender, Premiere and local AI tools. 16GB of RAM is comfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>Its 15.6-inch Full HD 165Hz display makes games and even scrolling look smooth. It carries a 60Wh battery and weighs about 2.4 kg, so it is better suited to a desk than daily commuting. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 Years Official Warranty (with VAT bill