 sensible spec sheet and business-line build. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 97,499. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core i5-13420H is a 13th-gen H-series chip with enough cores and clock speed for programming, editing and gaming alongside a dedicated GPU. With 8GB of memory it copes with everyday multitasking. Heavier users should plan an upgrade to 16GB if the board allows it. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) panel uses a 16:10 shape, so you see more of each web page or document without scrolling. The battery is rated at 60Wh. Ports include USB-C, HDMI, Ethernet and a card reader. It suits office staff, accountants and students who care more about a good keyboard and reliability than about looks.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 year official warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL (Core i5-13420H, 8GB\\/512GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 97,499. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6 IRL (21KG00U0AK) | Intel Core i5-13420H | 16GB DDR5 | 512GB SSD | 1\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkbook-14-g6-price-nepal-21kg00u0ak\",\"accessed\":\"2