 2.3 kg, so it is better suited to a desk than daily commuting. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Lenovo Legion Pro 5 (Ryzen 7 8745HX, 24GB\\/1TB, RTX 5060) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 2,54,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Lenovo Legion Pro 5 run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"With the NVIDIA RTX 5060 with 8GB of VRAM, most current games run at 1080p high, and esports titles can use a high-refresh screen properly.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Lenovo Legion Pro 5?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN\'s spec sheet lists support for up to 32GB. Check whether the existing memory uses one slot or two before buying an upgrade.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo legion Pro 5 Ryzen 7 8745HX | RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 | 24GB DDR5 RAM | 1TB SSD| 16\\\" WQX\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-5-ryzen-7-8745hx-rtx-5060-24gb-1tb-oled-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-pro-5-ryzen-7-8745hx-rtx-5060-24gb-1tb-oled-price-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2913,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 3 (Core i5-1235U, 8GB/256GB)','lenovo-ideapad-3-core-i5-1235u-8gb-256gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-3-core-i5-1235u-8gb-256gb.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 75,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>For school, college and office work, this Lenovo IdeaPad 3 configuration was listed by ONIN Infosys at Rs 75,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core i5-1235U is a 12th-gen low-power chip suited to office w