ing?\",\"answer\":\"For casual games, yes. At 100Hz it isn\'t made for competitive esports, where 144Hz or faster is better.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI Pro Mp223 22\\\" Business Monitor for work and Home\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp223-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp223-monitor-price-in-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2976,48,38,'MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor','msi-optix-g24c6-24-inch-curved-gaming-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-optix-g24c6-24-inch-curved-gaming-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 28,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>For gamers who want smoother motion than a standard 60Hz screen, MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor offers 144Hz. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 28,000. MSI has since retired its Optix line, so this is now an older model and Rs 28,000 is its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The panel is 23.6-inch Full HD VA 144Hz. VA panels give deeper blacks and higher contrast than IPS, which suits films and dark game scenes, but colours shift a little at wide angles. At 144Hz, motion is far smoother than on a 60Hz screen. You\'ll need a graphics card that can push high frame rates to benefit fully, and the 1ms response time keeps fast motion sharp. The 1500R curve wraps the edges of the screen towards you, which feels more immersive in games and reduces eye travel on wide panels.</p>\n<p>It suits gamers who want smoother play, and anyone who notices how much nicer high refresh feels for everyday use.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 28,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its 144Hz refresh rate makes fast games look smooth, provided your graphics card can reach high frame rates.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI optix G24C6 Curved Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-g24c6-curved-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-g24c6-curved-monitor-price-in-nepal',NULL,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2977,1,38,'Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor','samsung-s31c-27-inch-full-hd-essential-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-s31c-27-inch-full-hd-essential-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,35000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor is a practical desk monitor for work-from-home setups and offices. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 35,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The panel is 27-inch Full HD 75Hz. Full HD stretched to 27 inches looks a little soft for text up close. It\'s fine for games and video, but QHD is better for office work at this size.</p>\n<p>It suits home offices, students and businesses that want a reliable second screen for a laptop.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 35,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"For casual games, yes. At 75Hz it isn\'t made for competitive esports, where 144Hz or faster is better.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 samsung 27\\\" s31c Essential desktop monitor FHD (1920 x 1080) Display\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/samsung-27-desktop-monitor-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/samsung-27-desktop-monitor-in-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2978,40,40,'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT OC Edition 16GB GDDR6','asus-prime-radeon-rx-9070-xt-oc-edition-16gb-gddr6','graphics-card','gadgets/2026/asus-prime-radeon-rx-9070-xt-oc-edition-16gb-gddr6.webp',NULL,NULL,137500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 is AMD\'s high-end RDNA 4 card for 1440p and 4K gaming, with much-improved ray tracing and FSR 4 upscaling. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 1,37,500. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>This ASUS version of the Radeon RX 9070 XT adds a factory overclock. Plan for a quality power supply of at least 750W (AMD\'s guidance for the Radeon RX 9070 XT), and check the card\'s length against your case before buying.</p>\n<p>It suits gamers who want high-end performance without paying for NVIDIA\'s top cards, and Linux users who value AMD\'s open-source drivers.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What power supply does the ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 need?\",\"answer\":\"Plan for at least 750W from a reputable brand, and check the connector your card uses.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,37,500. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT OC Edition 16GB GDDR6\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-prime-rx9070xt-o16g-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-prime-rx9070xt-o16g-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2979,101,41,'Lexar NM610 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD','lexar-nm610-pro-1tb-nvme-ssd','ssd','gadgets/2026/lexar-nm610-pro-1tb-nvme-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,22999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lexar NM610 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD is an M.2 2280 NVMe SSD on PCIe Gen3 ×4. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 22,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>Gen3 NVMe is still several times faster than a SATA SSD and far faster than a hard drive, which is plenty for Windows, apps and most games. Sequential reads are rated at up to 3300MB/s. 1TB is the sweet spot for a gaming or work PC\'s main drive. Check that your laptop or motherboard has a free M.2 slot that supports NVMe (not only SATA) before buying, and clone your old drive with free tools if you\'re upgrading.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the Lexar NM610 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD work in my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"If your laptop has an M.2 2280 slot with NVMe support, yes. Check the laptop\'s manual or a teardown first.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the Lexar NM610 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 22,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lexar NM610 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD \\u2013 3300MB\\/s PCIe Gen3x4\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lexar-nm610-pro-nvme-ssd-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lexar-nm610-pro-nvme-ssd-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2980,110,41,'PNY 1TB CS2241 M.2 NVMe Gen4 x4 Internal SSD','pny-1tb-cs2241-m-2-nvme-gen4-x4-internal-ssd','ssd','gadgets/2026/pny-1tb-cs2241-m-2-nvme-gen4-x4-internal-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,27999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The PNY 1TB CS2241 M.2 NVMe Gen4 x4 Internal SSD is an M.2 2280 NVMe SSD on PCIe Gen4 ×4. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 27,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN bef