z Desktop Gaming RAM (MD8GD4320016XR) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 10,599. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop Gaming RAM (MD8GD4320016XR)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-gaming-ram-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-gaming-ram-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2998,110,40,'PNY XLR8 Gaming 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (MD16GD4320016XR)','pny-xlr8-gaming-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-md16gd4320016xr','memory','gadgets/2026/pny-xlr8-gaming-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-md16gd4320016xr.webp',NULL,NULL,21099.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The PNY XLR8 Gaming 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (MD16GD4320016XR) is DDR4 desktop memory (UDIMM) rated at 3200MT/s. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 21,099. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>A single 16GB module. Add a matching second module for dual-channel mode, which gives a real boost to integrated graphics and some games. It\'s from PNY\'s XLR8 gaming line, which adds a heat spreader, with an XMP profile you enable in the BIOS to reach the rated speed. Make sure your motherboard takes DDR4: DDR4 and DDR5 modules aren\'t interchangeable.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the PNY XLR8 Gaming 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (MD16GD4320016XR) fit my PC?\",\"answer\":\"Only if it uses DDR4 desktop DIMM slots. Check your motherboard specifications or open the panel to see the existing memory.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the PNY XLR8 Gaming 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (MD16GD4320016XR) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 21,099. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY XLR8 Gaming 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (MD16GD4320016XR)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-xlr8-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-xlr8-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2999,110,40,'PNY XLR8 Gaming EPIC-X RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM','pny-xlr8-gaming-epic-x-rgb-32gb-2x16gb-ddr5-6400mhz-desktop-ram','memory','gadgets/2026/pny-xlr8-gaming-epic-x-rgb-32gb-2x16gb-ddr5-6400mhz-desktop-ram.webp',NULL,NULL,41999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The PNY XLR8 Gaming EPIC-X RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM is DDR5 desktop memory (UDIMM) rated at 6400MT/s. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 41,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>It is a kit of 2 × 16GB modules, so it fills two slots and runs in dual-channel straight away, which matters for integrated graphics and games. It\'s from PNY\'s XLR8 gaming line, which adds a heat spreader and RGB lighting, with an Intel XMP/AMD EXPO profile you enable in the BIOS to reach the rated speed. Make sure your motherboard takes DDR5: DDR4 and DDR5 modules aren\'t interchangeable.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the PNY XLR8 Gaming EPIC-X RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM fit my PC?\",\"answer\":\"Only if it uses DDR5 desktop DIMM slots. Check your motherboard specifications or open the panel to see the existing memory.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the PNY XLR8 Gaming EPIC-X RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 41,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY XLR8 Gaming EPIC-X RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-xlr8-epic-x-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6400mhz-desktop-ram-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-xlr8-epic-x-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6400mhz-desktop-ram-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3000,89,42,'Rapoo M20 Wireless Mouse','rapoo-m20-wireless-mouse','mouse','gadgets/2026/rapoo-m20-wireless-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,900.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo M20 is a simple, budget 2.4GHz wireless mouse for laptops and office desks. ONIN Infosys listed it at only Rs 900. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Plug the tiny USB receiver in and it works without drivers, with a range of up to 10 metres. The sensor tops out at 1,000 DPI, which is plenty for documents, browsing and spreadsheets, though gamers will want something faster. It runs on a single AA battery at very low power draw, so a battery lasts months with ordinary use, and Rapoo rates the buttons for 3 million clicks.</p>\n<p>It suits students, office staff and anyone who finds a laptop touchpad tiring. If you want quieter clicks, Bluetooth for a tablet, or a higher DPI for a big monitor, look at Rapoo\'s multi-mode models instead.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Rapoo M20 need drivers?\",\"answer\":\"No. It\'s plug-and-play through its 2.4GHz USB receiver.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Rapoo M20\'s DPI?\",\"answer\":\"1,000 DPI, according to ONIN\'s listing. That\'s fine for office work and browsing.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO M20 Wireless Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-m20-wireless-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-m20-wireless-mouse','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3001,89,42,'Rapoo N200 Wired Optical Mouse','rapoo-n200-wired-optical-mouse','mouse','gadgets/2026/rapoo-n200-wired-optical-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,560.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo N200 is a basic wired USB mouse: no batteries, no pairing, just plug it in and work. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 560. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Its 1,600 DPI optical sensor is a step up from the usual 1,000 DPI office mouse, so the pointer covers a large or second monitor without lifting your hand as often. It has three buttons, including a non-slip scroll wheel, and a symmetrical shape that works for left- and right-handed users.</p>\n<p>It\'s a good choice for computer labs, cyber cafés, offices and desktop PCs where a mouse should simply keep working. It works with Windows XP through Windows 10 and later without extra software.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the DPI of the Rapoo N200?\",\"answer\":\"1,600 DPI, according to ONIN\'s listing.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Rapoo N200 wireless?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is a wired USB mouse, so it never needs batteries.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo N200 Wired optical Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-n200-wired-optical-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-n200-wired-optical-mouse','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3002,93,42,'UGEE M708 V3 Drawing Tablet','ugee-m708-v3-drawing-tablet','graphics-tablet','gadgets/2026/ugee-m708-v3-drawing-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,7500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The UGEE M708 V3 is a large, affordable pen tablet for beginners in digital art, photo retouching and online teaching. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 7,500. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Its 10 × 6-inch active area is generous for the price, giving you room for full arm strokes instead of cramped wrist movements. The pen senses 16,384 pressure levels and 60° of tilt, and the tablet reads at 5,080 LPI with a 266RPS report rate, so lines follow your hand closely. Eight shortcut keys can be set to undo, brush size or zoom.</p>\n<p>It connects over micro USB and works with Windows 7 or later, macOS 10.10 or later and Chrome OS 88 or later, so it also suits teachers writing on Google Meet or Zoom whiteboards. At about 8 mm thick, it slips into a laptop bag. Keep in mind that it has no screen, so you draw while looking at your monitor, which takes a few days to get used to.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the UGEE M708 good for beginners?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a large 10 \\u00d7 6-inch area, 16,384 pressure levels and tilt, at a low price. You draw while looking at your monitor.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the UGEE M708 work with Chromebooks?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists compatibility with Chrome OS 88 or later, as well as Windows and macOS.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 UGEE M708 V3 Digital Drawing Tablet (10x6 Inch Active Area)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/ugee-m708-drawing-tablet-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/ugee-m708-drawing-tablet-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3003,94,42,'XP-PEN Artist 13.3 Pro V2 Pen Display','xp-pen-artist-13-3-pro-v2-pen-display','graphics-tablet','gadgets/2026/xp-pen-artist-13-3-pro-v2-pen-display.webp',NULL,NULL,50999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XP-PEN Artist 13.3 Pro V2 is a pen display, so you draw directly on a screen instead of on a blank tablet. That makes it far more natural for illustration, comics and design work. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 50,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>The 13.3-inch Full HD laminated panel has an anti-glare finish and an active area of about 11.6 × 6.5 inches. Lamination brings the pen tip and the cursor closer together, so lines land where you expect. The battery-free X3 Pro stylus senses 16,384 pressure levels and 60° tilt with ±0.4 mm accuracy, and eight express keys handle your shortcuts.</p>\n<p>Two USB-C ports make the connection simpler on modern laptops, and it works with Windows, macOS, Linux and Android 6.0 or later. At under 13 mm thick, it suits illustrators, animation students and designers who want a portable screen tablet without paying for a large studio display.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the XP-PEN Artist 13.3 Pro V2 need to be charged?\",\"answer\":\"The stylus doesn\'t. The X3 Pro pen is battery-free. The display is powered over its USB-C connection.\"},{\"question\":\"Which operating systems does it support?\",\"answer\":\"Windows 7 or later, macOS 10.10 or later, Linux and Android 6.0 or later, according to ONIN\'s listing.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Artist 13.3 Pro V2 Pen Display - 13.3\\\" FHD (Active area 11.6\\\" \\u00d7 6.5\\\")\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-artist-13-3-pro-v2-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-artist-13-3-pro-v2-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3004,94,42,'XP-PEN Deco mini7 V2 Drawing Tablet','xp-pen-deco-mini7-v2-drawing-tablet','graphics-tablet','gadgets/2026/xp-pen-deco-mini7-v2-drawing-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,8550.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XP-PEN Deco mini7 V2 is a compact pen tablet with a 7 × 4.37-inch active area, small enough for a crowded desk or a backpack. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 8,550. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It has the same 16,384-level pressure sensitivity and ±60° tilt as XP-PEN\'s larger tablets, with a battery-free stylus that never needs charging, a 5,080 LPI resolution and around 220RPS report rate. Eight customisable express keys sit along the side. The whole tablet weighs about 307 g and is just over 9 mm thick.</p>\n<p>It plugs in over USB-C and works with Windows, macOS, Linux, Android 10 or later and apps such as Photoshop, Clip Studio, Krita, GIMP and SAI. The box includes the pen, a pen clip and 10 spare nibs. It suits students, note-takers and beginners in digital art who work on a laptop screen, where a smaller area matches the display better.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How big is the XP-PEN Deco mini7 V2\'s drawing area?\",\"answer\":\"7 \\u00d7 4.37 inches, which suits laptop screens and small desks.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with Android phones?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists support for Android 10 or later over USB-C, as well as Windows, macOS and Linux.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Deco mini7 V2 - 7 \\u00d7 4.37\\\" Active Area | 16,384 Pressure | 8 Express Keys | USB-C - \",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-deco-mini7-v2-7x4-16384-pressure\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-deco-mini7-v2-7x4-16384-pressure','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3005,96,44,'Canon imageCLASS LBP6030w Wireless Laser Printer','canon-imageclass-lbp6030w-wireless-laser-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-imageclass-lbp6030w-wireless-laser-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,24999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Canon imageCLASS LBP6030w is a small black-and-white laser printer with Wi-Fi, made for homes and small offices that mainly print documents. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 24,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Laser printing suits text: pages come out crisp and smudge-free, and toner doesn\'t dry out when you leave the printer idle for weeks, a common problem with inkjets in Nepal\'s dusty months. It prints at 600 × 600 dpi, and Wi-Fi lets several people print from laptops and phones without passing a USB cable around. A USB 2.0 port is there for a direct connection.</p>\n<p>It only prints, in mono, so you\'ll need a separate scanner or an all-in-one if you scan and copy often. It suits students printing assignments, lawyers, consultants and shop counters that need a reliable document printer with low running costs per page. ONIN lists a 12-month warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Canon LBP6030w print in colour?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is a monochrome (black-and-white) laser printer, designed for documents.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it support wireless printing?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The \\\"w\\\" stands for Wi-Fi, so you can print from laptops and phones on the same network.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Image Class LBP6030w Wireless Monochrome Laserjet Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-lbp6030w-wireless-laserjet-printer-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-lbp6030w-wireless-laserjet-printer-price-in-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3006,96,44,'Canon PIXMA G2020 Ink Tank All-in-One Printer','canon-pixma-g2020-ink-tank-all-in-one-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-pixma-g2020-ink-tank-all-in-one-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,18000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Canon PIXMA G2020 is a refillable ink-tank all-in-one that prints, scans and copies, built for homes and small offices that print a lot and don\'t want to keep buying cartridges. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 18,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Ink tanks cost more upfront than cartridge printers, but the bottles print thousands of pages, so the cost per page is very low. That\'s ideal for school assignments, notes and office copies. The front-facing tanks let you see the ink levels at a glance, and refilling is mess-free with Canon\'s keyed bottles. It connects over USB and weighs about 6.3 kg.</p>\n<p>It suits families with school-going children, tuition centres and small offices printing mostly text with some colour. If you need wireless printing from phones, an ADF for multi-page scans or automatic duplex, look at the G3000 or G4000 series instead. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Canon G2020 scan and copy?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is an all-in-one ink-tank printer that prints, scans and copies.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Canon G2020 have Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"No. It connects over USB. Canon\'s G3000-series models add wireless printing.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Pixma G2020 Color All-in-One Ink Tank Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-g2020-color-printer-price-nepal-2024\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-g2020-color-printer-price-nepal-2024','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3007,96,44,'Canon PIXMA G2730 Ink Tank All-in-One Printer','canon-pixma-g2730-ink-tank-all-in-one-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-pixma-g2730-ink-tank-all-in-one-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,21000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Canon PIXMA G2730 is a colour ink-tank all-in-one for homes and offices that print in volume. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 21,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Refillable tanks keep running costs very low compared with cartridge printers, which matters when you print notes, assignments or office files every week. ONIN lists colour print speeds of up to 11 ppm and a maximum monthly duty cycle of 3,000 pages, which is more than most homes and small offices will ever need. Besides printing, it scans and copies.</p>\n<p>It suits households with students, small shops and offices that want cheap colour printing without the hassle of cartridges. Keep it covered when not in use and print a page every few days, so the print head doesn\'t dry out in winter. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How many pages a month can the Canon G2730 handle?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN lists a maximum monthly duty cycle of 3,000 pages.\"},{\"question\":\"Is an ink-tank printer cheaper to run?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Refill bottles print thousands of pages, so the cost per page is much lower than with cartridges.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Pixma G2730 Color All-in-One Ink Tank Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-pixma-g2730-color-printer-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-pixma-g2730-color-printer-in-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3008,96,44,'Canon PIXMA G4780 Wireless MegaTank All-in-One with ADF','canon-pixma-g4780-wireless-megatank-all-in-one-with-adf',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-pixma-g4780-wireless-megatank-all-in-one-with-adf.webp',NULL,NULL,35999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Canon PIXMA G4780 is the office-ready member of Canon\'s MegaTank family: it prints, scans and copies, adds a 35-sheet automatic document feeder, and prints double-sided automatically. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 35,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Canon rates a set of bottles at up to 7,600 mono and 8,100 colour pages in economy mode, so running costs stay very low. It prints at up to 4,800 × 1,200 dpi and approximately 11 ipm mono or 6 ipm colour. The flatbed and ADF scanner handles multi-page contracts and forms without feeding sheets one by one, and a 2.7-inch colour touchscreen makes copying and settings simple.</p>\n<p>Wi-Fi, Wireless Direct, the Canon PRINT app, AirPrint and Mopria let everyone print from phones and laptops, and USB 2.0 is there for a wired connection. It suits small offices, schools, clinics and busy homes that scan and copy as much as they print. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Canon G4780 print double-sided automatically?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports automatic two-sided printing on A4 and Letter paper.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I scan multiple pages at once?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 35-sheet automatic document feeder handles multi-page scans and copies.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Pixma G4780 Wireless All-in-One MegaTank Printer with ADF | Print, Scan, Copy (All-i\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-pixma-g4780-wireless-megatank-printer-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-pixma-g4780-wireless-megatank-printer-nepal','2026-11-23',7,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3009,116,44,'Pantum M6702DW Mono Laser Multifunction Printer','pantum-m6702dw-mono-laser-multifunction-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/pantum-m6702dw-mono-laser-multifunction-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,29000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Pantum M6702DW is a black-and-white laser multifunction printer with automatic duplex printing and Wi-Fi, a strong fit for busy small offices. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 29,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It prints and copies at 30 pages per minute on A4, quick enough for queues of invoices, reports and exam papers, and it prints both sides of the sheet automatically to save paper. A colour flatbed scanner handles documents and ID cards, with copy features such as ID copy, receipt copy, N-up and clone copy. A 525MHz processor and a metal inner frame point to a printer built for daily office use.</p>\n<p>Laser toner doesn\'t dry out the way ink does, so it\'s dependable even if you leave it unused over a holiday. It weighs about 10.3 kg, so give it a solid desk. It suits offices, schools, cooperatives and print counters that mostly handle documents. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How fast is the Pantum M6702DW?\",\"answer\":\"30 pages per minute on A4 for both printing and copying, according to ONIN\'s listing.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it print on both sides automatically?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports automatic duplex printing.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PANTUM M6702DW Mono Laser Duplex Multifunctional Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pantum-m6702dw-mono-laser-duplex-multifunctional-printer-price-nepal-2024\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pantum-m6702dw-mono-laser-duplex-multifunctional-printer-price-nepal-2024','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3010,116,44,'Pantum M6505 Mono Laser Multifunction Printer','pantum-m6505-mono-laser-multifunction-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/pantum-m6505-mono-laser-multifunction-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,24000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Pantum M6505 is an affordable black-and-white laser all-in-one that prints, copies and scans, made for homes and small offices that mainly handle documents. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 24,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It prints and copies at 22 pages per minute, driven by a 600MHz processor, and laser output means sharp text that won\'t smudge. Duplex printing is manual: you flip the stack yourself to print on both sides. Toner also keeps well between jobs, unlike ink, which can dry in the head during long breaks.</p>\n<p>It suits students, home offices and small shops that need a reliable document printer and the occasional scan or copy without paying for colour. It weighs about 7.5 kg. ONIN lists a 12-month warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Pantum M6505 colour?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is a monochrome laser printer that prints, copies and scans.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Pantum M6505 support automatic duplex?\",\"answer\":\"No. Duplex is manual, so you turn the pages over yourself.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Pantum M6505 Mono Multifunctional Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pantum-m6505-printer-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pantum-m6505-printer-price-in-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3011,98,45,'BenQ MS560 Business Projector','benq-ms560-business-projector',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ms560-business-projector.webp',NULL,NULL,56399.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ MS560 is a bright, practical projector for classrooms and meeting rooms. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 56,399. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>Its 4,000 ANSI lumens stand up to rooms that can\'t be fully darkened, which is the norm in Nepali schools and offices. Native resolution is SVGA (800 × 600) in a 4:3 shape. That\'s fine for slides and spreadsheets, but it is not sharp enough for detailed films or fine print. It accepts inputs from VGA up to WUXGA and scales them down. Picture modes include Presentation, Infographic, Spreadsheet and sRGB.</p>\n<p>The lamp is rated at 6,000 hours in Normal mode and up to 15,000 hours in LampSave, which keeps running costs down. A 1.1× zoom, a 1.96–2.15 throw ratio and automatic vertical keystone correction of ±40° make setup easier on a table or ceiling mount. It suits schools, training centres and offices on a budget.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How bright is the BenQ MS560?\",\"answer\":\"4,000 ANSI lumens, bright enough for classrooms and meeting rooms with some ambient light.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ MS560\'s resolution?\",\"answer\":\"Native SVGA (800 \\u00d7 600). It accepts higher-resolution input up to WUXGA but displays it at SVGA.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MS560 Business Projector\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ms560-projector-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ms560-projector-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3012,49,38,'Blackview DCM6 14-inch Portable Monitor','blackview-dcm6-14-inch-portable-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-dcm6-14-inch-portable-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,34949.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview DCM6 is a 14-inch portable monitor that gives your laptop a second screen anywhere: in a café, a hotel room or at a client\'s office. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 34,949. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch IPS panel is Full HD at 60Hz with 300 nits of brightness, so text is sharp and colours hold up at an angle. Two full-featured USB-C ports support DisplayPort Alt Mode and Power Delivery, so with a compatible laptop a single cable carries both picture and power. It has a built-in speaker, an aluminium-alloy and plastic body, and weighs about 1 kg.</p>\n<p>It works with Windows, macOS, Linux, ChromeOS and Android devices that output video over USB-C. It suits programmers, traders, students and anyone who works away from a desk but misses a dual-screen setup. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Blackview DCM6 run on one USB-C cable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, if your laptop\'s USB-C port supports DisplayPort Alt Mode and Power Delivery. One cable then carries both video and power.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the Blackview DCM6?\",\"answer\":\"14-inch Full HD (1920 \\u00d7 1080) IPS at 60Hz with 300 nits brightness.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Blackview DCM6 14\\\" Portable screen - 1080 FHD 60Hz Display, Single Box Speaker, Grey, 1yea\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/blackview-dcm6-14-inch-portable-monitor-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/blackview-dcm6-14-inch-portable-monitor-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3013,110,40,'PNY 16GB XLR8 DDR4 3200MHz Laptop RAM','pny-16gb-xlr8-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram','memory','gadgets/2026/pny-16gb-xlr8-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram.webp',NULL,NULL,18999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The PNY 16GB XLR8 DDR4 3200MHz Laptop RAM is DDR4 SO-DIMM laptop memory rated at 3200MT/s. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 18,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>A single 16GB module. Add a matching second module for dual-channel mode, which gives a real boost to integrated graphics and some games. It\'s from PNY\'s XLR8 gaming line, which adds a heat spreader, with an XMP profile you enable in the BIOS to reach the rated speed. Before you buy, check that your laptop uses removable DDR4 SO-DIMM slots: many thin laptops have memory soldered to the board.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the PNY 16GB XLR8 DDR4 3200MHz Laptop RAM fit my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Only if it uses DDR4 SO-DIMM slots. Check your laptop model specifications or open the panel to see the existing memory.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the PNY 16GB XLR8 DDR4 3200MHz Laptop RAM in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 18,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY 16GB XLR8 DDR4 3200MHz Laptop RAM\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-16gb-xlr8-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-16gb-xlr8-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram-price-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3014,110,40,'PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz SODIMM Laptop RAM (MN8GSD43200XR-RB)','pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-sodimm-laptop-ram-mn8gsd43200xr-rb','memory','gadgets/2026/pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-sodimm-laptop-ram-mn8gsd43200xr-rb.webp',NULL,NULL,10099.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz SODIMM Laptop RAM (MN8GSD43200XR-RB) is DDR4 SO-DIMM laptop memory rated at 3200MT/s. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 10,099. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>A single 8GB module. Add a matching second module for dual-channel mode, which gives a real boost to integrated graphics and some games. It\'s from PNY\'s XLR8 gaming line, which adds a heat spreader, with an XMP profile you enable in the BIOS to reach the rated speed. Before you buy, check that your laptop uses removable DDR4 SO-DIMM slots: many thin laptops have memory soldered to the board.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz SODIMM Laptop RAM (MN8GSD43200XR-RB) fit my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Only if it uses DDR4 SO-DIMM slots. Check your laptop model specifications or open the panel to see the existing memory.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the price of the PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz SODIMM Laptop RAM (MN8GSD43200XR-RB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 10,099. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY XLR8 8GB DDR4 3200MHz SODIMM Laptop RAM (MN8GSD43200XR-RB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-xlr8-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-laptop-ram-price-nepal','2026-11-23',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3015,105,41,'Seagate Expansion 1TB Portable Hard Drive','seagate-expansion-1tb-portable-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/seagate-expansion-1tb-portable-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,13500.00,16000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Seagate Expansion 1TB is a plain, dependable portable hard drive for backing up photos, documents and projects. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 13,500. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It draws power over its USB cable, so there\'s no adapter to carry, and it works with Windows straight away. On a Mac you can reformat it in a minute. A spinning hard drive is slower than a portable SSD and more fragile if dropped, but it costs far less per terabyte, which makes it the sensible choice for backups that mostly sit in a drawer.</p>\n<p>It suits students backing up assignments, families keeping photo archives, and anyone who wants a copy of important files away from their laptop. Keep it in a padded case and avoid moving it while it\'s running. ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Seagate Expansion 1TB work with a Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists it as compatible with Mac and Windows. For full read-write use on a Mac, reformat it to exFAT or APFS.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it need a power adapter?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is a portable drive powered by its USB cable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Seagate Expansion 1TB External Portable Hard Drive\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/seagate-1tb-external-hard-drive-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/seagate-1tb-external-hard-drive-price-in-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(3016,105,41,'Seagate Portable 2TB External Hard Drive','seagate-portable-2tb-external-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/seagate-portable-2tb-external-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,16500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Seagate Portable 2TB is a pocket-sized external hard drive with room for years of photos, videos and backups. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 16,500. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>For only a little more than a 1TB drive, you get twice the space, which is the better buy for most people. It runs from a single USB cable with no power adapter, and it works with Windows out of the box and with macOS after a quick reformat. Hard drives are slower than SSDs and don\'t like being dropped while running, but nothing beats them on price per terabyte.</p>\n<p>It\'s a good fit for photographers clearing memory cards, students saving project files, and anyone who wants a full backup of their laptop with Windows File History or macOS Time Machine.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is 2TB worth it over 1TB?\",\"answer\":\"For most people, yes. ONIN priced the 2TB at Rs 16,500 against Rs 13,500 for the 1TB, so you double the space for a small extra cost.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use the Seagate Portable 2TB for Time Machine?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, after formatting it for macOS. On Windows, it works with File History straight away.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Seagate Portable 2TB External Hard Drive Portable HDD\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/seagate-portable-2tb-external-hard-disk-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/seagate-portable-2tb-external-hard-disk-price-in-nepal','2026-11-23',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00');
