o Max','OPPO','Smartphones','Launched globally 21 Oct 2026; Nepal availability not announced','Rs 239,999',95,'Announced','World\'s first triple 200MP camera','emerald',1,24,'2026-11-23 08:07:22','2026-11-24 07:52:33'),(99,2398,'Honor Magic 9 Pro Max','Honor','Smartphones','Launched in China Sep 2026; Europe expected January 2027','Rs 219,999',95,'Announced','Two 200MP cameras and a huge battery','emerald',1,25,'2026-11-23 08:07:22','2026-11-24 07:52:33'),(100,2399,'OnePlus 16','OnePlus','Smartphones','Launched in China 12 Oct 2026; global/India launch expected late 2026 to January 2027','Rs 199,999',95,'Announced','185Hz screen and 9,000mAh battery','emerald',1,26,'2026-11-23 08:07:22','2026-11-24 07:52:33'),(101,2400,'Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 9','Samsung','Smartphones','July 2027 (Samsung\'s usual Unpacked timing)','Rs 279,999',75,'Expected','Expected July 2027 alongside a Fold 9 Ultra','emerald',1,27,'2026-11-23 08:07:22','2026-11-24 07:52:33');
